  user_input {
    user_response: "build a ea sports fc 27 ultimate team assistant app that resembles many of the features of futbin. i would like you to help me brainstorm, ideate and form other design ideas for integrating player price alerts, squad builder tools, and real-time market data. plus AI-driven recommendations for SBC solutions and profitable investment tracking. must always make sure the data is from ea sports fc 27 ultimate team console and not another game. Also, ensure the UI is optimized for mobile device screen resolutions. i will be using this on my asus zenbook ux482ear.308 and ensure seamless sync with the desktop application for easier squad management. i love using google ai pro, so please integrate Gemini API to analyze market trends and suggest trades. This integration should provide real-time profit optimization insights and actionable player transfer alerts. i love using the paid tiers of antigravity 2.0 desktop app for seamless cross-platform functionality. make sure you are aware of the latest features of this app based on the most up to date firmware version e.g. right now it is 2.24 and i love using the paid tier of google ai studio. for seamless API integration and automated workflow management. i love using mcp connectors, specifically for connecting external databases to my local instance. i love using google workspace integration to manage my documentation directly within the pipeline. i would like to find a way for the app to sync with the changes in my game in terms of new players, the coins and fifa points i have, current promos, new players, current evolutions and sbcs. it should help me complete and recommend solutions to allow these things. it should also help me grind the gallery and track player auction prices in real time.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
