  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Project Scope**\n\nI\'m solidifying the core features for the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant. The focus is on a robust Squad Builder with a sophisticated chemistry system, dynamic squad links, detailed tactics, a bench, and price evaluation, aiming for the 33/33 chemistry target. We\'re integrating a comprehensive player database with a real-time market tracker pulling data directly from the FC 27 console.\n\n\n**Expanding Feature Set**\n\nI\'m now integrating live price charts, price alerts, and market filters for various promo cards like Trailblazers and TOTW. I\'m also delving into AI-driven recommendations for SBC solutions, including fodder solvers and chemistry constraint tools. An AI Market Trader with an investment tracker is being designed, leveraging the Gemini API. Further, I\'m working on live game sync and club tracker functionalities. Responsive design for mobile and desktop is a priority.\n\n\n**Integrating AI and Backend**\n\nI\'m now integrating Gemini models: Argon for complex tasks, Flash for general ones, and Flash-Lite for speed. Firebase will handle authentication via Google Sign-in and data persistence with Firestore. Also, a skill check for planning is [RELEVANT]. I\'m adhering to the instruction that any need for user context must begin with a question via the ask_question tool. I\'ll need to check available skills before planning further.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_725461"
      name: "view_file"
