    thinking: "**Analyzing Artifact Paths**\n\nI\'m currently focused on dissecting the provided artifact directory path. I see the potential target path for the implementation plan is very similar. I\'m noting the crucial differences and similarities between them to identify potential operational implications. The goal is to establish the correct operational procedure.\n\n\n**Defining Implementation Strategy**\n\nI\'ve examined the required sections of the planning document and determined the implementation plan path. My focus now is on incorporating user-specific details, particularly the \"EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app resembling FUTBIN\" aspect and the console market data requirement. The plan is now ready for review in the Plan Approval Curtain.\n\n\n**Developing Feature Components**\n\nI\'m now detailing the application\'s core feature set. I\'m focusing on user-facing elements like real-time market tracking with price alerts and fluctuation charts, alongside squad-building tools like the 33/33 chemistry engine and dynamic player search. AI-driven features, such as SBC solution recommendations and a profitable investment tracker, are also under consideration. I\'m prioritizing user experience and market data accessibility.\n\n\n**Formulating Feature Enhancements**\n\nI\'m now integrating sophisticated market analysis features. I\'m leveraging rapid queries with `gemini-3.8-flash` to offer real-time profit optimization insights, including buy/sell targets, expected ROI%, and tax calculations, considering a 5% EA tax. I\'m also incorporating discard IF safety nets and a Fodder index for informed trading. This includes interactive web companion syncing with auto-save capabilities.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
