      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true, \"Summary\":\"Architectural implementation plan for the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team Assistant App (FUTBIN-style dense terminal with mobile touch optimization, AI high-thinking market trader, 33/33 chemistry squad builder, SBC solver, and club companion sync).\", \"UserFacing\":true}, \"CodeContent\":\"# FC 27 Ultimate Team Assistant & Market Terminal (FUTBIN Pro Edition)\\n\\nA high-performance EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team companion and market intelligence terminal inspired by FUTBIN, featuring real-time console market tracking, a 33/33 chemistry squad builder, AI-driven SBC solutions, an automated Gemini 4 Argon High-Thinking trade advisor, and club inventory sync.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> The following architectural parameters have been established based on your prompt and Phase 1 interactive clarifications:\\n\\n- **Confirmed Trading Engine**: Balanced All-Round Trading Strategy Suite (Fodder fluctuations, high-end meta flips, discard In-Forms, SBC fodder indexing, and promo crash forecasts).\\n- **Confirmed Club Sync Method**: Interactive Web Companion Sync with Auto-Save & Club Import (real-time coin/point balance, untradeable cards pool, active evolution paths, and gallery menu grind automation).\\n- **Confirmed Layout Direction**: Full FUTBIN-Style Dense Desktop Terminal with Side Tickers, optimized for Asus ZenBook UX482 dual-screen workflows and responsive mobile touch displays.\\n- **AI Model Selection**: Server-side Gemini integration featuring `gemini-4-argon` configured with `ThinkingLevel.HIGH` for deep strategic trade reasoning and SBC solve calculations, paired with `gemini-3.8-flash` for instant queries and price alert assessments.\\n- **Database & Auth Integration**: Firebase Authentication (Google Sign-In) and Firestore for real-time cloud persistence of user squads, price alert thresholds, club inventories, and investment ledgers.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Overview & Core Concept\\n\\n### What It Does\\nThe FC 27 Ultimate Team Assistant is a console-exclusive (PlayStation 5 / Xbox Series X|S / PC) market tracker and tactical squad suite. It equips players with:\\n1. **Console Live Market & Price Alerts**: Real-time price action, 24h/7d historical trend charts, 5% EA tax profit calculators, and alert triggers.\\n2. **Tactical 33/33 Chemistry Squad Builder**: Dynamic formation selector, nation/league/club chemistry matrix calculation (including Icon and Hero modifiers), total squad valuation, and chemistry style stat boosts.\\n3. **AI SBC Solver & Fodder Optimizer**: Solves any Squad Building Challenge using the cheapest console market combinations while prioritizing the user\'s untradeable club inventory to spend minimum coins.\\n4. **Gemini High-Thinking Market Advisor**: Leverages `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) to synthesize market index shifts, promo cycles (e.g. Trailblazers, Centurions, TOTW), leak risk, and buy/sell windows with quantified ROI and stop-losses.\\n5. **Interactive Club & Companion Sync**: Tracks live coin reserves, FC points, active evolution progression pathways (stat requirements, games played), and gallery upgrade grind cycles (e.g., 82+ Player Pick loops).\\n\\n### Target Audience & Persona\\nCompetitive FC 27 Ultimate Team players, traders, and SBC grinders operating across mobile devices and dual-screen laptop setups (such as the Asus ZenBook ScreenPad).\\n\\n### Key Value\\nEliminates coin waste on SBCs and bad transfer timing by combining real-time FC 27 market pricing with algorithmic chemistry math and Gemini AI market forecasting.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. User Experience & Visual Design\\n\\n### Key User Flows\\n1. **Market Terminal & Player Radar**: The user scans trending players, price changes, and promo cards. Clicking any card opens the detailed price history chart, price alert setup modal, and 5% EA tax break-even calculator.\\n2. **Squad Builder & Chem Matrix**: The user selects a formation (e.g. 4-3-3, 4-2-3-1), searches cards with live price tags, drops players into slots, and watches the 33/33 chemistry meters update live per club/nation/league.\\n3. **AI SBC Solver**: The user selects an active SBC (e.g., Icon Upgrade, Player of the Month), clicks \\\"Solve with My Club Fodder\\\", and Gemini / algorithmic solver computes the cheapest combination combining club untradeables with market snipes.\\n4. **AI Trade Advisor (High Thinking)**: The user requests trade recommendations based on their current coin balance (e.g. 250k coins). The system runs Gemini 4 Argon with deep thinking mode to generate a prioritized trade ledger (Target Buy, Target Sell, Expected Profit, Risk Rating, Horizon).\\n5. **Companion Club Sync & Evolutions**: The user views their synced coin balance, active evolution tracker (e.g., \\\"Relentless Winger\\\" Stage 2/3), and initiates the \\\"Gallery Grind Loop\\\" simulator to track menu pack recycling.\\n\\n### Visual Identity & Theme\\n- **Aesthetic Direction**: Dense, high-tech EA Sports FC 27 dark terminal aesthetic inspired by FUTBIN, Futhead, and professional financial Bloomberg-style terminals.\\n- **Color Palette**:\\n  - Neutral Canvas: Deep Obsidian / Pitch Dark (`#0a0d14` and `#0f1420`)\\n  - Structural Panels: Dark Slate Surface (`#161d2d`) with refined 1px borders (`#222d42`)\\n  - FC Neon Accent: High-visibility Hyper Emerald (`#00ff87` / `#0df28e`) for chem points, positive margins, and CTAs\\n  - Gold / Special Card Accent: EA FC Gold Metallic (`#e5b94c` / `#ffd700`)\\n  - Warning / EA Tax / Drop: Crisp Crimson (`#ff4d4f`)\\n  - Typography: Condensed athletic heading style paired with monospace tabular figures (`font-mono tabular-nums`) for currency, prices, and chemistry tallies.\\n- **ZenBook Dual-Pane & Mobile Ergonomics**:\\n  - Full-width dense desktop multi-column terminal with collapsible side tickers (Top Gainers, Fodder Index, Live Price Alerts).\\n  - Mobile touch navigation with sticky thumb-friendly bottom bar (Squad, Market, SBCs, Trader, Club) adhering to the 15% sticky cap.\\n  - Large touch targets ($\\\\ge 44\\\\text{px}$) for player swapping, quick-sell/buy simulations, and filter toggles.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\\n\\n- **Decision 1: Real-Time Console Data Grounding**:\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Maintain a dedicated EA Sports FC 27 console player database (ratings, card versions, traits, positions, clubs, nations, leagues, price histories) strictly separate from mobile or legacy FIFA databases.\\n  - *Why*: User explicitly mandated FC 27 console data accuracy; console markets have unique tax, supply curves, and chemistry rules.\\n- **Decision 2: Dual Gemini Intelligence Architecture**:\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Server-side API proxy utilizing `gemini-4-argon` with `ThinkingLevel.HIGH` for deep strategic trading plans and complex SBC constraint solutions, while utilizing `gemini-3.8-flash` for rapid market queries and instant price alert notifications.\\n  - *Why*: Complies with the \\\"Enable high thinking\\\" and \\\"Add Gemini intelligence\\\" requirements while ensuring instantaneous responsiveness for quick queries.\\n- **Decision 3: Firebase Auth & Firestore Persistence**:\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Standard Firebase Auth (Google Sign-In popup) paired with Firestore for persisting user squads, active alerts, investment logs, and club inventories.\\n  - *Why*: Enables seamless synchronization between the user\'s mobile device and desktop ZenBook workstation.\\n- **Decision 4: Interactive Web Companion Sync Engine**:\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Local client + Firestore synchronized state machine with one-click JSON/Clipboard import and simulated live sync engine that updates coins, FC points, promo releases, and evolution milestones.\\n  - *Why*: Provides the user with immediate real-time synchronization capabilities without needing unsafe third-party credentials.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                          CLIENT FRONTEND (React 19)                    \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                                                                        \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202  Dense FUTBIN Header  \342\224\202  \3