2\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                      FIREBASE BACKEND (Auth & Cloud)                   \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                                                                        \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Firebase Auth (Google Sign-In)                                      \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Firestore Collections:                                              \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202    - /users/{userId}/profile (Coins, FC Points, Sync Timestamp)        \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202    - /users/{userId}/squads (Squad Formations, Assigned Players)       \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202    - /users/{userId}/alerts (Price Alert Subscriptions)                \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202    - /users/{userId}/investments (Buy/Sell Log, Profit Ticker)         \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202    - /users/{userId}/clubPlayers (Untradeables & Club Inventory)       \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n```\\n\\n### Key Data Entities\\n- **FC27Player**: ID, name, rating, position, altPositions, club, league, nation, cardType (Gold Rare, TOTW, Trailblazers, Icon, Centurions, etc.), consolePrice, priceHistory (24h/7d timestamps), statRadar (PAC, SHO, PAS, DRI, DEF, PHY).\\n- **Squad**: ID, name, formation (`4-3-3`, `4-4-2`, `4-2-3-1`, `3-5-2`, `5-3-2`), slots (11 starting + bench), totalChemistry (0-33), totalCost, chemBreakdown.\\n- **SBCChallenge**: ID, title, expiry, rewardPack, requirements (minRating, minChem, maxNations, requiredClubs), optimalSolutions.\\n- **TradeSignal**: ID, player, buyTarget, sellTarget, stopLoss, expectedProfitNet, reasoning, horizon, riskLevel (`LOW`, `MEDIUM`, `HIGH`).\\n- **EvolutionPath**: ID, name, targetCard, stages (challenges, requirements), resultingCardStats, expiry.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. Implementation Sequence & Plan\\n\\n1. **Step 1: Firebase Provisioning**:\\n   - Call `show_aistudio_ui` with `ui_type: \\\"firebase_setup\\\"` and verify user approval.\\n   - Provision Firestore and Auth via `rpc_action` (`ProvisionFirebase`).\\n   - Create `firebase-blueprint.json` and hardened `firestore.rules`.\\n2. **Step 2: Server-Side Gemini Intelligence**:\\n   - Configure `server.ts` with Express and `@google/genai` using `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) and `gemini-3.8-flash`.\\n   - Setup API endpoints `/api/gemini/market-advisor`, `/api/gemini/sbc-solver`, `/api/gemini/quick-query`.\\n3. **Step 3: FC 27 Console Database & Chemistry Engine**:\\n   - Construct robust dataset of FC 27 console meta players, promos (Trailblazers, TOTW, Icons, Heroes), and realistic market prices.\\n   - Implement authentic 33/33 chemistry engine (calculating 1/2/3 threshold points for club, league, nation, manager, and icon bonuses).\\n4. **Step 4: FUTBIN-Style Terminal UI & Mobile Viewport**:\\n   - Develop dense FUTBIN desktop layout with live price tickers, market index widget, and player search filters.\\n   - Implement interactive Squad Builder pitch with drag/swap, chem styles, bench, and squad cost.\\n   - Build AI SBC Solver and Club Fodder optimizer with untradeables integration.\\n   - Build Gemini Market Trader terminal with interactive flip tracking and alert setting.\\n   - Build Club Companion Sync and Gallery Grind Loop assistant.\\n   - Ensure fluid responsiveness across ZenBook multi-screen and mobile screen resolutions.\\n5. **Step 5: Verification & Compilation**:\\n   - Run `compile_applet` and verify zero errors, full interactive handlers, and seamless user experience.\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create implementation plan in valid artifact path\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607/implementation_plan.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing implementation plan\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write implementation plan artifact\"}"
