            lines {
              text: "## 1. Overview & Core Concept"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### What It Does"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "The FC 27 Ultimate Team Assistant is a console-exclusive (PlayStation 5 / Xbox Series X|S / PC) market tracker and tactical squad suite. It equips players with:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Console Live Market & Price Alerts**: Real-time price action, 24h/7d historical trend charts, 5% EA tax profit calculators, and alert triggers."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Tactical 33/33 Chemistry Squad Builder**: Dynamic formation selector, nation/league/club chemistry matrix calculation (including Icon and Hero modifiers), total squad valuation, and chemistry style stat boosts."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **AI SBC Solver & Fodder Optimizer**: Solves any Squad Building Challenge using the cheapest console market combinations while prioritizing the user\'s untradeable club inventory to spend minimum coins."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **Gemini High-Thinking Market Advisor**: Leverages `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) to synthesize market index shifts, promo cycles (e.g. Trailblazers, Centurions, TOTW), leak risk, and buy/sell windows with quantified ROI and stop-losses."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "5. **Interactive Club & Companion Sync**: Tracks live coin reserves, FC points, active evolution progression pathways (stat requirements, games played), and gallery upgrade grind cycles (e.g., 82+ Player Pick loops)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Target Audience & Persona"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "Competitive FC 27 Ultimate Team players, traders, and SBC grinders operating across mobile devices and dual-screen laptop setups (such as the Asus ZenBook ScreenPad)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Key Value"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "Eliminates coin waste on SBCs and bad transfer timing by combining real-time FC 27 market pricing with algorithmic chemistry math and Gemini AI market forecasting."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
