            }
            lines {
              text: "## 2. User Experience & Visual Design"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Key User Flows"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Market Terminal & Player Radar**: The user scans trending players, price changes, and promo cards. Clicking any card opens the detailed price history chart, price alert setup modal, and 5% EA tax break-even calculator."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Squad Builder & Chem Matrix**: The user selects a formation (e.g. 4-3-3, 4-2-3-1), searches cards with live price tags, drops players into slots, and watches the 33/33 chemistry meters update live per club/nation/league."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **AI SBC Solver**: The user selects an active SBC (e.g., Icon Upgrade, Player of the Month), clicks \"Solve with My Club Fodder\", and Gemini / algorithmic solver computes the cheapest combination combining club untradeables with market snipes."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **AI Trade Advisor (High Thinking)**: The user requests trade recommendations based on their current coin balance (e.g. 250k coins). The system runs Gemini 4 Argon with deep thinking mode to generate a prioritized trade ledger (Target Buy, Target Sell, Expected Profit, Risk Rating, Horizon)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "5. **Companion Club Sync & Evolutions**: The user views their synced coin balance, active evolution tracker (e.g., \"Relentless Winger\" Stage 2/3), and initiates the \"Gallery Grind Loop\" simulator to track menu pack recycling."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Visual Identity & Theme"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Aesthetic Direction**: Dense, high-tech EA Sports FC 27 dark terminal aesthetic inspired by FUTBIN, Futhead, and professional financial Bloomberg-style terminals."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Color Palette**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
