              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 1: Real-Time Console Data Grounding**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Maintain a dedicated EA Sports FC 27 console player database (ratings, card versions, traits, positions, clubs, nations, leagues, price histories) strictly separate from mobile or legacy FIFA databases."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: User explicitly mandated FC 27 console data accuracy; console markets have unique tax, supply curves, and chemistry rules."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 2: Dual Gemini Intelligence Architecture**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Server-side API proxy utilizing `gemini-4-argon` with `ThinkingLevel.HIGH` for deep strategic trading plans and complex SBC constraint solutions, while utilizing `gemini-3.8-flash` for rapid market queries and instant price alert notifications."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Complies with the \"Enable high thinking\" and \"Add Gemini intelligence\" requirements while ensuring instantaneous responsiveness for quick queries."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 3: Firebase Auth & Firestore Persistence**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Standard Firebase Auth (Google Sign-In popup) paired with Firestore for persisting user squads, active alerts, investment logs, and club inventories."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Enables seamless synchronization between the user\'s mobile device and desktop ZenBook workstation."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 4: Interactive Web Companion Sync Engine**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Local client + Firestore synchronized state machine with one-click JSON/Clipboard import and simulated live sync engine that updates coins, FC points, promo releases, and evolution milestones."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Provides the user with immediate real-time synchronization capabilities without needing unsafe third-party credentials."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
