  user_input {
    user_response: "Build an automated investment tracking feature for the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app. This feature should use Gemini API to analyze EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team console market data, identify trends, and recommend players for investment with a high potential for profit. Provide actionable insights and alerts for profitable trading opportunities, ensuring mobile optimization.\n\nBuild an automated investment tracking feature for the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app. This feature should use Gemini API to analyze EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team console market data, identify trends, and recommend players for investment with a high potential for profit. Provide actionable insights and alerts for profitable trading opportunities, ensuring mobile optimization.\n\nImplement a data synchronization feature for the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app that seamlessly integrates with the user\'s game data. This includes syncing current coin balance, FIFA points, active in-game promotions, newly released players, active Evolutions, and available SBCs. The synchronization should be as real-time as possible and optimized for mobile viewing.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nPlan action: revise\nPlan path: .aistudio/artifacts/2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607/implementation_plan.md\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Build an automated investment tracking feature for the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app. This feature should use Gemini API to analyze EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team console market data, identify trends, and recommend players for investment with a high potential for profit. Provide actionable insights and alerts for profitable trading opportunities, ensuring mobile optimization.\n\nBuild an automated investment tracking feature for the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app. This feature should use Gemini API to analyze EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team console market data, identify trends, and recommend players for investment with a high potential for profit. Provide actionable insights and alerts for profitable trading opportunities, ensuring mobile optimization.\n\nImplement a data synchronization feature for the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app that seamlessly integrates with the user\'s game data. This includes syncing current coin balance, FIFA points, active in-game promotions, newly released players, active Evolutions, and available SBCs. The synchronization should be as real-time as possible and optimized for mobile viewing.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nPlan action: revise\nPlan path: .aistudio/artifacts/2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607/implementation_plan.md\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
