  user_input {
    user_response: "Integrate an AI-driven recommendation engine into the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app to provide solutions for Squad Building Challenges (SBCs). The AI should analyze the user\'s current player inventory, market prices, and SBC requirements to suggest the most efficient and cost-effective player combinations. Ensure all data is sourced from EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team console and recommendations are optimized for mobile display."
    items {
      text: "Integrate an AI-driven recommendation engine into the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app to provide solutions for Squad Building Challenges (SBCs). The AI should analyze the user\'s current player inventory, market prices, and SBC requirements to suggest the most efficient and cost-effective player combinations. Ensure all data is sourced from EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team console and recommendations are optimized for mobile display."
