  code_action {
    action_spec {
      create_file {
        instruction: "# FC 27 Ultimate Team Assistant & Market Terminal (FUTBIN Pro Edition)\n\nA high-performance EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant and console market terminal inspired by FUTBIN, integrating an AI-driven SBC solver with club inventory matching, automated investment tracking with Gemini 4 Argon High-Thinking analysis, and real-time game data synchronization.\n\n---\n\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> The architectural blueprint has been revised to incorporate the following confirmed requirements:\n\n- **AI-Driven SBC Solver with Club Inventory Optimization**: Analyzes the user\'s synced player inventory (untradeable and tradeable club cards) against console market fodder prices and specific SBC rating/chemistry constraints to compute the most cost-effective solution requiring minimum coin spend.\n- **Automated Investment Tracking & Profit Alert Engine**: Leverages `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) to evaluate console price shifts, upcoming promos, and market trends. Generates actionable buy/sell thresholds, calculates net profit after 5% EA tax, and triggers live visual and audio alerts when target margins are hit.\n- **Real-Time Game Synchronization Engine**: Continuous live synchronization supporting coin balance, FC/FIFA points, active promo events (e.g. Trailblazers, Centurions, TOTW), newly dropped players, active Evolution progression, and available SBCs.\n- **Dual Display Ergonomics**: Dense FUTBIN-style desktop terminal tailored for Asus ZenBook UX482 dual-screen setups with collapsible tickers, paired with a touch-first mobile interface respecting the 15% sticky surface budget.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Overview & Core Concept\n\n### What It Does\nThe FC 27 Ultimate Team Assistant delivers a dedicated companion terminal powered by authentic console market pricing (PlayStation 5 / Xbox Series X|S / PC):\n1. **AI SBC Recommendation Engine**: Automatically matches squad building challenges (Player of the Month, Icon Upgrades, Daily Gold Upgrades, Marquee Matchups) against both user club untradeables and console market fodder to find the mathematically lowest-cost solution.\n2. **Automated Investment Tracker**: Analyzes historical price charts, fodder demand curves, and promo schedules to recommend high-conviction flips, discard In-Forms, and meta snipes with automatic threshold alerts.\n3. **Real-Time Club & Game Sync**: Synchronizes coin balance, FC points, club roster, active Evolution objectives (games remaining, stat thresholds), and active in-game promotions with live auto-refresh.\n4. **FUTBIN-Grade Squad Builder**: 33/33 chemistry engine with club/nation/league links, manager league/nation boosts, Icon full chemistry rules, and custom tactics builder.\n\n### Target Audience & Persona\nActive EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team players looking to maximize their club value, complete SBCs for the fewest coins, and trade systematically on mobile and dual-screen desktop laptops.\n\n### Key Value\nSaves tens of thousands of coins per week on SBCs by prioritizing untradeables, prevents market losses via automated buy/sell alerts, and keeps all game data in real-time sync.\n\n---\n\n## 2. User Experience & Visual Design\n\n### Key User Flows\n1. **SBC Solver & Inventory Matcher Flow**:\n   - The user selects an active SBC challenge (e.g., 85+ Double Upgrade or Icon SBC).\n   - The user clicks **\"AI Solve with My Club Fodder\"**.\n   - The AI recommendation engine evaluates the user\'s synced untradeables first, determines the minimum required market buys (e.g. two 84s and one 86), and renders the complete 11-player squad with exact coin cost and chemistry confirmation on mobile-friendly cards.\n2. **Automated Investment & Profit Alerts Flow**:\n   - The user navigates to the **Trader Terminal**.\n   - Gemini 4 Argon (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) scans live console market trends, generating prioritized investment signals with Buy Target, Sell Target, Stop-Loss, and Net ROI % (accounting for EA\'s 5% tax).\n   - The user clicks **\"Track Opportunity\"** to add it to their live watchlist; when console price reaches the buy target, a high-priority alert triggers.\n3. **Live Game Sync & Evolutions Flow**:\n   - The top status bar displays synced Coins, FC Points, and Game Status.\n   - The user reviews active Evolution pathways (e.g., \"Centurions Striker\" Stage 2/3), logging match progress and viewing real-time upgraded in-game stats.\n4. **Console Squad Builder**:\n   - The user builds or imports squads, checks 33/33 chemistry meters, adjusts formations, and inspects bench valuation.\n\n### Visual Identity & Theme\n- **Color Palette**:\n  - Dominant Canvas: Deep Midnight Slate (`#0a0e17` and `#111827`)\n  - Structural Cards & Tables: Muted Dark Navy (`#172033`) with subtle 1px border (`#1f2d47`)\n  - FC Neon Accent: High-contrast Pitch Emerald (`#00ff87`) for chemistry points, profit green, and primary actions\n  - Premium Promo Accent: Metallic Gold (`#f59e0b` / `#fbbf24`) for Icons and TOTW items\n  - Negative Delta / EA Tax: Crimson Red (`#ef4444`)\n- **Mobile Ergonomics**:\n  - Sticky bottom tab bar (Home, Market, Squad, SBCs, Trader, Sync) with touch targets $\\ge 44\\text{px}$.\n  - Mobile bottom sheet modal for card detail and price alert configuration.\n  - Tabular numerals (`tabular-nums font-mono`) across all price tags, chemistry counters, and timestamps.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\n\n- **Decision 1: Hybrid Algorithmic + Gemini High-Thinking SBC Solver**:\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Algorithmic constraint satisfaction for mathematical rating formulas combined with Gemini AI reasoning to select the optimal substitution matrix based on user untradeables and market fodder pricing.\n  - *Why*: Delivers sub-second solve speeds with strategic intelligence for complex nation/league chemistry rules.\n- **Decision 2: Automated Price Alert Ticker**:\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Client-side polling state engine with configurable threshold alerts (Visual toast + audio chime toggle), backed by persistent Firestore alert subscriptions.\n  - *Why*: Delivers immediate feedback whenever a player enters the designated snipe or profit liquidation zone.\n- **Decision 3: Seamless Companion Sync Engine**:\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Dual-layer sync supporting real-time live simulation polling with automatic refresh and instant JSON/CSV club roster import/export.\n  - *Why*: Allows the user to keep their active coins, FIFA/FC points, and untradeable cards perpetually synchronized without risking third-party account bans.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\n\n```\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202                          CLIENT FRONTEND (React 19)                    \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                                                                        \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\22