200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Execution Sequence\n\n1. **Step 1: Firebase Provisioning**:\n   - Prompt user via `show_aistudio_ui` (`firebase_setup`), verify terms, provision Firestore and Auth via `rpc_action` (`ProvisionFirebase`), and generate `firebase-blueprint.json` and `firestore.rules`.\n2. **Step 2: Server-Side Gemini Intelligence**:\n   - Implement `server.ts` Express backend with `@google/genai` utilizing `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) for SBC fodder calculations and market trend investment signals, and `gemini-3.8-flash` for instant queries.\n3. **Step 3: FC 27 Console Database & Chemistry Engine**:\n   - Ground authentic FC 27 console player database (ratings, clubs, leagues, nations, prices, promo items like Trailblazers and TOTW).\n   - Implement 33/33 chemistry scoring engine and lowest-cost fodder algorithm.\n4. **Step 4: AI SBC Solver & Investment Terminal UI**:\n   - Build interactive SBC Solver that scans the user\'s club inventory and computes optimal solutions.\n   - Build Automated Investment Tracker with live buy/sell triggers, EA 5% tax break-even calculator, and high-conviction trade signals.\n   - Build Real-Time Game Sync interface tracking live coins, FC points, promo calendar, and active evolutions.\n   - Build Squad Builder with interactive pitch view and mobile bottom navigation.\n5. **Step 5: Verification & Compilation**:\n   - Run `compile_applet` and verify complete functionality and zero errors.\n"
