  user_input {
    user_response: "Create a responsive dashboard layout with a sidebar for navigation (Club, Market, SBCs, Investments) and a main content area, styled with Tailwind CSS for mobile and desktop usage.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Transcribe audio\"\nicon: \"speech_to_text\"\n---\n\nAdd a feature where users can input audio with their microphone and the app with transcribe it. You MUST add audio transcription to the app using model gemini-3.5-transcribe"
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Use Google Search data\"\nicon: \"google\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add Search Grounding to the app where relevant to get up to date and accurate information. Use gemini-3.8-flash (with googleSearch tool)"
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add a Gemini chatbot\"\nicon: \"voice_chat\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add a multi-turn chat interface to the app using Gemini. The chat must maintain conversation history, display messages in a scrollable thread, and include a system instruction to give the chatbots specific roles. Use gemini-4-argon for particularly complex tasks, gemini-3.8-flash for general tasks, and gemini-3.1-flash-lite for tasks that should happen fast."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      text: "Create a responsive dashboard layout with a sidebar for navigation (Club, Market, SBCs, Investments) and a main content area, styled with Tailwind CSS for mobile and desktop usage.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
