      description: "Integrate 1P Google Workspace APIs (Google Drive, Docs, Sheets, Slides, Calendar, Gmail, Chat, Meet, Forms, Classroom, Tasks, Keep, People, Picker) into the application. Use when the user wants to authenticate with Google Workspace to read, write, or search Google Workspace data. Requires OAuth configuration via the set_up_oauth and remove_oauth tools."
    }
