            lines {
              text: "   - The AI recommendation engine evaluates the user\'s synced untradeables first, determines the minimum required market buys (e.g. two 84s and one 86), and renders the complete 11-player squad with exact coin cost and chemistry confirmation on mobile-friendly cards."
