    summary: "Here\'s a breakdown of the tools and platforms related to EA Sports FC Ultimate Team, focusing on their functionalities for club management, Squad Building Challenges (SBCs), and market analysis:\n\n**Club Analyzer/Exporter**\nTools like FUTClubAnalyzer on GitHub and FC-Tracker are designed to analyze a user\'s EA Sports FC Ultimate Team club. These tools can read in-game club data, allowing players to gain insights into their assets[1][2]. EasySBC and EasyFUT also offer features to import club data, which then informs their SBC-solving and squad-building functionalities, helping users manage their players and identify profit opportunities[3][4][5].\n\n**SBC Solver**\nSBC solvers are applications or browser extensions that automate or assist in completing Squad Building Challenges in EA Sports FC Ultimate Team. Popular examples include:\n*   **Paletools:** Offers plugins for completing SBCs, alongside other features like sniping and pack opening[6][7].\n*   **FUTGenie:** Utilizes AI to automatically complete entire SBC sets[8].\n*   **SBC Cruncher:** Calculates the cheapest player rating combinations for SBCs using price data from platforms like FUTBIN and FUTWIZ[9].\n*   **SbcCrafter:** An AI SBC solver and builder that can solve SBCs with one click using a user\'s club players and track FUT Gallery sets[10].\n*   **EasySBC:** An AI-driven assistant that generates lowest-cost solutions for SBCs, prioritizing players already in a user\'s club and considering chemistry requirements[3][11][4].\n*   **AutoSBC:** A free browser extension that automatically solves SBCs using club players or concept players when club players are insufficient. It also has features for recycling duplicates and an Evolution Workshop[12].\n\n**Paletools**\nPaletools is a comprehensive helper tool for EA Sports FC Ultimate Team. It functions as a set of plugins that aid in various tasks, including sniping players on the transfer market, completing SBCs, opening multiple packs efficiently, and providing keyboard shortcuts for different actions within the web app[6][7].\n\n**FUTBIN & FUT.GG**\nFUTBIN and FUT.GG are popular community-driven databases and platforms for EA Sports FC Ultimate Team. They offer extensive resources for players, such as:\n*   Detailed player ratings, stats, and prices[13][14][15][16][17].\n*   Squad builders to help users create and plan their teams[18][14].\n*   Solutions for Squad Building Challenges, often crowdsourced to find the cheapest ways to complete them[19][20].\n*   Market information and price tracking to assist with trading and investments[14].\n*   Tools for tracking packed players and progress in promo collections[21].\n\n**EasySBC**\nEasySBC is an AI-driven assistant specifically designed for EA Sports FC Ultimate Team players. Its core capabilities include:\n*   An AI-exclusive SBC solver that generates low-cost solutions, intelligently using players from a user\'s club[3][4].\n*   An AI squad builder that creates competitive starting lineups based on budget, formation preferences, and the current game \"meta\"[3][11][4].\n*   Seamless club data import via a browser extension to sync player assets for personalized calculations[3][4].\n*   \"Hardcore true Meta ratings\" that go beyond basic stats to quantify a player\'s real in-match strength, considering factors like body type and hidden attributes[3][22].\n*   Evolutions route tracking, which identifies players in a club that meet upgrade conditions and maps out optimal Evolution paths[3][4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFDXX4zoAuwN9jsUrD8Fm-pJS1rPrS-O6ISXHV_8mpkMuHsDD4z8voiQsdAoWkqNcgY6KOf-C2Kmdh64mpcEbBxhlyGJb8NMRqp0BQnGqkRHQ64sfjqfdOnmcHdGUVnstoCE84=)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGuLF_SsZfymqIMvcFVTHV3eOZXlnIGYfS2Cejn2gAVbL4SjEKZ4pTJmClxLEc_ZuQFzlzpGau9aXMYSYr1CPt1heDSXlVfCYpk5hdhWX4YvBrEF9h_1FSOaf6WXqFIkAJuhRuqXVRb)\n[3] [toolin.ai](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFKFBixrWmM2IPp2ZEGsg4kIE6xnf4o9yDuf6vSIuVPBXE6BC1Rl9Bmu6jNk_t2RQnU4JIO3GYiVP9ewRwp20mQMOOfignhXoF7NiL0aU5pzBdM0o4zKWXw3R46pdU=)\n[4] [easysbc.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFNbJ33LBcHtv-zjMXdXARrFtISXuUwPXP1mWNucwxd8HpBeD2t7U9ruyHTknB0Y6fx87hwSa6mGnakUo1gbT30UbhguMJqOfUylKRcYpX3dBhgPVn3JESdK2EctauX)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFmeesSvt6LmlqI8XIVSWSE7fxpcQJBfw26LrXCTzRPp-oygcdBnjq_S_ixAhaqhO8aB_itOYOAPPwzpDsHbNNCHEo0Vi0er69ShdvxpavPO0F2geH-Vsv1qZ_8)\n[6] [pale.tools](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFcjxd09ycGuX2hpvaXTPG7E-__iyZ9TKt5fpfIdiA4lxbLHgevk1c_ypY7Bvfn2WftsxpH26OM7NkFLLiyQkU-3Mm5sZxY_UuasBulpeI=)\n[7] [bitbucket.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH1GXCZQipj-OiFDK9bXEkGqyo8yG5C5Q5gvj46OIrISSSYZqjNH0OYx9QIOQ80ZI4mfWPYMUHVjSjTGaTS0RNXoNXuRP6eIJpvEQyE1aIYJpRg3RI5pQyk59o=)\n[8] [futgenie.gg](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEo-smCVJ9i6UcRplmvHVgSCTyVWfpapDxRyTxbeUiUIs-A9GtaayRaz3YZ3Iq4c7DXz3LpfKDW-A0uGAHALp-ALJmLx940AsNAWck9rx2ocHZpPg==)\n[9] [sbccruncher.cc](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFgxQ3lW6VnRNwGFiXI53zbohBE9volbDR3s1YV5DVGirfmDRSm8Iv056pV_HpmgBPRw-O_l79ApltQAtoGcHTCTpBrpelihTeKycBqzDn1A3SR)\n[10] [sbccrafter.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFAjVYOa-wEwhemYVnvAu9o-t_faVir32_mJNUc77DKiSme0Dbo6rYmXaKbZ8vT3WA6imD1X9mgCMUksU-Q7QGY6M6kBhqh2d1W1pkuCdvupijt)\n[11] [easysbc.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGImlE6a2qMdA6yWcPFpQUFOnG3GMq4iGPNPLJLhoUiqQUJQrqDGr6TNR7XCrG4FguNhktQwFVo7RwmC5Z5qX1R1vstYcetGug2PN4ThTXHPOJl_g==)\n[12] [autosbc.app](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGYOQW2K1baP-H-2ytcomYRG1BNtp0t_H657uowBnnTD-_SlroE