    summary: "For the EA Sports FC 27 season, players have access to the official EA Sports FC Companion App, along with several popular third-party tools like Futbin, Fut.gg, and EasySBC, each offering distinct features to enhance the Ultimate Team experience. FotMob, however, is a real-world football news and live score application and is not directly related to EA Sports FC Ultimate Team[1][2][3].\n\nHere\'s a comparison of the mentioned EA Sports FC Ultimate Team companion apps and resources:\n\n*   **EA Sports FC 27 Companion App**\n    The official companion app, launched on September 17, 2026, allows players to manage their Ultimate Team directly from their mobile devices[4][5]. Key features include access to the Transfer Market for buying and selling players, completing Squad Building Challenges (SBCs), customizing team tactics, claiming rewards from various game modes, and managing player Evolutions[6][7][4][8][9]. It offers a convenient way to stay engaged with the game without needing to be on a console or PC[4][8].\n\n*   **Futbin**\n    Futbin is a comprehensive database and community hub for EA FC 27 Ultimate Team[10][11]. It provides up-to-date player prices with historical graphs, detailed player statistics, and news[12][10][11]. Its features include a robust Squad Builder with player suggestions for chemistry and links, solutions and details for SBCs, an Evolution hub for tracking and planning player upgrades, and a tax calculator for trading[10]. Futbin also offers notifications for player, market, squad, and SBC alerts[10].\n\n*   **Fut.gg**\n    Fut.gg offers extensive data on EA FC 27 player ratings, prices, and stats[13]. It features an Ultimate Team Squad Builder, enabling users to create and share their squads[13]. The platform also helps users track the latest Squad Building Challenges, Evolutions, and Objectives[14][15]. Fut.gg is known for its ability to import squad and Evolution data[16].\n\n*   **EasySBC**\n    EasySBC specializes in providing solutions and tools for Squad Building Challenges, Evolutions, and meta ratings in EA FC 27[17][18]. It includes an AI Squad Builder and a \"My Club\" feature that allows users to import their in-game club to receive personalized recommendations for squad improvements, SBCs that can be completed with existing fodder, and potential profit opportunities[19]. EasySBC also introduces the \"FUT Gallery,\" a new feature for collecting players and earning rewards[20][21]. Discussions among users sometimes compare the reliability of EasySBC\'s meta ratings against those from Fut.gg[16][22].\n\nSources:\n[1] [fotmob.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGCBYJ5PXf_Sw3iEJP79bl8aHzEyfZFF5zfb8-oDIRlGmEQEhbLr5W_W6swWzto4rKF005NlUU6f3cIp4tyakCivL14DCDGomiv0mR_p4ag8EpBTK5xMdOptZPdenr_f4YagJiETj7Dt1xkHiGis-kyO6PhmNgqdmmwUwuo1BNnNsj8aNLCBQlUfGt5yWcFSD5o1kTdJoTUfXn4sk21U850cNuZZKY=)\n[2] [fotmob.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHj0bc5ZLMV8PkVsP-Pi0wvX0FGldKtHd8n6S1ksK5ojbWJstpMy6VkJscSZ6Zgxg3flis2bSNvvdSACnwKojmQWhpla5QEmoNtZzxgMji2YF4z81RDj2Ugn-3lBjHoExQqddRTqsQpF9vPVZzRtH7rOTeaUtd05BoPv8nKUv25RrRimDE7pNbFIdRCyJUL3RdTt7mH70Jn)\n[3] [fotmob.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE-auYIrQ-wjrEpaRMyVG1ztYnYfKeK0FNeP7ucaoy8Q4TflosW_LC_PXi6ydR_VUT-AugcGRnQr6aHidsdDoul0hmXvvBUNZI9D9Xd7wjlHcKLP4-Q)\n[4] [g2a.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYlflmrYdc8r18wRvA35r4A6yg3oYzIs_sIQ0U5xdZH6WeammmEK9mpdZVHgcnNnsx9pFk5rXz2suluT_S-OIOy2V1XcSoHUCR1ROyfvQa3tFHaeFOfVk7pClWIE0OXCJBukRL-JR95k38XpnAKKhicFqFhA_IZNuQNCE7EBrTqiUIIgFynMmWhbvoH1X7S3sPXqo94-FIekbxFGCMZJUwXVpAOaLFhI56xJYh6ds=)\n[5] [ea.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFe0EeEHNrlKuBijzYuPtAhNlIHB8K23L2ZaHLVnTidR4b0ny8Fzhky7EvCk0Z11FKPPkZv_HMcyZ-B_GmGXyIesVyyINwsBbisvrNomNdn0fGTAP9NWSZb5s1dVlU_5JwZgbE_yGRsYVbczTnydkpEoUjZ9YDwGibiUqzaS8yi5FqebXh7qeym