  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Web Results**\n\nI\'ve been poring over the web search results, and I\'m really starting to get a handle on the various GitHub repositories like `FUTClubAnalyzer`, `FC-Tracker`, and related companion platforms, such as `FUTBIN` and `FUT.GG`. I\'m starting to see patterns in how these projects are structured and what technologies they use.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Implementation Updates**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the implementation plan based on user feedback. The core focus shifts to squad building, club sync, evolution chaining, and SBC management, which take precedence. I\'m ensuring temporal grounding, particularly British time, is prominent. I\'ve also incorporated the shift in focus towards dynamic trading and investment insights at the $T=0$ point.\n\n\n**Refining Temporal Context**\n\nI am now drilling down into the specific temporal aspects for the 2026-27 season. I\'m building out a \"season logic formula\" for the first and second halves of the season, from August to May. My focus now is on an anti-autoregressive transfer trap guard to prevent historical data bias. To ensure this, I\'m injecting precise British timestamps with the day of the week, the \'26-27 season rule, and cross-verifying with FotMob and FUTBIN data.\n\n\n**Developing Sync Architecture**\n\nI\'m now making major strides on a multi-channel sync architecture. Specifically, I\'m building out a system for direct EA Web App JSON input with compatibility, Google Drive integration for hands-free roster updates, and a voice-driven logging system. I am designing a voice pack and roster log that will use Gemini 3.5 to transcribe spoken input for immediate updates to my virtual club inventory. I\'m also now building out the evolution chaining and chemistry-fit suggestion engine to suggest external market targets.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1806193"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true, \"Summary\":\"Updated implementation plan incorporating T=0 British Time (BST) & 2026-27 Season grounding, Anti-Autoregressive Transfer Verification (FotMob + FUTBIN FC 27 Console), Frictionless Club Sync (eliminating manual photo/video uploads via GitHub Web App JSON exporters, Google Drive, and Voice), Evolution Chaining & Squad Chemistry Fit Advisor, and full FUTBIN / FUT.GG / EasySBC / GitHub comparison critique.\", \"UserFacing\":true}, \"CodeContent\":\"# FC 27 UT App \342\200\224 T=0 Grounded Ultimate Team Assistant, Squad & Evolution Chaining Hub\\n\\nAn EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Console) companion built around **Squad Building**, **Frictionless Club Sync**, **Evolution Chaining**, **SBC Countdown & Fodder Optimization**, and **Dynamic Market Intelligence**\342\200\224strictly grounded at **$T=0$ in British Time (`Europe/London`)** for the **2026\342\200\22327 (`26-27`) Season** using **FUTBIN (FC 27 Console)** and **FotMob** live squad verification to eliminate autoregressive transfer hallucinations.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> This revised plan incorporates your exact workflow priorities, temporal grounding rules, and ecosystem research:\\n\\n- **Primary Focus \342\200\224 Squad Building, Club Sync, Evolutions & SBCs**:\\n  - Elevates **Active Squad Management**, **Club Inventory Sync (Who Comes In / Who Goes Out)**, **Evolution Chaining & Chemistry-Linked Target Recommendations**, **Coin & FIFA Points Allocation**, and **Live SBC Expiry Countdowns** as the core experience.\\n  - Keeps **Investments & Trading** clearly spelled out and dynamically grounded at $T=0$ so it never serves stale tips.\\n- **Strict $T=0$ British Time (`Europe/London`) & `2026\342\200\22327` Season Grounding**:\\n  - Dedicated utility (`getBritishTimeContext()`) and Header Clock displaying real-time British Time (e.g., `Wednesday, 21 Oct 2026 \302\267 BST \302\267 T=0`), exact countdowns to 18:00 UK content drops / tonight\'s fixtures, and automatic season resolution:\\n    - **Aug\342\200\223Dec (Latter half of year)** $\\\\rightarrow$ **Start / First Half of `2026\342\200\22327` (`26-27`) Season** (e.g. Oct 2026 = `26-27`).\\n    - **Jan\342\200\223May (Beginning half of year)** $\\\\rightarrow$ **End / Second Half of `prevYear\342\200\223currYear` Season** (e.g. May 2026 = `25-26`, Feb 2034 = `33-34`).\\n- **Anti-Autoregressive Transfer Trap Guard (FotMob + FUTBIN FC 27 Console)**:\\n  - Prevents LLM parameter-weight bias where high historical volume at a former club (e.g., Rodri\'s 7 years at Manchester City) masks a recent 2026\342\200\22327 move (e.g., Rodri at **FC Barcelona** in the `26-27` season).\\n  - Forces every search and AI prompt to cross-check **FotMob (`fotmob.com`)** for current 2026\342\200\22327 real-world club registrations alongside **FUTBIN (`futbin.com`)** strictly filtered to **EA Sports FC 27 Console** (never FC 26, 25, or 24).\\n- **Eliminating Arduous Photo/Video Uploads \342\200\224 Frictionless Club Sync**:\\n  - Replaces manual camera uploads with 3 fast sync channels:\\n    1. **Open-Source Web App JSON Bridge**: Native compatibility with GitHub EA Web App exporter schemas (`FUTClubAnalyzer`, `Paletools`, `AutoSBC`, `FC-Tracker`) for 1-click clipboard or file import.\\n    2. **Google Drive + Antigravity Desktop Pipeline**: Auto-syncs your club inventory, squads, and SBC checklists with Google Drive on your Asus ZenBook UX482 (`v2.24` workflow).\\n    3. **Hands-Free Voice Club Updater (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`)**: Speak pack pulls, player sales, or Evolution completions aloud (\\\"Packed untradeable 86 TOTW and completed Stage 2 Evolution\\\") to mutate your club state instantaneously.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. GitHub Open-Source Research & Companion Ecosystem Evaluation\\n\\n### A. Open-Source GitHub Tools & Architecture Patterns Integrated\\nOur search across GitHub for EA Sports FC Ultimate Team console tooling identified key community patterns that we integrate directly into our sync pipeline so you never have to film your screen again:\\n1. **`FUTClubAnalyzer` & `FC-Tracker` (GitHub)**: Open-source schemas that parse the EA Web App\'s `/ut/game/fc27/club` JSON payload (containing `itemData`, `rating`, `preferredPosition`, `untradeable`, `teamId`, `leagueId`, `nation`). We include a **1-Click Web App JSON Importer** supporting this exact structure.\\n2. **`AutoSBC` & `SBC Cruncher`**: Combinatorial fodder solvers that calculate the cheapest rating combinations (e.g., how many 84s + 87s equal an 86-rated squad) before matching club untradeables.\\n3. **`Paletools` / Web App Enhancer Snippets**: Lightweight bookmarklet/clipboard export payloads that copy your entire club roster, coin balance, and FIFA points to the clipboard in under 2 seconds.\\n\\n### B. Comprehensive Companion Platform Comparison & Critique\\n\\n| Evaluation Criteria | FUTBIN (FC 27) | FUT.GG | EasySBC | FotMob | **Our FC 27 UT App (Winner)** |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Console Market Prices & Graphs** | **Excellent** (Industry standard console auctions, hourly graphs) | **Good** (Fast price updates, clean UI) | **Moderate** (Focused on SBC fodder pricing) | **N/A** (Real-world football only) | **Excellent** (FUTBIN-grade console pricing + live $T=0$ Search Grounding) |\\n| **Evolution Chaining & Club Fit** | **Moderate** (Static Evo builder; manual player selection) | **Very Good** (Strong Evo lab, but weak squad-link reasoning) | **Good** (Meta rating focus, gated behind paywalls) | **N/A** | **Winner** (Cross-references your current club/nation/league links + suggests external market Evo chains) |\\n| **Club Inventory Sync (No Photos/Videos)** | **Weak** (Deprecated/broken club import in recent cycles) | **Manual** (Requires manual checklist ticking) | **Good** (Browser extension sync) | **N/A** | **Winner** (Web App JSON paste + Google Drive sync + Voice mic logging) |\\n| **SBC Solver with Untradeables** | **Static** (Community-submitted squads easily price-fixed) | **Minimal** (Lists requirements, no custom club solver) | **Very Good** (AI solver, but subscription-locked) | **N/A** | **Winner** (Combines your exact untradeables + live fodder math + countdown timers) |\\n| **2026\342\200\22327 Transfer Accuracy (Anti-Weight Bias)** | **High** (Once EA updates transfer cards) | **High** (Game database bound) | **Moderate** | **Gold Standard** (Instant real-world 26\342\200\22327 squad rosters) | **Winner** (Dual-grounds FUTBIN FC 27 + FotMob 26\342\200\22327 rosters at $T=0$ to defeat LLM frequency bias) |\\n| **Coin & FIFA Points Strategy** | **None** | **None** | **None** | **None** | **Winner** (Advises optimal coin vs. FIFA Point efficiency for Evos, packs & SBCs) |\\n| **ZenBook Dual-Screen & Mobile UX** | **Cluttered** (Heavy ad banners break mobile & small viewports) | **Clean** (Good mobile layout) | **Desktop-first** | **Clean Mobile** | **Winner** (Zero ads, Tailwind responsive sidebar + mobile bottom bar $\\\\le 15\\\\%$ sticky cap) |\\n\\n### C. Critical Evaluation Summary\\n- **Critique of FUTBIN**: FUTBIN remains the gold standard for raw console auction house volume and historical price graphs, but its SBC solutions are static community posts (frequently manipulated by traders price-fixing specific cards), its club import tool has lacked seamless real-time roster tracking, and its interface is heavily bogged down by intrusive ad scripts.\\n- **Critique of FUT.GG & EasySBC**: FUT.GG excels at Evolution path visualization, and EasySBC excels at custom club SBC solving and \\\"True Meta\\\" ratings, but neither combines real-world matchday awareness (FotMob) with live Coin/FIFA Point budgeting, Google Drive pipeline sync, and hands-free voice logging.\\n- **Why Our FC 27 UT App Wins**: By fusing **FUTBIN\'s console market density**, **FUT.GG\'s Evolution chaining**, **EasySBC\'s club-aware SBC solving**, and **FotMob\'s real-time 2026\342\200\22327 squad & fixture truth** under a strict **$T=0$ British Time grounding rule**, you get a zero-ad, personalized command center tailored for your Asus ZenBook UX482 and mobile phone.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. User Experience & Visual Design\\n\\n### Responsive Dashboard Shell\\n- **Header Component (`T=0` British Time Grounding Bar)**:\\n  - Displays Brand Wordmark (`FC 27 UT App`), live **British Time (`Europe/London`) Clock** (`Wed 21 Oct 2026 \302\267 13:24:00 BST \302\267 T=0`), active season tag (`2026\342\200\22327 Season \302\267 1st Half`), next EA content drop countdown (`18:00 BST Drop`), and Google Sign-In / Sync status.\\n- **Responsive Sidebar (Desktop / ZenBook) & Bottom Bar (Mobile)**:\\n  1. **Club & Sync (`Club`)**:\\n     - Live Coins & FIFA Points wallet with AI allocation advisor (e.g., whether to use FIFA Points on a paid Evolution vs. coins).\\n     - Complete Club Inventory (Starting XI, Bench, Untradeable Fodder Pool, Incoming/Outgoing transfer log).\\n     - **Frictionless Sync Hub**: 1-Click Web App JSON Importer (`Paletools`/`FUTClubAnalyzer` format), Google Drive Cloud Sync, and Voice Quick-Update (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`).\\n     - **Evolution Chaining Studio**: Tracks active Evolutions on your players AND recommends external market players to buy and chain based on your squad\'s existing clubs, leagues, and nationalities (e.g. pairing with Rodri at FC Barcelona / LaLiga / Spain links).\\n  2. **Console Market & Squad Builder (`Market`)**:\\n     - Interactive 33/33 Chemistry Pitch Builder with formation selector and live link calculation.\\n     - FC 27 Console Player Database grounded to `26-27` club transfers (verified against FotMob + FUTBIN 27).\\n  3. **SBCs & Fodder Optimizer (`SBCs`)**:\\n     - Live SBC tracker showing exact **Time Remaining Countdown**, **Total Coin Cost**, **Club Fodder Coverage %**, and 1-click **\\\"AI Solve with My Club\\\"** recommendations.\\n  4. **Dynamic Investments (`Investments`)**:\\n     - Spell-out dynamic trading tracker powered by `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) and `gemini-3.8-flash` (`googleSearch` grounded at $T=0$), plus tonight\'s matchday live card watch (e.g., UEFA Champions League RTTK / TOTW watches based on today\'s Wednesday fixtures).\\n  5. **Ecosystem & AI Assistant Drawer**:\\n     - Multi-turn Gemini Chat with microphone voice transcription, Google Search grounding, and the interactive **FUTBIN vs. FC 27 UT App Comparison Matrix**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                     HEADER: T=0 BRITISH TIME GROUNDING BAR                   \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202   [FC 27 UT App]  \302\267  [Wed 21 Oct 2026 | BST (T=0) | 2026-27 Season (1st)]    \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                                       \342\224\202\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\274\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                   RESPONSIVE DASHBOARD SHELL (Tailwind CSS)                  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                                                                              \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 Sidebar (Desktop)  \342\224\202  \342\224\202               Main Content Area                \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 Bottom Bar (Mobile)\342\224\202  \342\224\202                                                \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202                    \342\224\202  \342\224\202  1. CLUB & EVOLUTIONS                          \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\200\242 Club & Evos      \342\224\202\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\274\342\224\200\342\226\272   - Coins & FIFA Points Advisor              \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\200\242 Squad & Market   \342\224\202  \342\224\202     - Active Squad & Incoming/Outgoing Roster  \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\200\242 SBCs & Countdowns\342\224\202  \342\224\202     - Evolution Chaining & Link Suggestions    \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\200\242 Investments      \342\224\202  \342\224\202     - Web App JSON / Google Drive / Voice Sync \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\200\242 Ecosystem & Chat \342\224\202  \342\224\202                                                \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230  \342\224\202  2. MARKET & 33/33 SQUAD BUILDER               \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                          \342\224\202     - 26-27 Season Verified Transfers (Rodri   \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                          \342\224\202       at Barcelona, etc. via FotMob + FUTBIN)  \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                          \342\224\202                                                \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                          \342\224\202  3. SBCs & FODDER SOLVER                       \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                          \342\224\202     - Live Expiry Countdowns, Cost & AI Solver \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                          \342\224\202                                                \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                          \342\224\202  4. DYNAMIC INVESTMENTS (T=0 Grounded)         \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                          \342\224\202     - Matchday Live Watch & 5% Tax Calculator  \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                          \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\274\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                                                   \342\224\202\\n                                                   \342\226\274\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                 EXPRESS SERVER (server.ts) + GEMINI SDK + FIREBASE           \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                                                                              \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Every AI call injects: T=0 British Time, Day-of-Week, 2026-27 Season      \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202    Rule, Anti-Autoregressive Transfer Directive (FotMob + FUTBIN 27 only)    \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 POST /api/gemini/evo-and-squad (gemini-4-argon, ThinkingLevel.HIGH)       \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 POST /api/gemini/sbc-solve     (gemini-4-argon, ThinkingLevel.HIGH)       \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 POST /api/gemini/market-ground (gemini-3.8-flash + googleSearch tool)     \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 POST /api/gemini/chat          (Multi-turn with model selector)           \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 POST /api/gemini/transcribe    (gemini-3.5-transcribe voice sync)         \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Firebase Auth + Firestore + Google Drive REST API v3                      \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n```\\n\\n### Temporal & Seasonal Utility Specification (`src/utils/timeGrounding.ts`)\\n- `getBritishTimeContext(now = new Date())`:\\n  - Formats exact `Europe/London` timestamp, weekday (e.g., `Wednesday`), date (`21 October 2026`), time (`HH:mm:ss BST/GMT`), and `T=0` ISO anchor.\\n  - Computes football season dynamically:\\n    - If `month >= 8` (Aug\342\200\223Dec): `${year}-${String(year + 1).slice(-2)}` (`2026-27`, First Half of Season).\\n    - If `month <= 5` (Jan\342\200\223May): `${year - 1}-${String(year).slice(-2)}` (e.g. May 2026 $\\\\rightarrow$ `2025-26`, End of Season).\\n    - If `month` is Jun\342\200\223Jul: Off-season / Pre-season transition `${year}-${String(year + 1).slice(-2)}`.\\n  - Calculates time remaining until daily 18:00 UK EA FC 27 content drop and tonight\'s European/Domestic kick-offs (e.g., 20:00 BST Champions League kick-off).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Execution Sequence\\n\\n1. **Step 1: OAuth, Firebase & Paid Model Provisioning**:\\n   - Call `set_up_oauth` (`userConfirmedInUI: true`) with the confirmed Google Drive scopes.\\n   - Verify Firebase ToS (`GetFirebaseTos`) and provision Firestore (`ProvisionFirebase`).\\n   - Trigger `show_aistudio_ui` (`paid_model_flow`) for `gemini-4-argon`.\\n   - Create `firebase-blueprint.json` and hardened `firestore.rules`.\\n2. **Step 2: British Time (`T=0`) Utility & 2026\342\200\22327 Verified FC 27 Dataset**:\\n   - Build `src/utils/timeGrounding.ts` with `Europe/London` formatting, dynamic season math, and content drop countdowns.\\n   - Build `src/data/fc27ConsoleData.ts` grounded strictly in EA Sports FC 27 Console (`2026-27` season transfers verified, including Rodri at FC Barcelona, Kylian Mbapp\303\251 at Real Madrid, etc., active Evolutions, and active SBCs with live expiry timestamps).\\n3. **Step 3: Express Backend & Temporal-Grounded Gemini Routes (`server.ts`)**:\\n   - Implement `/api/gemini/sbc-solve`, `/api/gemini/evo-advisor`, `/api/gemini/investments`, `/api/gemini/chat` (with `googleSearch` grounding on `gemini-3.8-flash` and `ThinkingLevel.HIGH` on `gemini-4-argon`), and `/api/gemini/transcribe` (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`).\\n   - Enforce system instructions on all routes that inject `T=0` British Time, the `26-27` season rule, and the anti-autoregressive FotMob/FUTBIN verification mandate.\\n4. **Step 4: Responsive Sidebar Dashboard, Header & Feature Views**:\\n   - Build the Header with the live `T=0` British Time clock and season badge.\\n   - Build the responsive Sidebar (`Club`, `Market`, `SBCs`, `Investments`, `Ecosystem & AI`) + Mobile Bottom Navigation Bar.\\n   - Wire up Frictionless Club Sync (Web App JSON import, Google Drive backup/restore with confirmation modal, and Voice transcription updater).\\n5. **Step 5: Compilation & Verification**:\\n   - Run `compile_applet` and verify zero errors.\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update implementation plan with T=0 British Time grounding, 2026-27 season math, FotMob + FUTBIN 27 transfer accuracy, Evolution chaining, Frictionless Club Sync, and Companion App Comparison Matrix\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607/implementation_plan.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating implementation plan\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update plan with T=0 grounding and club sync\"}"
