            lines {
              text: "## 1. Overview & Core Concept"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "### What It Does"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "**FC 27 UT App** provides console Ultimate Team players with a unified command center:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Club & Live Game Sync**: Real-time dashboard tracking your Coins, FIFA Points, untradeable/tradeable club roster, active Evolutions progress, active promos, and Google Drive cloud backups."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Console Market & Price Radar**: Real-time PlayStation/Xbox/PC player database with 24h/7d price graphs, fodder index tickers, and custom price alert triggers."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **AI SBC Solver**: Evaluates active Squad Building Challenges against your club\'s existing player inventory and live market prices to minimize coin expenditure."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **Automated Investment Tracker**: Generates AI-backed buy/sell calls, tracks active flips in your portfolio, deducts 5% EA tax automatically, and fires alerts when target prices hit."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "5. **33/33 Squad Builder & Voice AI Assistant**: Full formation pitch builder plus a multi-turn Gemini chat drawer with microphone transcription (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`) and live Google Search grounding."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "> This revised plan incorporates your exact workflow priorities, temporal grounding rules, and ecosystem research:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Primary Focus \342\200\224 Squad Building, Club Sync, Evolutions & SBCs**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Elevates **Active Squad Management**, **Club Inventory Sync (Who Comes In / Who Goes Out)**, **Evolution Chaining & Chemistry-Linked Target Recommendations**, **Coin & FIFA Points Allocation**, and **Live SBC Expiry Countdowns** as the core experience."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Keeps **Investments & Trading** clearly spelled out and dynamically grounded at $T=0$ so it never serves stale tips."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Strict $T=0$ British Time (`Europe/London`) & `2026\342\200\22327` Season Grounding**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Dedicated utility (`getBritishTimeContext()`) and Header Clock displaying real-time British Time (e.g., `Wednesday, 21 Oct 2026 \302\267 BST \302\267 T=0`), exact countdowns to 18:00 UK content drops / tonight\'s fixtures, and automatic season resolution:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "    - **Aug\342\200\223Dec (Latter half of year)** $\\rightarrow$ **Start / First Half of `2026\342\200\22327` (`26-27`) Season** (e.g. Oct 2026 = `26-27`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "    - **Jan\342\200\223May (Beginning half of year)** $\\rightarrow$ **End / Second Half of `prevYear\342\200\223currYear` Season** (e.g. May 2026 = `25-26`, Feb 2034 = `33-34`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Anti-Autoregressive Transfer Trap Guard (FotMob + FUTBIN FC 27 Console)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Prevents LLM parameter-weight bias where high historical volume at a former club (e.g., Rodri\'s 7 years at Manchester City) masks a recent 2026\342\200\22327 move (e.g., Rodri at **FC Barcelona** in the `26-27` season)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Forces every search and AI prompt to cross-check **FotMob (`fotmob.com`)** for current 2026\342\200\22327 real-world club registrations alongside **FUTBIN (`futbin.com`)** strictly filtered to **EA Sports FC 27 Console** (never FC 26, 25, or 24)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Eliminating Arduous Photo/Video Uploads \342\200\224 Frictionless Club Sync**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Replaces manual camera uploads with 3 fast sync channels:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "    1. **Open-Source Web App JSON Bridge**: Native compatibility with GitHub EA Web App exporter schemas (`FUTClubAnalyzer`, `Paletools`, `AutoSBC`, `FC-Tracker`) for 1-click clipboard or file import."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "    2. **Google Drive + Antigravity Desktop Pipeline**: Auto-syncs your club inventory, squads, and SBC checklists with Google Drive on your Asus ZenBook UX482 (`v2.24` workflow)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "    3. **Hands-Free Voice Club Updater (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`)**: Speak pack pulls, player sales, or Evolution completions aloud (\"Packed untradeable 86 TOTW and completed Stage 2 Evolution\") to mutate your club state instantaneously."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
