            lines {
              text: "## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 1: Multi-Model Gemini Routing (`gemini-4-argon`, `gemini-3.8-flash`, `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, `gemini-3.5-transcribe`)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Route complex SBC optimization and deep portfolio strategy to `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`), live web/promo queries to `gemini-3.8-flash` with `googleSearch`, rapid UI lookups to `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, and microphone voice recordings to `gemini-3.5-transcribe`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Balances deep analytical accuracy with low-latency interaction and hands-free voice control during console matches."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 2: Client-Side Google Drive Sync with Safety Confirmation**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Use Firebase Google Auth with Drive OAuth scopes (`drive.file`, `drive`) and in-memory access token caching to export/import JSON & CSV spreadsheets of club data and SBC solutions, guarded by a confirmation modal before any mutating/delete action."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Complies with Workspace security rules and enables effortless documentation and cross-device pipeline management."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
