            lines {
              text: "## 5. Execution Sequence"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Step 1: OAuth, Firebase & Paid Model Setup**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Finalize Google Workspace OAuth scopes via `set_up_oauth` (`userConfirmedInUI: true`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Verify Firebase ToS via `GetFirebaseTos` and provision Firestore via `ProvisionFirebase` RPC."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Prompt paid API key flow via `show_aistudio_ui` (`paid_model_flow`) for `gemini-4-argon` support."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Create `firebase-blueprint.json` and hardened `firestore.rules` and deploy rules."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Step 2: Full-Stack Express + Gemini API Server (`server.ts`)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Build server-side routes for High-Thinking SBC Solver (`gemini-4-argon` + `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`), Investment Analyzer (`gemini-4-argon` + `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`), Multi-Turn Chatbot with Model Selector & Google Search Grounding (`gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch` and `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`), and Audio Transcription (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **Step 3: FC 27 Console Database, Sync Engine & Google Drive Service**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Create authentic FC 27 console player dataset, active promos, evolutions, and SBC challenges."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Build client-side Google Drive backup/restore service with mandatory confirmation modals for destructive/overwrite actions."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **Step 4: Responsive Sidebar Dashboard & Feature Views**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
