    user_response: "Integrate an AI-driven recommendation engine into the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app to provide solutions for Squad Building Challenges (SBCs). The AI should analyze the user\'s current player inventory, market prices, and SBC requirements to suggest the most efficient and cost-effective player combinations. Ensure all data is sourced from EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team console and recommendations are optimized for mobile display.\n\nIntegrate an AI-driven recommendation engine into the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app to provide solutions for Squad Building Challenges (SBCs). The AI should analyze the user\'s current player inventory, market prices, and SBC requirements to suggest the most efficient and cost-effective player combinations. Ensure all data is sourced from EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team console and recommendations are optimized for mobile display.\n\nImplement a data synchronization feature for the EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant app that seamlessly integrates with the user\'s game data. This includes syncing current coin balance, FIFA points, active in-game promotions, newly released players, active Evolutions, and available SBCs. The synchronization should be as real-time as possible and optimized for mobile viewing.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nPlan action: revise\nPlan path: .aistudio/artifacts/2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607/implementation_plan.md\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
