  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Metadata Changes**\n\nI\'ve been analyzing the recent metadata changes. Specifically, I noted the absence of the \"ask questions\" instruction. This time, the metadata exclusively specifies a \"Plan action: revise\" directive, indicating a shift in the intended action for the current task.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1712884"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true, \"Summary\":\"Revised implementation plan highlighting the AI-driven SBC Recommendation Engine (club inventory + console market fodder optimizer for mobile display) and Real-Time Game Data Synchronization (coins, FIFA points, promos, new players, Evolutions, and SBCs) alongside T=0 British Time grounding and FotMob/FUTBIN verification.\", \"UserFacing\":true}, \"CodeContent\":\"# FC 27 UT App \342\200\224 Ultimate Team Assistant, AI SBC Solver & Real-Time Game Sync\\n\\nAn EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Console) companion featuring an **AI-Driven SBC Recommendation Engine**, **Real-Time Game Data Synchronization**, **33/33 Squad Builder & Evolution Chaining**, and **Dynamic Market Intelligence**\342\200\224strictly grounded at **$T=0$ in British Time (`Europe/London`)** for the **2026\342\200\22327 (`26-27`) Season** using **FUTBIN (FC 27 Console)** and **FotMob** live squad verification, and optimized for mobile and Asus ZenBook UX482 displays.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> This plan unifies your core priorities and feature requirements for immediate execution:\\n\\n- **AI-Driven SBC Recommendation Engine (Mobile-Optimized)**:\\n  - Analyzes your **synced player inventory** (prioritizing untradeables and duplicate fodder), **EA Sports FC 27 Console market prices**, and **exact SBC requirements** (minimum squad rating, minimum chemistry points, nation/league/club constraints, TOTW requirements) to generate the most efficient, lowest-cost 11-player combinations.\\n  - Displays clear mobile-friendly solution cards showing which players come from **My Club ($0\\\\text{ coins}$)** vs. **Console Market Buy Targets**, along with live countdown timers before each SBC expires.\\n- **Seamless Real-Time Game Data Synchronization**:\\n  - Continuously syncs and displays your **Current Coin Balance**, **FIFA/FC Points**, **Active In-Game Promotions** (e.g., Trailblazers, Centurions, TOTW), **Newly Released Console Players**, **Active Evolutions**, and **Available SBCs**.\\n  - Replaces tedious manual photo/video uploads with **1-Click Web App JSON Sync** (`FUTClubAnalyzer` / `Paletools` / `AutoSBC` compatible), **Google Drive Auto-Sync**, and **Hands-Free Voice Sync (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`)**.\\n- **Squad Building & Evolution Chaining Advisor**:\\n  - Tracks who enters and leaves your club, evaluates active Evolutions against your current roster, and recommends external market players that fit your squad\'s existing **clubs, leagues, and nationalities** while mapping multi-stage **Evolution Chains**.\\n- **Strict $T=0$ British Time (`Europe/London`) & `2026\342\200\22327` Season Grounding**:\\n  - Header clock and utility (`getBritishTimeContext()`) anchor every search and AI response to exact British Time (`T=0`), resolve the `2026\342\200\22327` (`26-27`) season automatically (Aug\342\200\223Dec = 1st Half of `26-27`; Jan\342\200\223May = 2nd Half), and cross-verify current clubs via **FotMob + FUTBIN FC 27 Console** (e.g., verifying Rodri at **FC Barcelona** for `26-27` rather than relying on outdated pre-training weights).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Core Feature Pillars\\n\\n### 1. AI-Driven SBC Recommendation Engine (`SBCs` View)\\n- **Inventory-First Optimization**: Scans your synced club roster first, locking in untradeable high-rated fodder and duplicates before querying the EA Sports FC 27 console transfer market for missing links.\\n- **Combinatorial Rating & Chemistry Solver**: Powered by `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) and a deterministic rating matrix calculator to compute the cheapest rating combinations (e.g. combining 84s and 87s to hit an 86 squad rating requirement with required chemistry).\\n- **Mobile-First SBC Cards**: Compact, thumb-friendly cards showing **Time Remaining Countdown**, **Total Coin Cost**, **Savings from Club Inventory**, and a 1-tap **\\\"Generate Optimal Squad\\\"** drawer.\\n\\n### 2. Real-Time Game Data Synchronization (`Club` View)\\n- **Live Wallet & Resource Tracker**: Real-time header and dashboard widgets for **Coins** and **FIFA Points**, paired with AI guidance on optimal allocation (e.g. Paid Evolutions vs. Promo Packs vs. SBC fodder).\\n- **Live Content Feed (Grounded at $T=0$ BST)**:\\n  - **Active In-Game Promotions**: Live promo banner, countdown to the 18:00 UK daily content drop, and newly released promo/TOTW console cards.\\n  - **Active Evolutions Tracker**: Tracks upgrade stages, match objectives, expiry timers, and Evolution Chaining compatibility with your club\'s nationalities and leagues.\\n  - **Available SBCs & Gallery Grind**: Live feed of active SBCs and repeatable upgrade loops (e.g., 82+ Player Pick / Exchange grind).\\n- **Multi-Channel Sync (Zero Camera Uploads)**:\\n  - **Live Companion Auto-Sync Stream**: Real-time state synchronization across mobile and ZenBook desktop via Firebase Firestore.\\n  - **Web App JSON Importer**: Instant import of standard GitHub Web App exporter payloads (`FUTClubAnalyzer`, `Paletools`, `FC-Tracker`).\\n  - **Google Drive Cloud Sync**: Save and load club snapshots, SBC solutions, and squad files directly to Google Drive (with explicit user confirmation dialogs before any overwrite or delete).\\n  - **Voice Roster Update (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`)**: Dictate pack pulls or squad changes hands-free while playing on console.\\n\\n### 3. FUTBIN vs. Companion Ecosystem Comparison Matrix (`Ecosystem` View)\\n\\n| Parameter | FUTBIN (FC 27) | FUT.GG | EasySBC | FotMob | **Our FC 27 UT App (Winner)** |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Console Price Accuracy** | **High** (Console market standard) | **Good** | **Moderate** | **N/A** | **Winner** (Console market data + $T=0$ Google Search grounding) |\\n| **AI SBC Solver with Club Inventory** | **Static** (Community squads easily price-fixed) | **None** | **Good** (Paywalled) | **N/A** | **Winner** (Real-time AI solver prioritizing your untradeables) |\\n| **Real-Time Club & Evolution Sync** | **Weak** (Manual/broken import) | **Manual** | **Extension only** | **N/A** | **Winner** (Live Sync + Web App JSON + Google Drive + Voice) |\\n| **2026\342\200\22327 Transfer Truth (Anti-Bias)** | **Game-bound** | **Game-bound** | **Game-bound** | **Gold Standard** | **Winner** (Dual FotMob + FUTBIN 27 check defeats LLM weight bias) |\\n| **Mobile & ZenBook Dual-Screen UX** | **Cluttered with Ads** | **Clean** | **Desktop-heavy** | **Clean Mobile** | **Winner** (Ad-free Tailwind sidebar + mobile bottom bar $\\\\le 15\\\\%$ cap) |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. User Experience & Responsive Layout\\n\\n- **Top Header (`T=0` British Time Bar)**:\\n  - Displays `FC 27 UT App` wordmark, live **British Time (`Europe/London`) Clock** (`T=0`), `2026\342\200\22327 Season` badge, live synced **Coins & FIFA Points** pills, and Google Sign-In / Sync trigger.\\n- **Desktop / Asus ZenBook UX482 Layout**:\\n  - Left **Sidebar Navigation** (`Club & Sync`, `SBCs (AI Solver)`, `Squad & Evolutions`, `Market & Investments`, `Ecosystem & AI Chat`) paired with a dense multi-column main workspace.\\n- **Mobile Viewport (`375px\342\200\223430px`)**:\\n  - Fixed **Bottom Navigation Bar** with $\\\\ge 44\\\\text{px}$ touch hitboxes, swipeable filter tabs, and collapsible bottom sheets for SBC solutions and player cards.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Technical Architecture & Data Flow\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                     HEADER: T=0 BRITISH TIME & LIVE WALLET                   \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  [FC 27 UT App] \302\267 [BST Clock (T=0) | 26-27 Season] \302\267 [Coins | FIFA Points]   \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                                       \342\224\202\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\22