200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Execution Sequence\\n\\n1. **Step 1: OAuth, Firebase & Paid Model Provisioning**:\\n   - Finalize Google Drive OAuth via `set_up_oauth` (`userConfirmedInUI: true`).\\n   - Verify Firebase ToS (`GetFirebaseTos`) and provision Firestore (`ProvisionFirebase`).\\n   - Trigger `show_aistudio_ui` (`paid_model_flow`) for `gemini-4-argon`.\\n   - Create `firebase-blueprint.json` and hardened `firestore.rules`.\\n2. **Step 2: British Time (`T=0`) Utility & FC 27 Console Dataset**:\\n   - Build `src/utils/timeGrounding.ts` with `Europe/London` live clock, `2026\342\200\22327` season logic, and 18:00 UK drop countdowns.\\n   - Build `src/data/fc27ConsoleData.ts` with `2026\342\200\22327` verified console players (including Rodri at FC Barcelona), active promos, active Evolutions, and active SBCs.\\n3. **Step 3: Express Backend & Gemini API Routes (`server.ts`)**:\\n   - Implement server-side routes for the AI SBC Solver, Evolution Chaining Advisor, Dynamic Investment Tracker, Multi-Turn Search-Grounded Chatbot, and Voice Transcription.\\n4. **Step 4: Responsive Dashboard Shell & Feature Modules**:\\n   - Build the responsive Sidebar + Mobile Bottom Navigation layout, Real-Time Game Sync hub, AI SBC Recommendation Engine, 33/33 Squad Builder, Dynamic Investment Tracker, Google Drive Sync manager, and Ecosystem Comparison view.\\n5. **Step 5: Build & Verification**:\\n   - Run `compile_applet` and verify zero errors.\\n\", \"Description\":\"Finalize revised implementation plan for AI SBC Recommendation Engine, Real-Time Game Sync, T=0 British Time grounding, and responsive mobile/desktop layout\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607/implementation_plan.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating implementation plan\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update plan with SBC engine and real-time sync\"}"
