  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Implementation Plan**\n\nI\'ve reviewed the RAEC analysis and am focusing on the suggested upgrades for `implementation_plan.md`. The most critical element I see is developing a Dual-Mode SBC Solver. This involves streamlining the SBC Item Score and incorporating a Traditional 11-Player Puzzle SBC. I am now exploring potential architectures for this dual-mode system.\n\n\n**Developing Dual-Mode Solver**\n\nI\'m now integrating the Streamlined SBC functionality with the traditional 11-player puzzle approach. The plan includes fast TypeScript math for calculations, reserving Gemini API calls for squad advice. The goal is to avoid API quota issues. This also involves tracking FC 27\'s permanent FUT Gallery sets, set grades, and tag bonuses, along with optimizing rent-and-flip strategies.\n\n\n**Refining Flip Strategies**\n\nI\'m now identifying cards trading near discard value for tax-free flips after registering Set Grade and Tag Bonus. This minimizes coin loss. Furthermore, I\'m developing alerts for Holographic items near base card prices for flips or Item Score multipliers. I\'m also devising a 5G connection-aware trading mode focused on mass bidding and fodder cycling.\n\n\n**Integrating Meta-Scores**\n\nI\'m now integrating player roles, PlayStyle branches, and Meta-Scores into the existing framework. I\'m focusing on the \"PlayStyles Lab\" (3 PlayStyles+ cap) and the 31 Player Roles with a custom In-Game Meta Score (1-100) per Role. The goal is a granular in-game performance model.\n\n\n\n**Optimizing UI Integration**\n\nI\'m now considering the ZenBook\'s dual-screen setup. I want to pin my live Watchlist and countdown on the bottom screen, along with the Streamlined SBC Item Score tally. The main display will be used for Squad Builder and Gallery views. I\'m also planning a 3-step agentic workflow for the 18:00 BST drops, using deterministic math where possible to avoid excessive API calls.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1441438"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true, \"Summary\":\"RAEC-Upgraded Implementation Plan incorporating authentic EA Sports FC 27 mechanics: Dual-Mode SBC Solver (Streamlined Item Score + Holographic multipliers + Deterministic Puzzle Solver), FUT Gallery Set & Tag Tracker with Rent-and-Flip Optimizer, Branching Evolution Pathways & 31 Player Roles++ Meta Score, 850 SP Match Stacker & Gauntlet Builder, 5G Bid-Flipper Trading Mode, Asus ZenBook UX482 ScreenPad Plus Mode, and Quota-Safe 18:00 BST Agentic Drop Workflow.\", \"UserFacing\":true}, \"CodeContent\":\"# FC 27 UT App \342\200\224 RAEC-Upgraded Ultimate Team Terminal (T=0 Grounded)\\n\\nAn EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Console) companion engineered around authentic **FC 27 Season 1 / 2026\342\200\22327 (`26-27`) mechanics**: a **Dual-Mode SBC Solver** (Streamlined **Item Score** + 11-Player Puzzle math), **FUT Gallery Set, Grade & Tag Optimizer** with a **\\\"Rent-and-Flip\\\" Calculator**, **Branching Evolution Pathways & 31 Player Roles++ Meta Engine**, **Multi-Objective Match Stacker (850 Daily SP Cap)**, and a **Quota-Safe 18:00 BST Agentic Workflow**\342\200\224tailored for your **Asus ZenBook UX482 (Main Display + ScreenPad Plus)** and **Mobile Touch (`375px\342\200\223430px`)**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## User Review & Critical Decisions (RAEC Upgrades Integrated)\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> Every critique and custom feature from your RAEC audit has been integrated into this architecture:\\n\\n1. **Dual-Mode SBC Engine (Deterministic Math + AI Strategy)**:\\n   - **Mode A \342\200\224 Streamlined SBC Item Score Optimizer**: Built for FC 27\'s new Streamlined SBCs. Ranks your club inventory, SBC Duplicate Storage, and console market cards by **Coins per Item Score Point**, factoring in Base Rating (Bronze/Silver/Gold with no legacy Common/Rare split), Special Rarity, and **Regular ($\\\\le 87$ OVR) & Pristine ($\\\\ge 88$ OVR) Holographic** bonus multipliers across partial attempts.\\n   - **Mode B \342\200\224 Traditional 11-Player Puzzle Solver**: Uses instant (<2ms) **Deterministic Combinatorial Math** in TypeScript to compute exact rating and 33/33 chemistry combinations (saving `gemini-4-argon` API quota for high-level squad & link advice).\\n2. **Authentic FUT Gallery Set, Tag & \\\"Rent-and-Flip\\\" Optimizer**:\\n   - Tracks FC 27\'s permanent **FUT Gallery** collection system (**100+ Sets**, **Set Grades**, **Tag Bonuses**, and overall **Gallery Level**\342\200\224including *Season 1 Combined Rarities: Ones to Watch, Destined for Glory, and Future Stars*).\\n   - **\\\"Gallery Rent-and-Flip\\\" Calculator**: Because FC 27 permanently records packed or bought cards in your Gallery even after you sell them or submit them into an SBC, this tool flags eligible cards trading near Quick Sell (discard) floor or minimum price range so you can buy them on console, claim the **Set Grade & Tag Bonus**, and resell immediately for near-zero loss after the 5% EA tax.\\n3. **Branching Evolution Pathways, PlayStyles Lab (3 PS+ Cap) & 31 Roles++ Meta Score**:\\n   - Simulates **Branching Evolution Pathways** (comparing Branch A vs. Branch B stat & PlayStyle divergences), tracks the recurring **PlayStyles Lab** (strictly enforcing FC 27\'s **3 PlayStyles+ cap**), and scores every player from **1\342\200\223100 (Custom Meta Score)** across all **31 Player Roles & Focuses** (e.g., *Holding++*, *Box-to-Box++*, *Inside Forward++*, *Poacher++*) while checking chemistry links with your current squad (e.g., Rodri at **FC Barcelona** verified via FotMob + FUTBIN 27).\\n4. **Season Ladder Pacing (850 Daily SP Cap), \\\"Match Stacker\\\" & Gauntlet Builder**:\\n   - Anchored at $T=0$ (`Wednesday, 21 October 2026` BST \342\200\224 final 24h of FC 27 Season 1 before the Thursday 22 Oct transition).\\n   - **Multi-Objective Match Stacker**: Analyzes active Foundations, Single-Player Live Events, and Evolution tasks (across 9 daily attempts) to generate a single starting XI that progresses **4\342\200\2235 objectives simultaneously** while tracking your **850 SP daily match cap**.\\n   - **Gauntlet & Squad Foundations Builder**: Builds multi-squad rotations from your untradeable club depth without reusing locked players.\\n5. **5G Connection-Aware Trading & Holographic Arbitrage**:\\n   - **\\\"Lazy Buyer / Bid Flipper\\\" Filter**: Designed for 5G home networks where ping spikes affect 59th-minute sniping\342\200\224focuses on **1-hour mass bidding**, **Out-of-Packs Campaign Flips** (*Destined for Glory*, *Future Stars*), and **Holographic Arbitrage Alerts** (flagging Regular $\\\\le 87$ and Pristine $\\\\ge 88$ Holographic cards listed near standard special prices).\\n6. **Asus ZenBook UX482 ScreenPad Plus Mode & Mobile Ergonomics**:\\n   - Toggleable **\\\"ScreenPad Plus Ticker Bar\\\"** mode formatted for your ZenBook\'s secondary bottom touchscreen (pinning live Watchlist, 18:00 BST drop timer, and Streamlined SBC Item Score progress on the bottom display while the Squad Builder / Gallery fills the main 14-inch display), paired with a fixed mobile bottom tab bar (`375px\342\200\223430px`, $\\\\le 15\\\\%$ sticky cap).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Scrupulous Agentic vs. Deterministic Architecture (Zero Quota Waste)\\n\\nTo eliminate `Quota limits exceeded` errors while maximizing intelligence, tasks are strictly partitioned:\\n\\n| Module / Calculation | Execution Engine | Rationale & Latency |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Streamlined SBC Item Score & Holographic Multipliers** | **Deterministic TypeScript (<2ms)** | Pure arithmetic ranking `Item Score / Coin Cost` from club + SBC storage + cached console prices. Zero API tokens spent. |\\n| **11-Player Puzzle SBC Rating & 33/33 Chemistry Matrix** | **Deterministic TypeScript (<5ms)** | Instant combinatorial rating solver and Nation/League/Club link calculator. |\\n| **Custom In-Game Meta Score (1\342\200\223100 across 31 Roles++)** | **Deterministic Weighted Engine (<2ms)** | Computes Role++ fit from Pace splits, AcceleRATE, 3-PlayStyle+ cap, Agility/Balance/Composure/Reactions, and WF/SM. |\\n| **$T=0$ British Clock (`Europe/London`), 26\342\200\22327 Season & 5% Tax** | **Deterministic Utility (<1ms)** | Live second-by-second BST/GMT clock, 18:00 UK drop countdown, and exact 0.95 net sale arithmetic. |\\n| **18:00 BST Daily Drop & Evo-Market Autonomous Pipeline** | **3-Step Agentic Workflow (`gemini-3.8-flash` + `gemini-4-argon`)** | Triggered on-demand at content drop or club import: (1) Ingests new SBC/Evo rules & FotMob/FUTBIN 27 updates via `gemini-3.8-flash` (`googleSearch`), (2) Filters club & simulates branching Evos via `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`), (3) Outputs a 3-bullet **Daily Action Card** & logs snapshot to Google Drive. |\\n| **Hands-Free Voice Pack & Evo Logger** | **`gemini-3.5-transcribe`** | Converts spoken controller-in-hand updates into structured club inventory mutations. |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Ecosystem Comparison Matrix (Integrated in App & Grounding Engine)\\n\\n| Capability | FUTBIN (FC 27) | FUT.GG (FC 27) | EasySBC (FC 27) | FotMob (2026\342\200\22327) | **Our FC 27 UT App (RAEC Winner)** |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Streamlined SBCs (Item Score)** | Item score reference tables | Streamlined SBC cheapest by rating | Credit-gated club solver | N/A | **Club + Duplicate Storage + Holographic Score Optimizer (0ms math)** |\\n| **FUT Gallery Sets & Tags** | Gallery Builder & Set Grades | Gallery & Holographic database | Minimal | N/A | **100+ Sets Tracker + Tag Bonus Calc + \\\"Rent-and-Flip\\\" Discard Optimizer** |\\n| **Branching Evolutions & 31 Roles++** | Basic chain preview | Gold-standard Evo Lab & Roles++ | Meta Rating delta | N/A | **Branch A/B Simulator + 31 Roles++ Meta Score + Squad Chemistry Fit** |\\n| **2026\342\200\22327 Transfer Truth ($T=0$)** | Game DB bound | Game DB bound | Game DB bound | **Live 26\342\200\22327 Squads** | **Dual FotMob + FUTBIN 27 Verification (e.g., Rodri at FC Barcelona)** |\\n| **Club Sync (No Camera Uploads)** | Broken/manual | Manual checklist | Paid extension ($11.99/mo) | N/A | **1-Click Web App JSON (`Paletools`/`FUTClubAnalyzer`) + Google Drive + Voice** |\\n| **Hardware & Network Tailoring** | Heavy ads slow mobile/laptop | Clean web UI | Desktop-focused | Clean mobile | **Zero Ads + ZenBook UX482 ScreenPad Plus Ticker + 5G Bid-Flipper Mode** |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Technical Architecture & Data Flow\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202              HEADER: T=0 BRITISH TIME (BST) & SEASON 1 COUNTDOWN BAR           \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202 [FC 27 UT App] \302\267 [Wed 21 Oct 2026 | BST (T=0) | 26-27 Season] \302\267 [18:00 Drop]   \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202 [Coins | FIFA Points | Daily SP: 650/850] \302\267 [ZenBook ScreenPad Mode] \302\267 [Sync]  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\34