rd, ZenBook ScreenPad Mode & Mobile UI**:\n   - Build the Header with the live $T=0$ British Time clock, Coins/FIFA Points/SP bar, and **ZenBook UX482 ScreenPad Plus** mode toggle.\n   - Build the full suite of views (**Club & Match Stacker**, **Dual-Mode SBCs**, **FUT Gallery Rent-and-Flip**, **33/33 Squad & 31 Roles++ Builder**, **5G Market & Holographic Arbitrage**, and **18:00 BST Agent & Comparison Matrix**).\n5. **Step 5: Compilation & Verification**:\n   - Run `compile_applet` and verify zero errors.\n"
