              text: "   - **\"Lazy Buyer / Bid Flipper\" Filter**: Designed for 5G home networks where ping spikes affect 59th-minute sniping\342\200\224focuses on **1-hour mass bidding**, **Out-of-Packs Campaign Flips** (*Destined for Glory*, *Future Stars*), and **Holographic Arbitrage Alerts** (flagging Regular $\\le 87$ and Pristine $\\ge 88$ Holographic cards listed near standard special prices)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "6. **Asus ZenBook UX482 ScreenPad Plus Mode & Mobile Ergonomics**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Toggleable **\"ScreenPad Plus Ticker Bar\"** mode formatted for your ZenBook\'s secondary bottom touchscreen (pinning live Watchlist, 18:00 BST drop timer, and Streamlined SBC Item Score progress on the bottom display while the Squad Builder / Gallery fills the main 14-inch display), paired with a fixed mobile bottom tab bar (`375px\342\200\223430px`, $\\le 15\\%$ sticky cap)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
