    thinking: "**Analyzing Plan Revisions**\n\nI\'m now diving into the user\'s latest additions, specifically the two primary top-level domains: `MENUS` and `GAMEPLAY`. Within `MENUS`, I\'m meticulously breaking down each section \342\200\223 Club, Market, SBCs, Gallery, Investments, and the Live Item/Price Tracker, especially how it dynamically tracks player data. I\'m focusing on the interplay between these elements.\n\n\n**Visualizing Live Market Data**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the real-time market data visualization. This includes interactive charts for hourly and daily trends, along with market and fodder indexes, specific to EA Sports FC 27. It\'s designed to be optimized for both mobile and laptop screens. Gemini API integration will be key for analyzing trends and providing insights. I\'m also working on dual-mode SBC solvers, gallery optimization, and club sync.\n\nI am now focusing on the gameplay side, specifically live patch and title update tracking.\n\n\n**Synthesizing Gameplay Impacts**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the gameplay side, with a focus on how different variables interact. I\'m building an engine to calculate the combined effects of in-game attributes, chemistry styles, and AcceleRATE archetypes. I\'m especially interested in the isolated versus combined effects of these elements, like how changes to agility impact AcceleRATE. The interplay of PlayStyles is critical.\n\n\n**Quantifying PlayStyle Synergies**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the additive and multiplicative effects of PlayStyles and PlayStyles+ on player stats. I\'m focusing on how *Quick Step+*, *Rapid+*, *Finesse Shot+*, and others influence in-game performance. I\'m also synthesizing player body types, physical profiles, and their impact, as well as roles and focuses for an in-game meta rating.\n\n\n"
