        instruction: "# FC 27 UT App \342\200\224 Dual-Domain Ultimate Team Terminal: MENUS & GAMEPLAY (T=0 Grounded)\n\nAn EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Console) strategic engine structured into **Two Principal Domains**\342\200\224**1. MENUS (Market Charts, Instant Item/Price Tracker, Dual-Mode SBCs, FUT Gallery, Club Sync)** and **2. GAMEPLAY (Live Patch/Title Update Meta, Formations, 31 Roles++, and Additive Stat + PlayStyle+ + Chemistry Style + AcceleRATE + Body Type Synthesis Calculator)**\342\200\224strictly grounded at **$T=0$ in British Time (`Europe/London`)** for the **2026\342\200\22327 (`26-27`) Season** and optimized for **Mobile Touch (`375px\342\200\223430px`)** and **Asus ZenBook UX482 (Main Display + ScreenPad Plus)**.\n\n---\n\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> The application architecture is now organized into your **Two Principal Domains (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`)** while preserving every RAEC upgrade:\n\n1. **Principal Domain 1 \342\200\224 `MENUS` (Market Charts, New Item Feed, SBCs, Gallery & Club Sync)**:\n   - **Instantaneous Price & New Item Ingestion**: Dynamically tracks console player auction prices and newly added FC 27 items (18:00 UK daily content drops, promos, TOTW, Regular/Pristine Holographics, SBC cards, and Evolutions) grounded at $T=0$.\n   - **Interactive Real-Time Market Data Visualization (Mobile-Optimized)**: Touch-responsive interactive SVG/Canvas charts for **24h Hourly Price Action**, **7d/30d Historical Trends**, **Market Tier Index (Gold / Fodder / Promo / Holographic)**, and **Buy/Sell Volume Spreads**, paired with Gemini API (`gemini-4-argon` + `gemini-3.8-flash` with `googleSearch`) trend analysis and 5% EA tax profit alerts.\n   - **Dual-Mode SBC Engine**: Streamlined SBC **Item Score** optimizer (with Regular $\\le 87$ / Pristine $\\ge 88$ Holographic multipliers and duplicate storage priority) + deterministic 11-player chemistry puzzle solver.\n   - **FUT Gallery Set, Tag & \"Rent-and-Flip\" Optimizer**: Tracks 100+ permanent Gallery Sets, Set Grades, Tag Bonuses, and discard-floor \"Buy, Register in Set, Resell\" flips.\n   - **Frictionless Club Sync**: 1-Click Web App JSON import (`Paletools`/`FUTClubAnalyzer`), Google Drive backup/restore, and hands-free Voice logging (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`).\n\n2. **Principal Domain 2 \342\200\224 `GAMEPLAY` (Patch Meta, Formations & Additive Synthesis Engine)**:\n   - **Live Title Update & Patch Meta Tracker ($T=0$ Grounded)**: Tracks EA Sports FC 27 software patches and Live Tuning updates throughout the cycle (e.g., changes to R1 Agile Dribbling, Finesse/Trivela curves, defensive line height AI, and AcceleRATE sprint decay) so formation and player advice always reflects the *current* patch.\n   - **Meta Formations, Custom Tactics & FC IQ Share Codes**: Real-time meta formation rankings (e.g., `4-2-1-3`, `4-4-2 Holding`, `4-2-3-1 Wide`, `4-1-2-1-2 Narrow`), build-up speeds, defensive line heights, and counter-formation guides.\n   - **Isolated vs. Synthesized Additive Performance Engine**: A deterministic + AI calculator that computes a card\'s **True In-Game Output** by synthesizing:\n     - **Base Stats in Isolation** vs. **Chemistry Style Boosts** (0\342\200\2233 Chemistry Diamonds $\\times$ Hunter, Shadow, Engine, Hawk, Anchor, Finisher, Maestro, Architect).\n     - **Dynamic AcceleRATE 2.0 Recalculation**: Computes exact sprint archetype (*Explosive*, *Mostly Explosive*, *Controlled Explosive*, *Controlled*, *Controlled Lengthy*, *Mostly Lengthy*, *Lengthy*) from post-chemistry Agility, Strength, Acceleration, and Height.\n     - **PlayStyles & PlayStyles+ (3 PS+ Cap) Additive/Multiplicative Synergy**: Quantifies how PlayStyles+ (e.g., *Quick Step+*, *Rapid+*, *Incisive Pass+*, *Finesse Shot+*, *Anticipate+*) amplify raw attributes beyond the 99 stat cap.\n     - **Player Body Type & Physical Frame**: Factors in Unique/Custom animations, Lean/Stocky/High & Average frames, Weak Foot, Skill Moves, Reactions, and Composure.\n     - **31 Player Roles & Focuses (`Role`, `Role+`, `Role++`)**: Outputs a **Synthesized Meta Score (1\342\200\223100)** for any player in any Role under the current FC 27 patch.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Dual-Domain Feature Architecture\n\n### Domain 1: `MENUS` \342\200\224 Market Visualization, SBCs, Gallery & Club Sync\n\n| Sub-Module | Core Capabilities | Execution & Grounding |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Live Market Charts & New Item Radar** | Interactive 24h/7d price history charts, fodder index curves, newly added FC 27 item feed, price alerts, and 5G Bid-Flipper filters. | Cached Console Feed + `gemini-3.8-flash` (`googleSearch`) + `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) trend insights. |\n| **Dual-Mode SBC Solver** | **Streamlined Mode** (Cheapest Coins per **Item Score** + Holographic 1.25x/1.50x multipliers) & **Puzzle Mode** (11-player rating + 33/33 chem solver using club untradeables first). | Deterministic TypeScript (<2ms) + Gemini squad link recommendations. |\n| **FUT Gallery & Rent-and-Flip** | Tracks 100+ permanent Sets, Set Grades, Tag Bonuses, and calculates zero-loss discard flips after 5% EA tax. | Deterministic 5% Tax & Discard Floor Calculator. |\n| **Club Sync & Match Stacker** | Syncs Coins, FIFA Points, untradeables, SBC Duplicate Storage, and stacks 4\342\200\2235 objectives within the **850 Daily SP Cap**. | Web App JSON + Firebase Firestore + Google Drive REST API + Voice (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`). |\n\n---\n\n### Domain 2: `GAMEPLAY` \342\200\224 Patch Meta, Tactics & Additive Stat Synthesis\n\n```\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202                 ADDITIVE GAMEPLAY SYNTHESIS ENGINE (FC 27)                   \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                                                                              \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  [1. Raw Face & Sub-Stats]  \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220                                              \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  (PAC/SHO/PAS/DRI/DEF/PHY +   \342\224\202                                              \342\224\202\n\342\224\202   Composure & Reactions)      \342\224\202                                              \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                               \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 [DETERMINISTIC + AI SYNTHESIS MATRIX]     \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  [2. Chem Points (0-3) &      \342\224\202    \342\200\242 Effective Pace (Sprint + Quick Step+    \342\224\202\n\342\224\202      Chemistry Style (+4/+8)] \342\224\200\342\224\244      + AcceleRATE Archetype Curve)           \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                               \342\224\202    \342\200\242 Effective Finishing (Finishing +        \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  [3. PlayStyles & 3 PS+ Cap] \342\224\200\342\224\244      Shot Power + Composure + Finesse+)      \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  (Additive & Break-Cap Bonus) \342\224\202    \342\200\242 Effective Responsiveness (Agility +     \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                               \342\224\202      Balance + Body Type + Press Proven+)    \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  [4. Body Type, Height & WF] \342\224\200\342\224\244    \342\200\242 AI Positioning Multiplier (Role /       \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                               \342\224\202      Role+ / Role++ across 31 Roles)         \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  [5. Active FC 27 Patch Meta]\342\224\200\342\224\230                                              \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                                                   \342\224\202                          \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                                                   \342\226\274                          \342\224\202\n\342\224\202        OUTPUT: ISOLATED STAT SCORE vs. SYNTHESIZED IN-GAME META SCORE        \342\224\202\n\342\224\202             + BEST CHEM STYLE + OPTIMAL ROLE++ & FORMATION FIT               \342\224\202\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n```\n\n1. **Stats in Isolation vs. Synthesized Comparison View**:\n   - Displays a side-by-side radar and bar breakdown showing a card\'s **Isolated Base Stats** (e.g., `86 Sprint Speed`, `84 Finishing`) vs. its **Synthesized Effective In-Game Performance** (e.g., `94 Sprint Speed [Shadow 3/3]` + `Controlled Lengthy` + `Rapid+` = **98.4 Effective Breakaway Pace**).\n2. **Dynamic Patch & Firmware Impact Analyzer**:\n   - Maintains a live **FC 27 Title Update & Patch Registry** grounded at $T=0$ (and expandable via `googleSearch` grounding whenever EA drops a new Title Update or Live Tuning patch).\n   - Automatically adjusts weightings for PlayStyles, Roles++, and Formations when patch notes nerf or buff specific mechanics.\n3. **33/33 Squad Builder & Evolution Branch Simulator**:\n   - Integrates directly with Domain 2 so you can test how Branch A vs. Branch B of an Evolution\342\200\224or swapping a Chemistry Style from *Engine* to *Hawk*\342\200\224shifts a player\'s AcceleRATE type, Role++ effectiveness, and team chemistry links (verified with 2026\342\200\22327 transfers via FotMob + FUTBIN 27, e.g., Rodri at FC Barcelona).\n\n---\n\n## 2. Responsive Layout & Visual Design (Mobile + ZenBook UX482)\n\n- **Top Domain Switcher & $T=0$ British Time Header**:\n  - Instant top-level toggle between **`MENUS` (Club \302\267 Market \302\267 SBCs \302\267 Gallery \302\267 Investments)** and **`GAMEPLAY` (Synthesis Lab \302\267 Patch Meta \302\267 Formations & Roles++ \302\267 Squad Builder)**.\n  - Displays live **British Time (`Europe/London` BST/GMT)** at $T=0$, active season (`2026\342\200\22327 Season`), live synced **Coins & FIFA Points**, and **ZenBook ScreenPad Plus** secondary ticker toggle.\n- **Interactive Mobile-Optimized Market Charts**:\n  - Responsive SVG area/candlestick charts with touch-drag price tooltips, 24h/7d timeframe switches, min/max price range overlays, and 1-tap **\"Analyze Trend with Gemini\"** action cards.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Execution Sequence\n\n1. **Step 1: OAuth, Firebase & Paid Model Provisioning**:\n   - Finalize Google Drive OAuth via `set_up_oauth` (`userConfirmedInUI: true`).\n   - Verify Firebase ToS (`GetFirebaseTos`) and provision Firestore (`ProvisionFirebase`).\n   - Trigger `show_aistudio_ui` (`paid_model_flow`) for `gemini-4-argon`.\n   - Create `firebase-blueprint.json` and hardened `firestore.rules`.\n2. **Step 2: $T=0$ Grounding Utility, Deterministic Math & Gameplay Synthesis Engine**:\n   - Build `src/utils/timeGrounding.ts` (`Europe/London` clock, `26-27` season math, 18:00 UK drop countdown).\n   - Build `src/utils/fc27DeterministicEngine.ts` covering both **Menus Math** (Streamlined SBC Item Score, Holographic multipliers, 11-player puzzle solver, 5% tax, Gallery Rent-and-Flip) and **Gameplay Synthesis Math** (Chemistry Style stat boosts, AcceleRATE 2.0 archetype classifier, PlayStyle+ additive modifiers, Body Type weights, and 31 Roles++ Meta Score).\n   - Build `src/data/fc27ConsoleData.ts` with 2026\342\200\22327 verified console players, 24h/7d price history series, newly added promo items, active SBCs, Branching Evolutions, FUT Gallery Sets, and Live Patch Meta formations.\n3. **Step 3: Express Backend & Gemini API Routes (`server.ts`)**:\n   - Implement `/api/gemini/market-trend-analysis` (`gemini-4-argon` + `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`), `/api/gemini/gameplay-synthesis` (`gemini-4-argon` + `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`), `/api/gemini/sbc-And-evo-advisor`, `/api/gemini/live-patch-and-drops` (`gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch` grounded at $T=0$), and `/api/gemini/transcribe` (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`).\n4. **Step 4: Dual-Domain Responsive Dashboard (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`)**:\n   - Build the interactive Market Price Charts, New Item Tracker, Dual-Mode SBC Solver, FUT Gallery Rent-and-Flip Optimizer, Additive Gameplay Synthesis Lab, Live Patch & Meta Formation Hub, 33/33 Squad Builder, and ZenBook ScreenPad Plus Ticker.\n5. **Step 5: Compilation & Verification**:\n   - Run `compile_applet` and verify zero errors.\n"
