              text: "   - **Frictionless Club Sync**: 1-Click Web App JSON import (`Paletools`/`FUTClubAnalyzer`), Google Drive backup/restore, and hands-free Voice logging (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Principal Domain 2 \342\200\224 `GAMEPLAY` (Patch Meta, Formations & Additive Synthesis Engine)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Live Title Update & Patch Meta Tracker ($T=0$ Grounded)**: Tracks EA Sports FC 27 software patches and Live Tuning updates throughout the cycle (e.g., changes to R1 Agile Dribbling, Finesse/Trivela curves, defensive line height AI, and AcceleRATE sprint decay) so formation and player advice always reflects the *current* patch."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Meta Formations, Custom Tactics & FC IQ Share Codes**: Real-time meta formation rankings (e.g., `4-2-1-3`, `4-4-2 Holding`, `4-2-3-1 Wide`, `4-1-2-1-2 Narrow`), build-up speeds, defensive line heights, and counter-formation guides."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Isolated vs. Synthesized Additive Performance Engine**: A deterministic + AI calculator that computes a card\'s **True In-Game Output** by synthesizing:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - **Base Stats in Isolation** vs. **Chemistry Style Boosts** (0\342\200\2233 Chemistry Diamonds $\\times$ Hunter, Shadow, Engine, Hawk, Anchor, Finisher, Maestro, Architect)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - **Dynamic AcceleRATE 2.0 Recalculation**: Computes exact sprint archetype (*Explosive*, *Mostly Explosive*, *Controlled Explosive*, *Controlled*, *Controlled Lengthy*, *Mostly Lengthy*, *Lengthy*) from post-chemistry Agility, Strength, Acceleration, and Height."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - **PlayStyles & PlayStyles+ (3 PS+ Cap) Additive/Multiplicative Synergy**: Quantifies how PlayStyles+ (e.g., *Quick Step+*, *Rapid+*, *Incisive Pass+*, *Finesse Shot+*, *Anticipate+*) amplify raw attributes beyond the 99 stat cap."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - **Player Body Type & Physical Frame**: Factors in Unique/Custom animations, Lean/Stocky/High & Average frames, Weak Foot, Skill Moves, Reactions, and Composure."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - **31 Player Roles & Focuses (`Role`, `Role+`, `Role++`)**: Outputs a **Synthesized Meta Score (1\342\200\223100)** for any player in any Role under the current FC 27 patch."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
