    domain: "futbin.com"
    summary: "This is a collection of key tools, pages, and features available on **FUTBIN** for **EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team**[1]. Here is what each tool is used for and how you can access them:\n\n* **Market Index (Index 100):** Tracks live price fluctuations, trends, and overall health of the FC 27 transfer market (including rating-based indices like Index 83, 84, 85, etc., and top gainers/losers)[1].\n* **Cheapest by Rating:** Essential database filters showing the lowest-priced players grouped by rating (e.g., 83, 84, 85, 88+ rated) to help you efficiently complete Squad Building Challenges (SBCs)[2][3].\n* **Evolutions & Gallery:** Dedicated hubs to track active player upgrade paths, view popular evolution choices, build and preview card stat boosts, and check requirements or solutions for special game features like the **FUT Gallery**[4][5].\n* **Popular Players:** A trending list of the most viewed, meta, or heavily used Ultimate Team items in FC 27 based on community searches and gameplay popularity[6].\n* **SBC (Squad Building Challenges):** Comprehensive tools providing active SBC lists, cheapest solutions, automated solvers, and rating combinations[1]. \n\nYou can find all of these features directly on the [FUTBIN Website](https://www.futbin.com) under their respective navigation menus for FC 27[1].\n\nSources:\n[1] [futbin.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFpDgwkx4oIDzvK9wqwJ8HfFGk71OzvlSWTGdraybAesIY5oeFYIjimoTU7cHp4L2-wA9lQOAW2b3GEyETALhzPLcG1XaG8NtQ3J0TDZAjuvmBmX0R07g==)\n[2] [futbin.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF860Xqqs_h1O-6LeXsRL2DeFCkaQ-iyWdx2Q4xIBMVnTvDYn7V0ChGQ8eEsOilN5fZNfXKwJCypl5WhhdVSOTXxUPTtQjY-lyYkhGXxna2VGBQZI0c_eg5ZiTIT8GoVfgS6l4Hm__ZbUAA1W5UqMw0Ses=)\n[3] [fut.gg](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEoHuYHXQ9PXvbRAxjjrs-53TBRUSITX6XlDpLV_-r1QWJogQR6jgsLopev8nekNjTpKDU7LNF99kwu8q1BZbAka14VL9iDJNCOMIxdC-t5oW_X_xBk_582cRanvg==)\n[4] [futbin.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFONir8SIjvkbBRTy1urJicdsu8IBHNbSkqBKn3BH1smC1ZkvTYn8N06bvs6PBXqebFODFXtJNRx05djCdMnb0hZCCKkueWHN4jM7xjfM1S8Ou7lWQRiF9AbLzV2eopzLuNtIBJinDyuEfnP5iS)\n[5] [futbin.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFsfJqT1x_rcw6gWPDoEn6YAifsYTjEMoBcFEvalqIKlMrShrgCs2NJH1OpKsteAi9HixQF786U5vRjp6Nxux9fxbGdCaMKPFN7_au6OTDDCWWZsdmS67eP2ECcWBOp)\n[6] [futbin.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTxR05HOI6AZVsZSMZyVRovN6C47c-VxrG0kqNN4kcfy928JZUYl1n2x8pSsw1bD3GGHQO1BMLUg2Z_La2swr_Ac6TBe2ffvg9su9As1zXUjh6Wg5lbsCoWK-2hfI=)"
