        instruction: "# FC 27 UT App \342\200\224 Dual-Domain Terminal (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`) + FUTBIN MCP Connector Architecture (T=0 Grounded)\n\nAn EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Console) strategic engine structured into **Two Principal Domains** (**`MENUS`** & **`GAMEPLAY`**), powered by a **6-Connector Model Context Protocol (MCP) Pipeline** mapped directly to **FUTBIN FC 27** and **FotMob (`2026\342\200\22327` Season)** resources\342\200\224strictly grounded at **$T=0$ in British Time (`Europe/London`)** and tailored for **Asus ZenBook UX482 (Antigravity 2.24 + Dual-Screen)** and **Mobile Touch (`375px\342\200\223430px`)**.\n\n---\n\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> This plan integrates the recommended **MCP (Model Context Protocol) Connectors** mapped to **FUTBIN FC 27** resources alongside your Dual-Domain (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`) and RAEC upgrades:\n\n1. **6 Core MCP Connectors Mapped to FUTBIN FC 27 & FotMob Resources**:\n   - **1. `playwright-futbin-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-playwright`)**: Headless browser connector that reads dynamic JS-rendered FUTBIN FC 27 pages (`futbin.com/27/players`, `futbin.com/27/market` Index 100 & Holographic Index, `futbin.com/27/evolutions`, `futbin.com/27/gallery`) and FotMob `2026\342\200\22327` transfer rosters without getting blocked by dynamic DOM rendering.\n   - **2. `fetch-patch-sbc-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-fetch` / `firecrawl-mcp`)**: High-speed markdown/JSON fetcher for FUTBIN\'s **Cheapest by Rating** (`futbin.com/27/cheapest-by-rating`), **Active SBC Requirements**, and **EA Sports FC 27 Title Update / Patch Notes** at the 18:00 BST daily drop.\n   - **3. `sqlite-fc27-cache-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-sqlite`)**: Local SQLite database connector on your Asus ZenBook UX482 (`fc27_console_cache.db`) storing FUTBIN console prices, Streamlined SBC **Item Score** tables, Holographic multipliers, and your synced Club Inventory\342\200\224enabling **<2ms SQL lookups** and eliminating Gemini API quota exhaustion.\n   - **4. `memory-transfer-graph-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-memory`)**: Persistent Knowledge Graph storing verified **2026\342\200\22327 Season Transfers** (e.g., `Rodri -> FC Barcelona [LaLiga, 26-27]`) and your active **Branching Evolution Chains**, overriding LLM autoregressive frequency bias.\n   - **5. `google-drive-workspace-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-google-drive`)**: Bridges your ZenBook Antigravity 2.24 pipeline with Google Drive to auto-sync Web App club exports (`Paletools`/`FUTClubAnalyzer` JSON), SBC solutions, and trade ledgers.\n   - **6. `github-ut-tools-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-github`)**: Tracks open-source FC 27 Web App exporter schemas (`FUTClubAnalyzer`, `AutoSBC`, `FC-Tracker`) so club sync stays compatible after EA Web App updates.\n2. **Principal Domain 1 \342\200\224 `MENUS`**:\n   - Interactive **Console Market Data Visualization** (24h/7d SVG price charts, Market Index 100, Fodder Index, Holographic arbitrage alerts, 5G Bid-Flipper mode).\n   - **Dual-Mode SBC Solver**: Streamlined SBC **Item Score** calculator (Rating + Rarity + Regular $\\le 87$ / Pristine $\\ge 88$ Holographic multipliers) + deterministic 11-player chemistry puzzle solver using club untradeables first.\n   - **FUT Gallery Set, Tag & \"Rent-and-Flip\" Optimizer** + **850 SP Match Stacker**.\n3. **Principal Domain 2 \342\200\224 `GAMEPLAY`**:\n   - **Additive Gameplay Synthesis Calculator**: Computes isolated vs. synthesized effects of **Base Sub-Stats + Chemistry Styles (0\342\200\2233 Diamonds) + AcceleRATE 2.0 Archetypes + PlayStyles/PlayStyles+ (3 PS+ Cap) + Body Type + 31 Player Roles (`Role++`)**.\n   - **Live Patch & Title Update Meta Tracker ($T=0$)** + **Meta Formations & FC IQ Tactics**.\n\n---\n\n## 1. MCP Connector Architecture & FUTBIN FC 27 Resource Mapping\n\n### A. Which MCPs to Add & How Each Uses FUTBIN FC 27\n\n| MCP Server Name | Package / Command | FUTBIN FC 27 & Ecosystem Resource Targeted | Specific Role in Your FC 27 UT App |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **1. Playwright Browser MCP** | `@modelcontextprotocol/server-playwright` | \342\200\242 `futbin.com/27/players` (Console filters)<br>\342\200\242 `futbin.com/27/market` (Index 100 / 83\342\200\22390)<br>\342\200\242 `futbin.com/27/gallery` (100+ Sets & Tags)<br>\342\200\242 `fotmob.com` (`2026\342\200\22327` Squads) | Extracts live console auction prices, hourly graph arrays, Holographic card spreads, and PGP (Played Games Performance) stats rendered via client-side JavaScript. |\n| **2. Fetch / Firecrawl MCP** | `@modelcontextprotocol/server-fetch` | \342\200\242 `futbin.com/27/cheapest-by-rating`<br>\342\200\242 `futbin.com/27/squad-building-challenges`<br>\342\200\242 `futbin.com/27/evolutions`<br>\342\200\242 EA FC 27 Title Update Pitch Notes | Pulls lightweight HTML/JSON tables at **18:00 BST ($T=0$)** for cheapest fodder by OVR (81\342\200\22391), new SBC rules, branching Evolution constraints, and live gameplay patch notes. |\n| **3. Local SQLite Cache MCP** | `@modelcontextprotocol/server-sqlite` | \342\200\242 Local `fc27_futbin_mirror.db` on Asus ZenBook UX482 | Caches FUTBIN\'s Cheapest-by-Rating, Player Sub-Stats, 31 Roles++, and your 500+ Club Cards locally so SBC math and Gameplay Synthesis execute in **<2ms with zero API quota cost**. |\n| **4. Knowledge Graph Memory MCP** | `@modelcontextprotocol/server-memory` | \342\200\242 `2026\342\200\22327` Anti-Autoregressive Transfer Graph & Personal Club State | Locks in verified `26-27` club links (e.g., Rodri at FC Barcelona, not Man City) and remembers which players you have locked into Evolutions or Gauntlet squads. |\n| **5. Google Drive Workspace MCP** | `@modelcontextprotocol/server-google-drive` | \342\200\242 `/FC27_UT_Sync/` folder in Google Drive | Automatically ingests your exported EA Web App `club_inventory.json` and writes daily 18:00 BST market & SBC dossiers to Drive/Sheets. |\n| **6. GitHub Open-Source MCP** | `@modelcontextprotocol/server-github` | \342\200\242 `FUTClubAnalyzer`, `AutoSBC`, `FC-Tracker` repos | Keeps the Web App JSON importer and combinatorial SBC solver algorithms updated when EA patches the Companion/Web App. |\n\n### B. Ready-to-Use `mcp_config.json` for Antigravity 2.24 (Included In-App)\nWe will embed an interactive **MCP Connector Hub & Config Generator** inside the app that lets you inspect live MCP sync status, copy the exact `mcp_config.json` for your Asus ZenBook UX482 (`Antigravity v2.24`), and trigger manual or scheduled **18:00 BST FUTBIN Resource Syncs**.\n\n```\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202              ANTIGRAVITY 2.24 + AI STUDIO MCP RESOURCE PIPELINE                \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                                                                                \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  [FUTBIN FC 27 Console]               [FotMob 26-27]         [EA Web App JSON] \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Market Index & Hourly Graphs       \342\200\242 26-27 Transfers     