          \342\224\202  \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202  \342\200\242 DOMAIN 1: MENUS (Interactive Price Charts, Dual-Mode SBC, Gallery)    \342\224\202  \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202  \342\200\242 DOMAIN 2: GAMEPLAY (Additive Stat/PlayStyle+/Chem/AcceleRATE Synth)   \342\224\202  \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230  \342\224\202\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Dual-Domain User Experience (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`)\n\n### Domain 1: `MENUS` (Market Charts, SBCs, Gallery, Club & MCP Hub)\n- **Interactive Console Market Visualization**:\n  - Touch-friendly SVG/Canvas charts for **24h Hourly Price Curves**, **7d Trend Lines**, **FUTBIN Market Index 100**, and **Cheapest by Rating (82\342\200\22390)**, with 1-tap Gemini (`gemini-4-argon` `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) trend & arbitrage analysis.\n- **Dual-Mode SBC Engine**:\n  - **Streamlined SBC Item Score Calculator** (Rating + Rarity + Regular $\\le 87$ / Pristine $\\ge 88$ Holographic multipliers) + **11-Player Puzzle SBC Solver** prioritizing your untradeable club inventory and SBC Duplicate Storage.\n- **FUT Gallery Set, Tag & \"Rent-and-Flip\" Optimizer**:\n  - Tracks 100+ permanent Sets, Set Grades, Tag Bonuses, and calculates zero-loss discard flips after the 5% EA tax.\n\n### Domain 2: `GAMEPLAY` (Additive Synthesis Lab, Patch Meta & 33/33 Squads)\n- **Additive Stat + PlayStyle+ + Chemistry Style + AcceleRATE 2.0 Synthesis Lab**:\n  - Interactive calculator comparing **Stats in Isolation** vs. **Synthesized In-Game Output** across all **31 Player Roles (`Role`, `Role+`, `Role++`)**, Chemistry Styles (0\342\200\2233 Diamonds), AcceleRATE archetypes, Body Types, and FC 27\'s **3 PlayStyles+ cap**.\n- **Live Patch & Title Update Meta Tracker ($T=0$ Grounded)**:\n  - Tracks how current FC 27 Title Updates alter meta formations, defensive line heights, and PlayStyle effectiveness.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Execution Sequence\n\n1. **Step 1: OAuth, Firebase & Paid Model Provisioning**:\n   - Finalize Google Drive OAuth via `set_up_oauth` (`userConfirmedInUI: true`).\n   - Verify Firebase ToS (`GetFirebaseTos`) and provision Firestore (`ProvisionFirebase`).\n   - Trigger `show_aistudio_ui` (`paid_model_flow`) for `gemini-4-argon`.\n   - Create `firebase-blueprint.json` and hardened `firestore.rules`.\n2. **Step 2: $T=0$ Grounding Utility, Deterministic Math & Gameplay Synthesis Engine**:\n   - Build `src/utils/timeGrounding.ts` (`Europe/London` BST/GMT clock, `26-27` season math, 18:00 UK drop countdown).\n   - Build `src/utils/fc27DeterministicEngine.ts` (Streamlined SBC Item Score + Holographics, 11-player puzzle solver, Gallery Rent-and-Flip 5% tax, and the **Additive Gameplay Synthesis Calculator** for Stats + Chem Styles + PlayStyles+ + AcceleRATE + Body Type + 31 Roles++).\n   - Build `src/data/fc27ConsoleData.ts` with 2026\342\200\22327 verified console players (Rodri at FC Barcelona, etc.), 24h/7d price history series, Cheapest by Rating tables, active SBCs, Branching Evolutions, FUT Gallery Sets, Live Patch Meta formations, and the **6-Connector FUTBIN MCP Registry**.\n3. **Step 3: Express Backend & Gemini API Routes (`server.ts`)**:\n   - Implement `/api/gemini/market-trend-analysis` (`gemini-4-argon` + `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`), `/api/gemini/gameplay-synthesis` (`gemini-4-argon` + `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`), `/api/gemini/sbc-And-evo-advisor`, `/api/gemini/live-patch-and-drops` (`gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch` grounded at $T=0$), and `/api/gemini/transcribe` (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`).\n4. **Step 4: Dual-Domain Responsive Dashboard (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`) + ZenBook ScreenPad Mode**:\n   - Build the Header with the live $T=0$ British Time clock, Domain Switcher (`MENUS` vs. `GAMEPLAY`), and ZenBook ScreenPad Plus Ticker toggle.\n   - Build the interactive Market Price Charts, Dual-Mode SBC Solver, FUT Gallery Optimizer, MCP Connector Hub, Additive Gameplay Synthesis Lab, Live Patch Meta Hub, and 33/33 Squad Builder.\n5. **Step 5: Compilation & Verification**:\n   - Run `compile_applet` and verify zero errors.\n"
