    summary: "**Google Antigravity 2.0** is an agentic development and orchestration platform designed to shift workflows from single-prompt interactions to multi-agent task management[1][2]. Key architectural features and orchestration tools included in the platform ecosystem:\n\n* **Standalone Agentic Desktop App:** Rebuilt as an independent command center for macOS, Linux, and Windows to supervise local and background agents without needing to live strictly inside an IDE[3].\n* **Multi-Agent Orchestration & Dynamic Subagents:** The primary orchestrator can dynamically define, spawn, and delegate tasks to specialized subagents, allowing for parallel execution without polluting the main context window[3][4].\n* **Model Context Protocol (MCP) Integration:** Full native support for MCP enables agents to securely bridge with external databases, cloud resource providers (like Azure), issue trackers, and file systems, providing real-time data context and custom tool executions[5][6][7].\n* **Asynchronous Tasks & Scheduled Automation:** Introduces support for background tasks, cron-based scheduling (`/schedule`), and JSON hooks to control and automate recurring tasks or long-running jobs autonomously[3][8].\n\nSources:\n[1] [teamcopilot.ai](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG3uOxj5fjbZIdNzOeESoUQfaX-rJWdt-3IG3VqH7ScuEisq1F2bX6mvBTAyEdLVAso0goxbVuDlnlkGc0egHFypDWRlLNAbWavKIw4WeA8OVAfruPOLIInvKaGZ_IrOMH_NDNhiL_R-IXtNFqNPg10iCceae8-w1S9bQUf7YSxE-cv)\n[2] [tryformatter.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGiKVeVJfoPSopNDzWBtqvlWNjYCq8610a4ANwlgSzshJ9n7Co753gevGKVw-qKfGk3AB6DHMpSXWkl4y9Xhc26Jc91xxN7SdgE0TOqHf7deGnybG_EtMTOGSOqLz6xY4ZUBLyCILtoXJGgOIIoRlHR4tLuA0w_0v5mZ8aOQLyAwlgMCOvX5WT5HLHx)\n[3] [antigravity.google](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEiKwUejMZiyOii59dF4ZNl1YHbjpQU-r_6GymjR6hbovQYFIeNP6-X4-OpzzUuyMmNtk5grr7IzuzK6KftGOHeuF0YPd2jLfeacPiBYWK89rseghUSvauVdmIlk