        instruction: "# FC 27 UT App \342\200\224 Antigravity v2.25 Orchestrated Dual-Domain Terminal (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`) with Universal $T=0$ Temporal Anchoring\n\nAn EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Console) strategic platform architected for orchestration by the **Google Antigravity 2.0 Desktop App (`v2.25` Firmware/Release)** on your **Asus ZenBook UX482**, structured into **Two Principal Domains** (**`MENUS`** & **`GAMEPLAY`**), powered by a **7-Connector `.agents/mcp_config.json` FUTBIN & FotMob Pipeline**, and governed by **Universal Dynamic Temporal Anchoring ($T=0$)** on every runtime interaction.\n\n---\n\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> This plan integrates **Antigravity `v2.25` Desktop App** capabilities and **Universal Dynamic $T=0$ Runtime Anchoring** across the entire stack:\n\n1. **Universal Dynamic Temporal Anchoring ($T=0$ on Every Runtime Action)**:\n   - Nothing is ever hardcoded to a static date. Every UI render, button click, deterministic calculation, Express API call, and MCP tool execution dynamically evaluates `createTemporalAnchor(new Date())` at runtime in **British Time (`Europe/London` BST/GMT)**.\n   - **Dynamic Season & Content State Machine**: Automatically computes from the live $T=0$ clock:\n     - **Football Season**: Months Aug\342\200\223Dec $\\rightarrow$ **1st Half of `YYYY\342\200\223YY+1`** (e.g., Oct 2026 = `2026\342\200\22327` Season); Months Jan\342\200\223May $\\rightarrow$ **2nd Half of `YYYY-1\342\200\223YY`**.\n     - **FC 27 Ultimate Team Season Transition**: Dynamically detects that as of **Friday, 23 October 2026 BST**, FC 27 has rolled over from Season 1 into **Season 2 (Day 2)**\342\200\224automatically updating the **850 Daily SP Cap** tracker, Friday 18:00 BST Promo Drop countdown, and Weekend League (FUT Champions) schedule.\n     - **Every API & Agent Payload**: Injects `{ t0_iso, t0_uk_formatted, weekday, season_code: \"2026-27\", ms_until_1800_drop, antigravity_version: \"2.25\" }` into every request header and Gemini system instruction.\n2. **Google Antigravity 2.0 (`v2.25`) Desktop Orchestration Integration**:\n   - **Native `/browser` Subagent + Chrome DevTools MCP (`chrome-devtools-mcp`)**: Replaces brittle scraping by allowing Antigravity `v2.25`\'s built-in `/browser` subagent to attach directly to your active Chrome session (EA FC 27 Web App, FUTBIN FC 27, and FotMob `26-27` squads) via accessibility DOM snapshots.\n   - **Dynamic Parallel Subagents**: Spawns isolated subagents (`Subagent-FUTBIN-Prices`, `Subagent-FotMob-Transfers`, `Subagent-Evo-Sim`) in parallel without polluting your primary context window.\n   - **Native `/schedule` Cron & JSON Lifecycle Hooks**: Automates the **18:00 UK Daily Content Drop (`0 18 * * *` Europe/London)** and hourly FUTBIN Market Index syncs in the background.\n   - **Project-Scoped `.agents/mcp_config.json`**: Ships with an exportable and in-app configurable `.agents/mcp_config.json` tailored for Antigravity `v2.25`.\n   - **Jetski Reasoning & CoT Safety Verification**: Structured reasoning trace (`Thought -> Verification -> Output`) ensuring zero hallucinated club links and safe Google Drive / SQLite mutations.\n3. **Two Principal Domains (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`)**:\n   - **Domain 1 \342\200\224 `MENUS`**: Interactive Mobile & ZenBook Console Market Charts (24h/7d SVG price action, Market Index 100, Cheapest by Rating), Dual-Mode SBC Solver (**Streamlined Item Score** + **Holographic 1.25x/1.50x multipliers** + 11-Player Puzzle math), Authentic **FUT Gallery Set/Tag & \"Rent-and-Flip\" Optimizer**, and Frictionless Club Sync (Web App JSON, Google Drive, Voice `gemini-3.5-transcribe`).\n   - **Domain 2 \342\200\224 `GAMEPLAY`**: **Additive Synthesis Engine** computing isolated vs. synthesized effects of **Base Sub-Stats + Chemistry Styles (0\342\200\2233 Diamonds) + AcceleRATE 2.0 Archetypes + PlayStyles/PlayStyles+ (3 PS+ Cap) + Body Type + 31 Player Roles (`Role++`)**, paired with a **Live FC 27 Patch & Title Update Meta Tracker**.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Antigravity `v2.25` Capabilities & `.agents/mcp_config.json` Pipeline\n\n### A. Latest Antigravity `v2.25` Features Leveraged by the App\n\n| Antigravity `v2.25` Feature | How Our FC 27 UT App Uses It at Runtime ($T=0$) |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **1. Native `/browser` Subagent & Chrome DevTools MCP** | Reads live DOM/accessibility trees from `futbin.com/27/market`, `futbin.com/27/players`, `fotmob.com`, and your logged-in EA FC 27 Companion Web App tab to sync Coins, FIFA Points, Untradeables, and SBC Duplicate Storage with zero manual screenshots. |\n| **2. Dynamic Parallel Subagent Delegation** | At any user prompt or 18:00 BST drop, spawns 3 parallel workers: (1) *Market & Holographic Price Worker*, (2) *FotMob 26\342\200\22327 Transfer Verification Worker*, and (3) *Branching Evolution & Role++ Simulator*. |\n| **3. `/schedule` Background Cron & JSON Hooks** | Runs scheduled background polls (`0 18 * * *` UK Time for daily content drops; `*/15 * * * *` for tracked player price alerts) and pushes notifications to your ZenBook ScreenPad Plus ticker. |\n| **4. Scoped `.agents/mcp_config.json` Workspace Scaling** | Connects all 7 MCP servers (Chrome DevTools, Playwright, Fetch, Local SQLite Cache, Memory Knowledge Graph, Google Drive, GitHub) directly to the local and cloud workspace. |\n| **5. Jetski Structured Reasoning & Safety Guard** | Displays transparent reasoning steps (`T=0 Grounding Check` $\\rightarrow$ `26-27 Transfer Verification` $\\rightarrow$ `Deterministic Math` $\\rightarrow$ `Actionable Recommendation`) and blocks any unconfirmed file overwrites. |\n\n### B. The 7-Connector `.agents/mcp_config.json` Mapped to FUTBIN FC 27\n\n1. **`chrome-devtools-mcp` (New in `v2.25`)**: Connects Antigravity `v2.25`\'s `/browser` agent to your live Chrome session for instant EA Web App club inspection and FUTBIN live price graph extraction.\n2. **`playwright-futbin-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-playwright`)**: Headless fallback for scraping JS-rendered FUTBIN FC 27 pages (`Market Index 100`, `FUT Gallery Sets`, `Popular/PGP`, `Evolutions`) and FotMob `2026\342\200\22327` squads.\n3. **`fetch-patch-sbc-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-fetch`)**: High-speed ingestion of `futbin.com/27/cheapest-by-rating`, active SBC rules, and EA Sports FC 27 Title Update Pitch Notes.\n4. **`sqlite-fc27-cache-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-sqlite`)**: Local `fc27_futbin_mirror.db` on your Asus ZenBook UX482 serving `<2ms` SQL queries for SBC Item Scores and Gameplay Synthesis without spending Gemini API quota.\n5. **`memory-transfer-graph-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-memory`)**: Anti-autoregressive `2026\342\200\22327` Transfer Knowledge Graph (locking in truths like `Rodri -> FC Barcelona [LaLiga, 26-27]`).\n6. **`google-drive-workspace-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-google-drive`)**: Syncs club JSON backups, SBC solutions, and investment ledgers with Google Drive.\n7. **`github-ut-tools-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-github`)**: Monitors `FUTClubAnalyzer`, `AutoSBC`, and `Paletools` for schema updates.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Universal Dynamic Temporal Anchoring ($T=0$ Architecture)\n\n```\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202               UNIVERSAL T=0 TEMPORAL ANCHOR ENGINE (EVERY ACTION)              \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                                                                                \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  Runtime Event (UI Click / Chart Load / SBC Solve / Gemini Call / MCP Poll)    \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                                      \342\224\202                                         \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                                      \342\226\274                                         \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  createTemporalAnchor(new Date()) \342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\272 Evaluates Live Europe/London (BST/GMT)   \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Exact Timestamp: e.g. Fri, 23 Oct 2026, 07:33:12 BST (T=0)                  \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Football Season Rule: Month >= 8 (Aug-Dec) => \"2026-27 Season (1st Half)\"   \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 UT Cycle State: Season 2 Live | Friday Promo Drop @ 18:00 BST Countdown     \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Matchday Context: Friday Night Football / Weekend League (FUT Champs) Open  \342\224\202\n\342\224\202                                      \342\224\202                                         \342\224\202\n\342\224\202         \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\274\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\