  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Core Principle**\n\nI\'ve zeroed in on the user\'s core emphasis: dynamic temporal anchoring. It\'s becoming clear that this $T=0$ point is the key driver for discovering and autonomously upgrading firmware/software capabilities. The focus is no longer on hardcoding specific upgrade procedures. Instead, the approach is centered around a self-referential mechanism.\n\n\n**Refining the Temporal Anchor**\n\nI\'m now viewing the $T=0$ timestamp as the definitive source for discovering and integrating updates. The approach expands beyond the main app to its dependencies: the core firmware/software, EA Sports FC 27 patch, and other live components. This ensures everything syncs to the precise moment of user interaction, enabling dynamic discovery of new features and recalibrating the Gameplay Synthesis Engine accordingly.\n\n\n**Architecting the $T=0$ Engine**\n\nI\'m formalizing the temporal version and capability discovery engine, triggered by the $T=0$ timestamp. This focuses on a unified approach to accessing up-to-date versions of every relevant component: the Antigravity Desktop App itself, EA Sports FC 27 patches, FUTBIN live content (including the active UT season, content drops, promo cards, and SBC expirations), and FotMob\'s real-world roster and matchday information for the 2026-27 season. All this is built to unlock new app features dynamically.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_333832"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true, \"Summary\":\"Updated implementation plan featuring the T=0 Temporal Version & Capability Discovery Engine: dynamically anchors every prompt, interaction, and runtime initiation to British Time (T=0) to discover the latest Antigravity 2.0 Desktop App firmware/software version (currently v2.25 as of 23 Oct 2026 07:37 BST) and EA Sports FC 27 Title Update/Patch version, automatically unlocking and adapting app features to the latest release.\", \"UserFacing\":true}, \"CodeContent\":\"# FC 27 UT App \342\200\224 Dual-Domain Terminal (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`) with $T=0$ Temporal Firmware & Capability Discovery Engine\\n\\nAn EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Console) strategic platform built around a **Dynamic $T=0$ Temporal Anchoring & Version Discovery Engine**. Every user prompt, UI interaction, and runtime task first resolves the exact **British Time (`Europe/London` BST/GMT) timestamp at $T=0$** (e.g., `Friday, 23 October 2026, 07:37 BST`) and uses that anchor to **dynamically discover the latest software/firmware version and capabilities** of the **Google Antigravity 2.0 Desktop App** (currently **`v2.25`** at $T=0$), the **active EA Sports FC 27 Title Update / Live Tuning Patch**, **FUTBIN FC 27 Console Market/Content**, and **FotMob `2026\342\200\22327` Squad Transfers**\342\200\224automatically adapting and unlocking new features in the app as software updates roll out.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> This plan institutionalizes the **$T=0$ Temporal Version & Capability Discovery Loop** across every runtime layer:\\n\\n1. **Dynamic $T=0$ Temporal Firmware & Feature Discovery (Never Static)**:\\n   - Every time you open the app, click a tool, or send a prompt, the runtime executes `resolveTemporalEnvironment(new Date())` anchored to `Europe/London` ($T=0$).\\n   - Instead of hardcoding a fixed version forever, the app uses the **$T=0$ Timestamp + Live Search Grounding (`gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch` / MCP Fetch)** to resolve the **current software/firmware release and newly added capabilities** as of that exact moment:\\n     - **At current $T=0$ (`23 Oct 2026, 07:37 BST`)**: Resolves **Antigravity Desktop App `v2.25`** as the latest release and automatically enables `v2.25`-specific app capabilities (Native `/browser` Subagent + Chrome DevTools MCP bridge, `/schedule` autonomous cron hooks, Dynamic Parallel Subagents, `.agents/mcp_config.json` workspace scaling, and Jetski CoT verification).\\n     - **At any future $T=0$ (`t > 23 Oct 2026`)**: Automatically queries release channels as of the new $T=0$ date/time to detect if Antigravity (`v2.26+`) or EA Sports FC 27 (`Title Update #4+`) has shipped new features, dynamically adding those capabilities and patch weights to the app\'s orchestrator and Gameplay Synthesis Lab without manual rewrites.\\n2. **Four-Pillar $T=0$ Live State Resolution on Every Runtime**:\\n   - **Pillar A \342\200\224 Antigravity 2.0 Desktop App Firmware Resolver**: Checks latest version & changelog as of $T=0$ (`v2.25` today) and configures the active MCP & Subagent orchestration bar.\\n   - **Pillar B \342\200\224 EA Sports FC 27 Title Update & Live Tuning Patch Resolver**: Checks the latest FC 27 game patch as of $T=0$ and updates **Domain 2 (`GAMEPLAY`)** formation meta, PlayStyle+ multipliers, and AcceleRATE sprint curves.\\n   - **Pillar C \342\200\224 FUTBIN FC 27 Console Content & Market Resolver**: Checks active UT Season (`Season 2` as of 23 Oct 2026), 18:00 BST daily drop countdown, newly added promo/TOTW/Holographic cards, SBC expiries, and Gallery Sets in **Domain 1 (`MENUS`)**.\\n   - **Pillar D \342\200\224 FotMob `2026\342\200\22327` Anti-Autoregressive Transfer Resolver**: Computes the active football season from $T=0$ (Aug\342\200\223Dec 2026 = **1st Half of `2026\342\200\22327` Season**) and verifies real-world club registrations (e.g., Rodri at **FC Barcelona**) to defeat LLM historical frequency bias.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. How the $T=0$ Temporal Version & Capability Discovery Engine Works\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202        1. RUNTIME INITIATION / USER PROMPT / UI INTERACTION (T = 0)            \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202        Evaluates Live UK Clock: e.g., Friday, 23 October 2026 \302\267 07:37 BST      \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                                        \342\224\202\\n                                        \342\226\274\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202        2. T=0 TEMPORAL VERSION & CAPABILITY DISCOVERY ENGINE                   \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                                                                                \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\20