              text: "     - **FC 27 Ultimate Team Season Transition**: Dynamically detects that as of **Friday, 23 October 2026 BST**, FC 27 has rolled over from Season 1 into **Season 2 (Day 2)**\342\200\224automatically updating the **850 Daily SP Cap** tracker, Friday 18:00 BST Promo Drop countdown, and Weekend League (FUT Champions) schedule."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - **Every API & Agent Payload**: Injects `{ t0_iso, t0_uk_formatted, weekday, season_code: \"2026-27\", ms_until_1800_drop, antigravity_version: \"2.25\" }` into every request header and Gemini system instruction."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Google Antigravity 2.0 (`v2.25`) Desktop Orchestration Integration**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Native `/browser` Subagent + Chrome DevTools MCP (`chrome-devtools-mcp`)**: Replaces brittle scraping by allowing Antigravity `v2.25`\'s built-in `/browser` subagent to attach directly to your active Chrome session (EA FC 27 Web App, FUTBIN FC 27, and FotMob `26-27` squads) via accessibility DOM snapshots."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Dynamic Parallel Subagents**: Spawns isolated subagents (`Subagent-FUTBIN-Prices`, `Subagent-FotMob-Transfers`, `Subagent-Evo-Sim`) in parallel without polluting your primary context window."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Native `/schedule` Cron & JSON Lifecycle Hooks**: Automates the **18:00 UK Daily Content Drop (`0 18 * * *` Europe/London)** and hourly FUTBIN Market Index syncs in the background."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Project-Scoped `.agents/mcp_config.json`**: Ships with an exportable and in-app configurable `.agents/mcp_config.json` tailored for Antigravity `v2.25`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Jetski Reasoning & CoT Safety Verification**: Structured reasoning trace (`Thought -> Verification -> Output`) ensuring zero hallucinated club links and safe Google Drive / SQLite mutations."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **Two Principal Domains (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Domain 1 \342\200\224 `MENUS`**: Interactive Mobile & ZenBook Console Market Charts (24h/7d SVG price action, Market Index 100, Cheapest by Rating), Dual-Mode SBC Solver (**Streamlined Item Score** + **Holographic 1.25x/1.50x multipliers** + 11-Player Puzzle math), Authentic **FUT Gallery Set/Tag & \"Rent-and-Flip\" Optimizer**, and Frictionless Club Sync (Web App JSON, Google Drive, Voice `gemini-3.5-transcribe`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Domain 2 \342\200\224 `GAMEPLAY`**: **Additive Synthesis Engine** computing isolated vs. synthesized effects of **Base Sub-Stats + Chemistry Styles (0\342\200\2233 Diamonds) + AcceleRATE 2.0 Archetypes + PlayStyles/PlayStyles+ (3 PS+ Cap) + Body Type + 31 Player Roles (`Role++`)**, paired with a **Live FC 27 Patch & Title Update Meta Tracker**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
