              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "### A. Latest Antigravity `v2.25` Features Leveraged by the App"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "| Antigravity `v2.25` Feature | How Our FC 27 UT App Uses It at Runtime ($T=0$) |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "| :--- | :--- |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "| **1. Native `/browser` Subagent & Chrome DevTools MCP** | Reads live DOM/accessibility trees from `futbin.com/27/market`, `futbin.com/27/players`, `fotmob.com`, and your logged-in EA FC 27 Companion Web App tab to sync Coins, FIFA Points, Untradeables, and SBC Duplicate Storage with zero manual screenshots. |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "| **2. Dynamic Parallel Subagent Delegation** | At any user prompt or 18:00 BST drop, spawns 3 parallel workers: (1) *Market & Holographic Price Worker*, (2) *FotMob 26\342\200\22327 Transfer Verification Worker*, and (3) *Branching Evolution & Role++ Simulator*. |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "| **3. `/schedule` Background Cron & JSON Hooks** | Runs scheduled background polls (`0 18 * * *` UK Time for daily content drops; `*/15 * * * *` for tracked player price alerts) and pushes notifications to your ZenBook ScreenPad Plus ticker. |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "| **4. Scoped `.agents/mcp_config.json` Workspace Scaling** | Connects all 7 MCP servers (Chrome DevTools, Playwright, Fetch, Local SQLite Cache, Memory Knowledge Graph, Google Drive, GitHub) directly to the local and cloud workspace. |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "| **5. Jetski Structured Reasoning & Safety Guard** | Displays transparent reasoning steps (`T=0 Grounding Check` $\\rightarrow$ `26-27 Transfer Verification` $\\rightarrow$ `Deterministic Math` $\\rightarrow$ `Actionable Recommendation`) and blocks any unconfirmed file overwrites. |"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "### B. The 7-Connector `.agents/mcp_config.json` Mapped to FUTBIN FC 27"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **`chrome-devtools-mcp` (New in `v2.25`)**: Connects Antigravity `v2.25`\'s `/browser` agent to your live Chrome session for instant EA Web App club inspection and FUTBIN live price graph extraction."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **`playwright-futbin-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-playwright`)**: Headless fallback for scraping JS-rendered FUTBIN FC 27 pages (`Market Index 100`, `FUT Gallery Sets`, `Popular/PGP`, `Evolutions`) and FotMob `2026\342\200\22327` squads."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **`fetch-patch-sbc-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-fetch`)**: High-speed ingestion of `futbin.com/27/cheapest-by-rating`, active SBC rules, and EA Sports FC 27 Title Update Pitch Notes."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **`sqlite-fc27-cache-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-sqlite`)**: Local `fc27_futbin_mirror.db` on your Asus ZenBook UX482 serving `<2ms` SQL queries for SBC Item Scores and Gameplay Synthesis without spending Gemini API quota."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "5. **`memory-transfer-graph-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-memory`)**: Anti-autoregressive `2026\342\200\22327` Transfer Knowledge Graph (locking in truths like `Rodri -> FC Barcelona [LaLiga, 26-27]`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "6. **`google-drive-workspace-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-google-drive`)**: Syncs club JSON backups, SBC solutions, and investment ledgers with Google Drive."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "7. **`github-ut-tools-mcp` (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-github`)**: Monitors `FUTClubAnalyzer`, `AutoSBC`, and `Paletools` for schema updates."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
