              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "> This plan institutionalizes the **$T=0$ Temporal Version & Capability Discovery Loop** across every runtime layer:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Dynamic $T=0$ Temporal Firmware & Feature Discovery (Never Static)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Every time you open the app, click a tool, or send a prompt, the runtime executes `resolveTemporalEnvironment(new Date())` anchored to `Europe/London` ($T=0$)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Instead of hardcoding a fixed version forever, the app uses the **$T=0$ Timestamp + Live Search Grounding (`gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch` / MCP Fetch)** to resolve the **current software/firmware release and newly added capabilities** as of that exact moment:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - **At current $T=0$ (`23 Oct 2026, 07:37 BST`)**: Resolves **Antigravity Desktop App `v2.25`** as the latest release and automatically enables `v2.25`-specific app capabilities (Native `/browser` Subagent + Chrome DevTools MCP bridge, `/schedule` autonomous cron hooks, Dynamic Parallel Subagents, `.agents/mcp_config.json` workspace scaling, and Jetski CoT verification)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - **At any future $T=0$ (`t > 23 Oct 2026`)**: Automatically queries release channels as of the new $T=0$ date/time to detect if Antigravity (`v2.26+`) or EA Sports FC 27 (`Title Update #4+`) has shipped new features, dynamically adding those capabilities and patch weights to the app\'s orchestrator and Gameplay Synthesis Lab without manual rewrites."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Four-Pillar $T=0$ Live State Resolution on Every Runtime**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Pillar A \342\200\224 Antigravity 2.0 Desktop App Firmware Resolver**: Checks latest version & changelog as of $T=0$ (`v2.25` today) and configures the active MCP & Subagent orchestration bar."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Pillar B \342\200\224 EA Sports FC 27 Title Update & Live Tuning Patch Resolver**: Checks the latest FC 27 game patch as of $T=0$ and updates **Domain 2 (`GAMEPLAY`)** formation meta, PlayStyle+ multipliers, and AcceleRATE sprint curves."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Pillar C \342\200\224 FUTBIN FC 27 Console Content & Market Resolver**: Checks active UT Season (`Season 2` as of 23 Oct 2026), 18:00 BST daily drop countdown, newly added promo/TOTW/Holographic cards, SBC expiries, and Gallery Sets in **Domain 1 (`MENUS`)**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Pillar D \342\200\224 FotMob `2026\342\200\22327` Anti-Autoregressive Transfer Resolver**: Computes the active football season from $T=0$ (Aug\342\200\223Dec 2026 = **1st Half of `2026\342\200\22327` Season**) and verifies real-world club registrations (e.g., Rodri at **FC Barcelona**) to defeat LLM historical frequency bias."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
