  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Goal**: Build the **FC 27 UT App**, an EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Console: PS5, Xbox Series X|S, PC) strategic companion and market terminal inspired by FUTBIN, FUT.GG, EasySBC, and FotMob.\n   - **Core Requirements & Architecture**:\n     1. **Universal Dynamic Temporal Anchoring ($T=0$ in British Time `Europe/London` BST/GMT)**: Every prompt, UI interaction, and runtime action dynamically resolves the current UK timestamp ($T=0$), calculates the active football season (`2026-27` / `26-27` 1st Half for Aug\342\200\223Dec; `YYYY-1\342\200\223YY` 2nd Half for Jan\342\200\223May), tracks the 18:00 UK daily content drop countdown, and resolves the latest **Google Antigravity 2.0 Desktop App** firmware version (`v2.25` as of 23 Oct 2026) and **EA Sports FC 27 Title Update (`#3.1` / Live Tuning `#4`)**.\n     2. **Anti-Autoregressive Transfer Law**: Strictly grounds all player clubs and chemistry links in the **2026/27 season** verified via **FotMob + FUTBIN FC 27 Console** (e.g., **Rodri plays for FC Barcelona** in LaLiga EA Sports, Kylian Mbapp\303\251 plays for Real Madrid, etc.). Zero legacy FC 24/25/26 data.\n     3. **Two Principal Domains (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`)**:\n        - **Domain 1 (`MENUS`)**:\n          - **Club & Sync**: Tracks Coins, FIFA Points, 850 Daily SP Cap, **Multi-Objective Match Stacker** (stacking 4\342\200\2235 Foundations, Live Events, and Evolution tasks simultaneously), SBC Duplicate Storage, and **Frictionless Club Sync** (1-Click Web App JSON import compatible with `Paletools`/`FUTClubAnalyzer`, Google Drive REST API v3 sync with mandatory confirmation modal before delete/overwrite, and hands-free Voice logging via `gemini-3.5-transcribe`).\n          - **Dual-Mode SBC Engine**: Supports FC 27\'s **Streamlined SBCs** (cumulative **Item Score** target, Base Bronze/Silver/Gold with no Common/Rare split, and **Regular Holographic $\\le 87$ [1.25x]** & **Pristine Holographic $\\ge 88$ [1.50x]** multipliers, exhausting SBC Duplicate Storage first in `<2ms` deterministic TypeScript math) alongside **11-Player Chemistry Puzzle SBCs**.\n          - **Authentic FUT Gallery Set, Tag & \"Rent-and-Flip\" Optimizer**: Tracks 100+ permanent Gallery Sets, Set Grades, Tag Bonuses, and calculates discard-floor \"Buy, Register in Set, Resell\" flips after the mandatory 5% EA Transfer Tax.\n          - **Market & 5G Investments**: Interactive SVG 24H Hourly & 7D Trend charts, Cheapest by Rating + Holographic Arbitrage table, 5G Bid-Flipper filter, and 5% EA tax break-even calculator.\n        - **Domain 2 (`GAMEPLAY`)**:\n          - **Additive Gameplay Synthesis Lab**: Computes **Stats in Isolation** vs. **Synthesized In-Game Performance** across Base Sub-Attributes, Chemistry Styles (0\342\200\2233 Chemistry Diamonds), **AcceleRATE 2.0** sprint archetype shifts, **PlayStyles+ (strictly capped at 3 PS+)**, Body Type frames, and **31 Player Roles (`Role`, `Role+`, `Role++`)** under Title Update #3.1.\n          - **Branching Evolution Pathways & Meta Formations**: Compares Branch A vs. Branch B stat/PlayStyle+/Role++ unlocks, recommends external market fits matching squad chemistry, and provides Title Update #3.1 Meta Formations (`4-2-1-3`, `4-4-2 Holding`) with FC IQ Share Codes.\n     4. **Hardware & Responsive Ergonomics**:\n        - Responsive sidebar on desktop + thumb-friendly bottom navigation bar on mobile (`375px\342\200\223430px`, $\\le 15\\%$ sticky cap) + toggleable **Asus ZenBook UX482 ScreenPad Plus Secondary Ticker** mode.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Planning & Approvals Completed**: The user approved the implementation plan (`Plan action: proceed`) located at `/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607/implementation_plan.md`.\n   - **OAuth & Firebase Provisioned & Deployed**:\n     - `set_up_oauth` called with `userConfirmedInUI: true` and all Google Drive scopes for project `gen-lang-client-0847228374`.\n     - `rpc_action` (`GetFirebaseTos` and `ProvisionFirebase`) completed; created `/firebase-applet-config.json`.\n     - Installed `firebase` npm package.\n     - Created `/firebase-blueprint.json`, `/security_spec.md`, and `/firestore.rules` (implementing all 8 Zero-Trust security pillars) and deployed rules via `rpc_action` (`DeployRules`).\n   - **Configuration & Backend Completed**:\n     - Updated `/metadata.json` (name: `\"FC 27 UT App\"`, description, microphone permission, server-side Gemini capability).\n     - Updated `/index.html` (synced title/meta tags, loaded `Outfit`, `Plus Jakarta Sans`, and `JetBrains Mono` Google Fonts).\n     - Updated `/package.json` (`\"dev\": \"tsx server.ts\"`, `\"start\": \"node server.ts\"`).\n     - Created `/.agents/mcp_config.json` (7-connector Antigravity v2.25 MCP configuration for Chrome DevTools, Playwright FUTBIN, Fetch, SQLite cache, Memory Transfer Graph, Google Drive, and GitHub).\n     - Created `/server.ts` (Express + Vite middleware server with `@google/genai` routes `/api/gemini/discover-t0-versions` using `gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch`, `/api/gemini/high-thinking-advisor` using `gemini-4-argon` + `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`, `/api/gemini/chat` multi-turn with model selector, and `/api/gemini/transcribe` using `gemini-3.5-transcribe`).\n   - **Frontend Utilities, Data, Services & Sub-Components Completed**:\n     - `/src/utils/timeGrounding.ts` \342\200\224 Live `Europe/London` $T=0$ clock, dynamic `2026-27` season resolver, 18:00 UK drop countdown, and Antigravity `v2.25` firmware manifest.\n     - `/src/data/fc27ConsoleData.ts` \342\200\224 Full 2026/27 FC 27 Console dataset (Rodri at FC Barcelona, Yamal, Mbapp\303\251, Bellingham, Pedri, Saliba, Saka, Kound\303\251, Balde, Palmer, Raya, Parejo, Cheapest by Rating + Holographic Arbitrage table, Streamlined & Puzzle SBCs, FUT Gallery Sets, Branching Evolutions, Match Stacker Objectives, and Meta Formations).\n     - `/src/utils/fc27DeterministicEngine.ts` \342\200\224 `<2ms` deterministic solvers for Streamlined SBC Item Score, 5% EA Tax, 33/33 Squad Chemistry, AcceleRATE 2.0 classification, and Additive Gameplay Synthesis.\n     - `/src/services/firebaseAndDriveService.ts` \342\200\224 Firebase Auth (`signInWithPopup` with Google Drive scopes and in-memory token cache), Firestore club sync, and Google Drive REST API v3 backup/list/delete functions.\n     - `/src/index.css` \342\200\224 Custom typography, tabular numerals, and official `.gsi-material-button` Google Sign-In styles.\n     - `/src/components/InteractiveMarketChart.tsx` \342\200\224 24H/7D SVG touch price chart, 5% EA tax calculator, and Gemini 4 Argon trend trigger.\n     - `/src/components/GameplaySynthesisView.tsx` \342\200\224 Complete Domain 2 (`GAMEPLAY`) view.\n     - `/src/components/AntigravityMcpAndChatDrawer.tsx` \342\200\224 Antigravity `v2.25` MCP Hub, Multi-turn Gemini Chatbot, Voice Mic recorder, and Ecosystem Comparison Matrix.\n   - **Remaining Work**:\n     - Write `/src/App.tsx` integrating all views (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY` domain switcher, Sidebar + Mobile Bottom Navigation, Header with live $T=0$ British Time clock & official Sign in with Google button, Club Sync & 850 SP Match Stacker, Dual-Mode SBC Solver, FUT Gallery Rent-and-Flip Optimizer, Interactive Market & 5G Investments, ZenBook UX482 ScreenPad Plus Ticker bar, and Google Drive Sync & Confirmation Modal).\n     - Run `compile_applet` to verify zero TypeScript or build errors.\n\n3. **Key Findings & Technical Decisions**\n   - **Artifact Path Rule**: Only needed during Planning Mode (`/.aistudio/artifacts/...`); we are now in Phase 3 (Build Execution).\n   - **Frontend Design Rules**: Strictly follow the 3-zone Top Bar Contract in `<header>`, use `whitespace-nowrap shrink-0` on single-line buttons/tabs, use `font-mono tabular-nums` on all numeric/coin/score displays, and avoid decorative pulsing dots or thick left accent borders (`border-l-4`).\n   - **Paid Model Flow**: Because the app uses `gemini-4-argon`, after compiling and verifying `/src/App.tsx`, we should call `show_aistudio_ui` with `ui_type: \"paid_model_flow\"` as our final tool call before yielding so the user can attach a paid API key if needed.\n\n4. **Active Context**\n   - All dependencies (`firebase`, `@google/genai`, `lucide-react`, `express`, `tailwindcss`) are installed and ready.\n   - `/src/App.tsx` is currently the initial placeholder and just needs to be written to tie together `/src/utils/timeGrounding.ts`, `/src/data/fc27ConsoleData.ts`, `/src/utils/fc27DeterministicEngine.ts`, `/src/services/firebaseAndDriveService.ts`, `/src/components/InteractiveMarketChart.tsx`, `/src/components/GameplaySynthesisView.tsx`, and `/src/components/AntigravityMcpAndChatDrawer.tsx`.\n\n5. **Next Steps (Immediate Priority Order)**\n   1. **Write `/src/App.tsx`**: Implement the complete Dual-Domain (`MENUS` & `GAMEPLAY`) application shell and all interactive tabs (`Club & Match Stacker`, `Dual-Mode SBCs`, `FUT Gallery Rent-and-Flip`, `Console Market & 5G Investments`, `Gameplay Synthesis Lab`, and `Antigravity v2.25 MCP & AI Chat`), including the live 1-second $T=0$ British Time clock, Web App JSON importer modal, Google Drive backup/delete confirmation modal, and Asus ZenBook UX482 ScreenPad Plus bottom ticker.\n   2. **Verify Build**: Call `compile_applet` (and `restart_dev_server` if needed) to verify there are zero TypeScript or bundle errors.\n   3. **Prompt Paid Model Flow**: Call `show_aistudio_ui` with `ui_type: \"paid_model_flow\"` for `gemini-4-argon` and present a concise summary of the completed application.\n\n6. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Never use `window.alert` or `window.confirm` (use custom React modals for Google Drive overwrite/delete confirmations).\n   - Maintain strict `2026-27` season truth (e.g., Rodri at FC Barcelona) and 5% EA Transfer Tax math across every view.\n</summary>"
