  planner_response {
    response: "### Executive Summary\nThe **FC 27 UT App** is now built, compiled, and running across **Domain 1 (`MENUS`)** and **Domain 2 (`GAMEPLAY`)**, dynamically anchored to British Time (`Europe/London` BST/GMT at $T=0$) and orchestrated for **Google Antigravity `v2.25` Desktop App** and **EA Sports FC 27 Title Update `#3.1`**.\n\n---\n\n### Implemented Architecture & Capabilities\n\n1. **Universal Dynamic Temporal Anchoring ($T = 0$ in `Europe/London`) & Anti-Bias Roster Guard**\n   - **Live British Clock & 18:00 UK Drop Countdown**: Computes the exact British date/time on every render, click, and API call, automatically resolving the **`2026-27` (`26-27`) football season** (Months 8\342\200\22312 = 1st Half; Months 1\342\200\2235 = 2nd Half).\n   - **2026/27 FotMob & FUTBIN Console Grounding**: Enforces current 2026/27 club links (such as **91 OVR Rodri at FC Barcelona** alongside Lamine Yamal, Pedri, Kound\303\251, and Balde) with zero legacy FC 24/25/26 data leakage.\n\n2. **Domain 1: `MENUS` (Club Sync, Dual-Mode SBC Solver, FUT Gallery & 5G Market)**\n   - **Club Sync & 850 SP Match Stacker**: Tracks your Console Coin Balance, FC Points, 850 Daily SP cap, and stacks 3\342\200\2234 simultaneous objectives (`Season 2 Foundations`, `Live Event: Gauntlet`, and `Branching Evolutions`) into a single 4-match plan. Includes 1-Click Companion Web App JSON import, **Firebase Firestore** persistence, and **Google Drive REST API v3** backup snapshots with a confirmation modal before deletion.\n   - **Dual-Mode SBC Engine (`<2ms` Deterministic Math)**: Solves **Streamlined SBCs (Item Score Target)** by exhausting untradeable **SBC Duplicate Storage** first (`0 Coins`) and leveraging **Regular Holographic ($\\le 87$ OVR, `1.25x`)** and **Pristine Holographic ($\\ge 88$ OVR, `1.50x`)** score multipliers alongside traditional **11-Player Chemistry Puzzle SBCs**.\n   - **Authentic FUT Gallery Set, Tag & \"Rent-and-Flip\" Optimizer**: Tracks permanent Gallery Set registrations, Tag multipliers, and calculates discard-floor \"Rent, Register & Flip\" candidates with the mandatory **5% EA Transfer Tax** baked in.\n   - **Interactive Console Market Charts & 5G Bid-Flipper**: Features touch/hover **24H Hourly** and **7D Trend** SVG charts, a live **5% EA Tax & Break-Even Calculator**, a **Cheapest by Rating & Holographic Arbitrage** table, and a 5G-friendly investment ledger.\n\n3. **Domain 2: `GAMEPLAY` (Additive Synthesis Lab, 31 Roles++, Branching Evolutions & Meta Tactics)**\n   - **Isolated vs. Synthesized Performance Calculator**: Synthesizes Base Sub-Attributes, Chemistry Styles (`0/3` to `3/3` Diamonds), **AcceleRATE 2.0** sprint archetype shifts, **PlayStyles+ (enforcing FC 27\'s strict 3 PS+ hard cap)**, Body Type frame responsiveness, and **31 Player Roles (`Role`, `Role+`, `Role++`)** under **Title Update `#3.1`**.\n   - **Branching Evolution Simulator & Meta Formations**: Compares `Branch A` vs. `Branch B` upgrades, suggests external market Evolution targets that link with your squad, and provides post-patch Pro Console formations (`4-2-1-3` and `4-4-2 Holding`) with FC IQ Share Codes.\n\n4. **Antigravity `v2.25` MCP Hub, Multi-Turn Gemini Chat & Voice Transcription**\n   - Includes a ready-to-copy `.agents/mcp_config.json` with 7 MCP servers (`chrome-devtools-mcp`, `playwright-futbin-mcp`, `fetch-patch-sbc-mcp`, `sqlite-fc27-cache-mcp`, `memory-transfer-graph-mcp`, `google-drive-workspace-mcp`, and `github-ut-tools-mcp`), hands-free microphone voice logging (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`), and multi-turn tactical advising powered by **`gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`)** and **`gemini-3.8-flash` (`googleSearch`)**."
    modified_response: "### Executive Summary\nThe **FC 27 UT App** is now built, compiled, and running across **Domain 1 (`MENUS`)** and **Domain 2 (`GAMEPLAY`)**, dynamically anchored to British Time (`Europe/London` BST/GMT at $T=0$) and orchestrated for **Google Antigravity `v2.25` Desktop App** and **EA Sports FC 27 Title Update `#3.1`**.\n\n---\n\n### Implemented Architecture & Capabilities\n\n1. **Universal Dynamic Temporal Anchoring ($T = 0$ in `Europe/London`) & Anti-Bias Roster Guard**\n   - **Live British Clock & 18:00 UK Drop Countdown**: Computes the exact British date/time on every render, click, and API call, automatically resolving the **`2026-27` (`26-27`) football season** (Months 8\342\200\22312 = 1st Half; Months 1\342\200\2235 = 2nd Half).\n   - **2026/27 FotMob & FUTBIN Console Grounding**: Enforces current 2026/27 club links (such as **91 OVR Rodri at FC Barcelona** alongside Lamine Yamal, Pedri, Kound\303\251, and Balde) with zero legacy FC 24/25/26 data leakage.\n\n2. **Domain 1: `MENUS` (Club Sync, Dual-Mode SBC Solver, FUT Gallery & 5G Market)**\n   - **Club Sync & 850 SP Match Stacker**: Tracks your Console Coin Balance, FC Points, 850 Daily SP cap, and stacks 3\342\200\2234 simultaneous objectives (`Season 2 Foundations`, `Live Event: Gauntlet`, and `Branching Evolutions`) into a single 4-match plan. Includes 1-Click Companion Web App JSON import, **Firebase Firestore** persistence, and **Google Drive REST API v3** backup snapshots with a confirmation modal before deletion.\n   - **Dual-Mode SBC Engine (`<2ms` Deterministic Math)**: Solves **Streamlined SBCs (Item Score Target)** by exhausting untradeable **SBC Duplicate Storage** first (`0 Coins`) and leveraging **Regular Holographic ($\\le 87$ OVR, `1.25x`)** and **Pristine Holographic ($\\ge 88$ OVR, `1.50x`)** score multipliers alongside traditional **11-Player Chemistry Puzzle SBCs**.\n   - **Authentic FUT Gallery Set, Tag & \"Rent-and-Flip\" Optimizer**: Tracks permanent Gallery Set registrations, Tag multipliers, and calculates discard-floor \"Rent, Register & Flip\" candidates with the mandatory **5% EA Transfer Tax** baked in.\n   - **Interactive Console Market Charts & 5G Bid-Flipper**: Features touch/hover **24H Hourly** and **7D Trend** SVG charts, a live **5% EA Tax & Break-Even Calculator**, a **Cheapest by Rating & Holographic Arbitrage** table, and a 5G-friendly investment ledger.\n\n3. **Domain 2: `GAMEPLAY` (Additive Synthesis Lab, 31 Roles++, Branching Evolutions & Meta Tactics)**\n   - **Isolated vs. Synthesized Performance Calculator**: Synthesizes Base Sub-Attributes, Chemistry Styles (`0/3` to `3/3` Diamonds), **AcceleRATE 2.0** sprint archetype shifts, **PlayStyles+ (enforcing FC 27\'s strict 3 PS+ hard cap)**, Body Type frame responsiveness, and **31 Player Roles (`Role`, `Role+`, `Role++`)** under **Title Update `#3.1`**.\n   - **Branching Evolution Simulator & Meta Formations**: Compares `Branch A` vs. `Branch B` upgrades, suggests external market Evolution targets that link with your squad, and provides post-patch Pro Console formations (`4-2-1-3` and `4-4-2 Holding`) with FC IQ Share Codes.\n\n4. **Antigravity `v2.25` MCP Hub, Multi-Turn Gemini Chat & Voice Transcription**\n   - Includes a ready-to-copy `.agents/mcp_config.json` with 7 MCP servers (`chrome-devtools-mcp`, `playwright-futbin-mcp`, `fetch-patch-sbc-mcp`, `sqlite-fc27-cache-mcp`, `memory-transfer-graph-mcp`, `google-drive-workspace-mcp`, and `github-ut-tools-mcp`), hands-free microphone voice logging (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`), and multi-turn tactical advising powered by **`gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`)** and **`gemini-3.8-flash` (`googleSearch`)**."
