    response: "### Executive Summary\nYour paid API key is active and bound to the server-side **`gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`)**, **`gemini-3.8-flash` (`googleSearch`)**, **`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`**, and **`gemini-3.5-transcribe`** endpoints, and your **Firestore (`ai-studio-fc27utapp-2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607`)** and **Google Drive REST API v3** integrations are live.\n\n---\n\n### Ready-to-Use Capabilities Across Both Principal Domains\n\n1. **Universal Dynamic Temporal Anchoring ($T = 0$ in `Europe/London` BST/GMT)**\n   - **Live British Time Clock & 18:00 UK Drop Countdown**: Every click, solver run, and AI request stamps the exact UK millisecond ($T=0$), resolves the **`2026-27` (`26-27`) football season**, and verifies **Google Antigravity `v2.25` Desktop App** firmware alongside **EA Sports FC 27 Title Update `#3.1`**.\n   - **Anti-Autoregressive 2026/27 Roster Grounding**: Grounded via FotMob and FUTBIN FC 27 Console (e.g., **91 OVR Pristine Holographic Rodri at FC Barcelona** linking with Lamine Yamal, Pedri, Kound\303\251, and Balde).\n\n2. **Domain 1: `MENUS` (Club Sync \302\267 Dual-Mode SBCs \302\267 FUT Gallery \302\267 5G Market)**\n   - **Club, Sync & 850 SP Match Stacker**: Syncs your Coin balance, FC Points, and 850 Daily SP cap to **Firestore** and **Google Drive** (with confirmation before any snapshot deletion), imports Companion Web App JSON dumps, and stacks 3\342\200\2234 simultaneous objectives (`Season 2 Foundations`, `Live Event: Gauntlet`, and `Branching Evolutions`) into 4 matches.\n   - **Dual-Mode SBC Engine (`<2ms` Math + `gemini-4-argon` Verification)**: Solves **Streamlined SBCs (Item Score Target)** by exhausting **SBC Duplicate Storage** first (`0 Coins`) and applying **Regular Holographic (`1.25x`)** and **Pristine Holographic (`1.50x`)** score multipliers, alongside **11-Player Chemistry Puzzle SBCs**.\n   - **Authentic FUT Gallery Set & \"Rent-and-Flip\" Optimizer**: Tracks permanent Gallery Set registrations, Tag multipliers, and discard-floor flips with the **5% EA Transfer Tax** calculated automatically.\n   - **Interactive Console Market Charts & 5G Bid-Flipper**: Includes touch/hover **24H Hourly** and **7D Trend** SVG price charts, a live **5% EA Tax & Break-Even Calculator**, a **Cheapest by Rating & Holographic Arbitrage** matrix, and one-click **Gemini 4 Argon** chart trend analysis.\n\n3. **Domain 2: `GAMEPLAY` (Additive Synthesis Lab \302\267 31 Roles++ \302\267 Branching Evolutions)**\n   - **Isolated Stats vs. Synthesized In-Game Performance**: Calculates the additive synergy of Base Sub-Attributes, Chemistry Styles (`0/3` to `3/3` Diamonds), **AcceleRATE 2.0** sprint archetype shifts, **PlayStyles+ (enforcing FC 27\'s strict 3 PS+ hard cap)**, Body Type frame responsiveness, and **31 Player Roles (`Role`, `Role+`, `Role++`)**.\n   - **Branching Evolution Simulator & Meta Formations**: Compares `Branch A` vs. `Branch B` upgrades, recommends club and external market targets that fit your 33/33 chemistry structure, and provides post-patch Pro Console formations (`4-2-1-3` and `4-4-2 Holding`) with FC IQ Share Codes."
