  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Verification Challenge**\n\nI\'m now carefully analyzing the user\'s statement. My focus centers on the crucial challenge of verifying that incoming data and information pertain specifically to EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team, and not to previous iterations of the game. I recognize this as a key area requiring diligent attention.\n\n\n**Clarifying User Intentions**\n\nI now understand the user\'s focus on the console market, specifically the Xbox Series S. I will only be considering content applicable to that platform. Furthermore, I must avoid any assumptions or predictions about the user\'s Ultimate Team. Any lack of explicit information from the user requires me to leave those areas blank. I need to proceed cautiously, adhering to the provided instructions explicitly. I see the importance of avoiding any form of \"hallucination.\"\n\n\n**Defining Data Parameters Rigorously**\n\nI\'m now implementing strict data validation protocols for Ultimate Team. Specifically, I\'m setting up an FC 27 verification gate to ensure the exclusion of any legacy data from FC 24, 25, or 26. This means only verified FC 27 content will be accepted. Furthermore, all market information and price queries are restricted to the Xbox Series S console market exclusively. To determine how blanks should be handled, I will ask some questions.\n\n\n"
