  user_input {
    user_response: "<clarifying-answers>\nQ: How should your personal Ultimate Team data (coins, points, SP, squad, and duplicate storage) appear before you sync or enter it?\nA: Prompt for club sync modal immediately on launch\nQ: When an FC 27 player stat, price, or SBC detail cannot be 100% verified for FC 27 on Xbox Series S, how should the app handle it?\nA: Leave unverified stats or prices blank with a sync trigger\nQ: Which methods do you want enabled to populate your blank Xbox Series S Ultimate Team club profile?\nA: Antigravity v2.25 browser MCP live DOM inspection, Companion Web App JSON and Paletools paste, Voice dictation and quick manual entry inputs, Google Drive and Firestore cloud restore\n</clarifying-answers>"
    items {
      text: "<clarifying-answers>\nQ: How should your personal Ultimate Team data (coins, points, SP, squad, and duplicate storage) appear before you sync or enter it?\nA: Prompt for club sync modal immediately on launch\nQ: When an FC 27 player stat, price, or SBC detail cannot be 100% verified for FC 27 on Xbox Series S, how should the app handle it?\nA: Leave unverified stats or prices blank with a sync trigger\nQ: Which methods do you want enabled to populate your blank Xbox Series S Ultimate Team club profile?\nA: Antigravity v2.25 browser MCP live DOM inspection, Companion Web App JSON and Paletools paste, Voice dictation and quick manual entry inputs, Google Drive and Firestore cloud restore\n</clarifying-answers>"
    }
  }
}
