  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Synthesizing Requirements**\n\nI\'m now synthesizing the user\'s requirements with their clarifications from Phase 1. The focus is on ensuring *zero* hallucinated or predicted Ultimate Team data, alongside an immediate launch sync modal. This is the core focus I\'m circling around, with all further refinement focused on guaranteeing these aspects are ironclad.\n\n\n**Confirming Core Launch Criteria**\n\nI\'ve just confirmed the critical launch criteria. On initial launch with an unsynced profile, all personal club data will be strictly blank. The application must then present the Xbox Series S Club Onboarding & Sync Modal, immediately, providing multiple reliable methods to populate the profile, including DOM inspection, Companion App import, and Voice. No pre-filled or guessed data is acceptable!\n\n\n**Defining Verification Logic**\n\nI\'m now defining the verification logic. Any unverified market data, player stats, or prices for FC 27 on Xbox Series S will be rendered blank, and trigger the sync. I\'m focusing on ensuring the `fc27XboxSeriesSVerified` and `verifiedAtT0` contract is rigorously applied across all player items, SBCs, and market prices, guarding against any data contamination from previous versions or unverified sources. I\'m also planning to incorporate a dictation input feature for quick manual entry.\n\n\n**Integrating Verification Systems**\n\nI\'m now integrating the verification systems. There will be a single-click \"Verify Live\" button that utilizes FUTBIN and FotMob data for immediate verification. The focus is on the `/api/gemini/verify-fc27-xbox-card` API, using a grounded Gemini model. Zero hallucination is paramount. I\'m also ensuring all server-side instructions are hardened with strict Xbox Series S and FC 27 contracts, outputting \"BLANK (Unverified)\" for any unconfirmed data. The built-in Antigravity v2.25 `generative_ui` skill will be integrated to render interactive tools.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_223406"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true, \"Summary\":\"Revised Implementation Plan enforcing Zero-Hallucination Blank Club State on launch, Immediate Xbox Series S Club Sync Modal (with Antigravity v2.25 /browser MCP, Companion Web App JSON/Paletools, Voice/Manual Entry, and Firestore/Google Drive Restore), Strict FC 27 Xbox Series S Console Market Verification Gate (leaving unverified fields blank with a 1-click live T=0 verification trigger), and Antigravity 2.25 Built-In generative_ui Skill integration.\", \"UserFacing\":true}, \"CodeContent\":\"# FC 27 UT App \342\200\224 Xbox Series S Zero-Hallucination & Antigravity v2.25 Generative UI Plan\\n\\nAn authoritative **EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Xbox Series S Console Market)** tactical, club, and market terminal orchestrated via **Google Antigravity 2.0 Desktop App (`v2.25`)** and anchored dynamically to **British Time (`Europe/London` BST/GMT at $T=0$)**. This revision enforces a strict **Zero-Hallucination Personal Club Policy** (all unknown club fields remain blank until explicitly synced or entered via the launch modal), locks all market data exclusively to the **Xbox Series S (Console Cross-Play) Market**, gates every player and SBC attribute against **FC 27 (2026/27 Season)** verification so legacy FC 24/25/26 data can never leak in, and mounts the **Antigravity `v2.25` Built-In `generative_ui` Skill** (`C:\\\\Users\\\\Kit\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\builtin\\\\skills\\\\generative_ui\\\\SKILL.md`).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> **Confirmed Phase 1 Decisions (Strictly Enforced Across All Views & AI Endpoints)**:\\n> - **Confirmed Decision 1 \342\200\224 Blank Personal Club State & Immediate Launch Sync Modal**: The app will **never** pre-fill, guess, or predict your personal Ultimate Team data (Club Name, Coin Balance, FC Points, Daily SP, Gallery Level, Owned Squad/Club Inventory, SBC Duplicate Storage, or Tracked Investments). All personal fields initialize as **blank (`null` / `\342\200\224`)**, and the **Xbox Series S Club Sync Modal** opens automatically on launch.\\n> - **Confirmed Decision 2 \342\200\224 Strict FC 27 (Xbox Series S) Verification Gate**: Whenever a player stat, Xbox Series S Buy-Now price, Role++, or SBC requirement is not 100% verified for **EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team Console (2026/27 Season)**, the app leaves that specific value **blank (`\342\200\224`)** and exposes a 1-click **\\\"Verify Live (FC 27 Xbox Series S @ T=0)\\\"** trigger rather than guessing or falling back to FC 24/25/26 data.\\n> - **Confirmed Decision 3 \342\200\224 All 4 Real Club Onboarding & Sync Channels Enabled**:\\n>   1. **Antigravity `v2.25` `/browser` MCP Live DOM Inspection** (attaches to the EA FC 27 Companion Web App via Chrome DevTools MCP).\\n>   2. **Companion Web App JSON & Paletools Paste** (parses exact exported club/storage JSON payloads without inventing missing fields).\\n>   3. **Voice Dictation (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`) & Quick Manual Entry Inputs** (lets you dictate or type exact Xbox Series S coins, points, SP, and owned cards while leaving unmentioned fields blank).\\n>   4. **Google Drive REST API v3 & Firestore (`ai-studio-fc27utapp-2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607`) Cloud Restore**.\\n> - **Confirmed Decision 4 \342\200\224 Antigravity `v2.25` Built-In `generative_ui` Skill Integration**: Integrates `C:\\\\Users\\\\Kit\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\builtin\\\\skills\\\\generative_ui\\\\SKILL.md` so natural-language prompts render live, interactive GenUI micro-tools (Streamlined SBC Score Sliders, Role++ Synthesis Comparators, Xbox Series S 5% Tax Arbitrage Calculators, and FC IQ Pitch Boards).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Overview & Core Concept\\n\\n- **What It Does**: Operates across two principal domains\342\200\224**`1. MENUS`** (Xbox Series S Club Sync, Dual-Mode Streamlined & Puzzle SBC Solver, Authentic FUT Gallery Set & \\\"Rent-and-Flip\\\" Optimizer, and Xbox Series S 5G Market Charts) and **`2. GAMEPLAY`** (Isolated vs. Synthesized Stat/PlayStyle+/AcceleRATE 2.0/Role++ Lab, Branching Evolutions, and Title Update `#3.1` Meta Formations)\342\200\224plus the **Antigravity `v2.25` Generative UI & MCP Hub**.\\n- **Target Audience / Persona**: Competitive **Xbox Series S** EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team player operating across an **Asus ZenBook UX482** (14\\\" primary display + 12.6\\\" `1920x515` ScreenPad Plus secondary touch strip) and mobile smartphone (`375px\342\200\223430px`) over a 5G connection.\\n- **Key Value**: Eliminates AI hallucinations, legacy-season (FC 24/25/26) roster errors, and PC-market price pollution by enforcing strict `2026-27` FotMob + FUTBIN FC 27 Xbox Series S verification and keeping unknown personal club fields strictly blank until populated by the user.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. User Experience & Visual Design\\n\\n- **Key User Flows**:\\n  1. **Zero-Hallucination Launch & Sync Flow**: On startup, personal KPI cards display `\342\200\224 (Not Synced)` and the **Xbox Series S Club Sync Modal** opens immediately with tabs for:\\n     - *Quick Manual / Voice Dictation (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`)*: Enter or speak only the fields you want to set (e.g., Xbox Series S Coins, Daily SP, or specific owned players); any field left empty stays blank (`\342\200\224`).\\n     - *Companion Web App / Paletools JSON Paste*: Paste your Web App export to populate exact owned cards and SBC Duplicate Storage.\\n     - *Antigravity `v2.25` `/browser` MCP Hook*: Trigger or copy the live DOM inspection bridge for the open EA FC 27 Web App tab.\\n     - *Cloud Restore (Firestore & Google Drive)*: Pull your saved Xbox Series S state from `ai-studio-fc27utapp-2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607` or your Google Drive `FC27_UT_` snapshots.\\n  2. **FC 27 Xbox Series S Verification & Blank-Field Handling**:\\n     - Database cards display an explicit **`FC 27 Xbox Series S Verified (2026-27)`** status line.\\n     - If a user adds a custom player or inspects a card whose live Xbox Series S price or sub-attributes are not yet verified at $T=0$, those fields render as `\342\200\224 (Blank \342\200\224 Unverified)` with a **\\\"Verify FC 27 Xbox Price/Stats ($T=0$)\\\"** button that queries Google Search grounded strictly to FUTBIN FC 27 Console & FotMob 2026/27.\\n  3. **Interactive Generative UI (`generative_ui` Skill) Flow**:\\n     - In the **Antigravity `v2.25` & AI Chat** view, toggling **Generative UI Mode (`SKILL.md`)** transforms AI responses into interactive React widgets (e.g., dragging a Holographic `1.25x`/`1.50x` slider to hit a Streamlined SBC target score, or adjusting an Xbox Series S bid slider with live 5% EA Tax math).\\n- **Visual Identity & Theme**:\\n  - *Aesthetic Direction*: High-Contrast Console Tactical & Financial Terminal (`#090d16` Pitch Obsidian canvas, `#111827` slate panels, `#00ff87` FC 27 Pitch Emerald primary action accent, `#fbbf24` Holographic Gold highlight).\\n  - *Typography & Hierarchy*: `Outfit` for headers, `Plus Jakarta Sans` for dense tactical copy, and `JetBrains Mono` (`tabular-nums`) for all Xbox Series S prices, 5% EA tax figures, `\342\200\224` blank placeholders, and $T=0$ countdowns.\\n  - *Dual-Viewport & Hardware Layout*: 3-zone sticky top bar, desktop left sidebar + optional **ZenBook UX482 ScreenPad Plus** bottom ticker, and a thumb-friendly mobile bottom navigation bar ($\\\\le 15\\\\%$ viewport height, $\\\\ge 44\\\\text{px}$ hitboxes).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\\n\\n- **Decision 1: Nullable (`number | null` / `string | null`) Personal Club State Schema**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Represent all personal Ultimate Team fields (`clubName`, `coins`, `fifaPoints`, `dailySp`, `galleryLevel`) as nullable (`null` by default) and initialize personal lists (`ownedPlayerIds`, `duplicateStorageIds`, `trackedInvestments`) as empty (`[]`) until populated via the Sync Modal or restored from Firestore/Google Drive.\\n  - *Why*: Directly fulfills *\\\"dont hallucinate or predict any information concerning my ultimate team. if you dont know it, leave it blank.\\\"*\\n- **Decision 2: Strict FC 27 + Xbox Series S Verification Filter**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Every market label, solver calculation, and server-side Gemini prompt explicitly specifies **EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team \342\200\224 Xbox Series S (Console Cross-Play Market)** and rejects any data from FC 24, FC 25, FC 26, or PC/Switch markets. Unverified fields remain blank (`null`) until verified.\\n  - *Why*: Prevents pre-training frequency bias from contaminating player clubs (e.g., enforcing Rodri at FC Barcelona in 2026/27) or mixing PC and Xbox Series S prices.\\n- **Decision 3: Native Antigravity `v2.25` `generative_ui` Skill Mount**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Store the workspace skill definition at `.agents/skills/generative_ui/SKILL.md` (mirroring `C:\\\\Users\\\\Kit\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\builtin\\\\skills\\\\generative_ui\\\\SKILL.md`) and add a dedicated `/api/gemini/generative-ui` structured-output route + client-side interactive widget mount.\\n  - *Why*: Allows the user to interact with live sliders, calculators, and Role++ comparators generated on the fly by `gemini-4-argon` at $T=0$.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy *(Technical Reference)*\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\3