              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "> - **Confirmed Decision 1 \342\200\224 Blank Personal Club State & Immediate Launch Sync Modal**: The app will **never** pre-fill, guess, or predict your personal Ultimate Team data (Club Name, Coin Balance, FC Points, Daily SP, Gallery Level, Owned Squad/Club Inventory, SBC Duplicate Storage, or Tracked Investments). All personal fields initialize as **blank (`null` / `\342\200\224`)**, and the **Xbox Series S Club Sync Modal** opens automatically on launch."
