            lines {
              text: "> - **Confirmed Decision 2 \342\200\224 Strict FC 27 (Xbox Series S) Verification Gate**: Whenever a player stat, Xbox Series S Buy-Now price, Role++, or SBC requirement is not 100% verified for **EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team Console (2026/27 Season)**, the app leaves that specific value **blank (`\342\200\224`)** and exposes a 1-click **\"Verify Live (FC 27 Xbox Series S @ T=0)\"** trigger rather than guessing or falling back to FC 24/25/26 data."
