            lines {
              text: "## 1. Overview & Core Concept"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **What It Does**: Operates across two principal domains\342\200\224**`1. MENUS`** (Xbox Series S Club Sync, Dual-Mode Streamlined & Puzzle SBC Solver, Authentic FUT Gallery Set & \"Rent-and-Flip\" Optimizer, and Xbox Series S 5G Market Charts) and **`2. GAMEPLAY`** (Isolated vs. Synthesized Stat/PlayStyle+/AcceleRATE 2.0/Role++ Lab, Branching Evolutions, and Title Update `#3.1` Meta Formations)\342\200\224plus the **Antigravity `v2.25` Generative UI & MCP Hub**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Target Audience / Persona**: Competitive **Xbox Series S** EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team player operating across an **Asus ZenBook UX482** (14\" primary display + 12.6\" `1920x515` ScreenPad Plus secondary touch strip) and mobile smartphone (`375px\342\200\223430px`) over a 5G connection."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Key Value**: Eliminates AI hallucinations, legacy-season (FC 24/25/26) roster errors, and PC-market price pollution by enforcing strict `2026-27` FotMob + FUTBIN FC 27 Xbox Series S verification and keeping unknown personal club fields strictly blank until populated by the user."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 2. User Experience & Visual Design"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Key User Flows**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  1. **Zero-Hallucination Launch & Sync Flow**: On startup, personal KPI cards display `\342\200\224 (Not Synced)` and the **Xbox Series S Club Sync Modal** opens immediately with tabs for:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - *Quick Manual / Voice Dictation (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`)*: Enter or speak only the fields you want to set (e.g., Xbox Series S Coins, Daily SP, or specific owned players); any field left empty stays blank (`\342\200\224`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - *Companion Web App / Paletools JSON Paste*: Paste your Web App export to populate exact owned cards and SBC Duplicate Storage."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - *Antigravity `v2.25` `/browser` MCP Hook*: Trigger or copy the live DOM inspection bridge for the open EA FC 27 Web App tab."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - *Cloud Restore (Firestore & Google Drive)*: Pull your saved Xbox Series S state from `ai-studio-fc27utapp-2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607` or your Google Drive `FC27_UT_` snapshots."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  2. **FC 27 Xbox Series S Verification & Blank-Field Handling**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - Database cards display an explicit **`FC 27 Xbox Series S Verified (2026-27)`** status line."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - If a user adds a custom player or inspects a card whose live Xbox Series S price or sub-attributes are not yet verified at $T=0$, those fields render as `\342\200\224 (Blank \342\200\224 Unverified)` with a **\"Verify FC 27 Xbox Price/Stats ($T=0$)\"** button that queries Google Search grounded strictly to FUTBIN FC 27 Console & FotMob 2026/27."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  3. **Interactive Generative UI (`generative_ui` Skill) Flow**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - In the **Antigravity `v2.25` & AI Chat** view, toggling **Generative UI Mode (`SKILL.md`)** transforms AI responses into interactive React widgets (e.g., dragging a Holographic `1.25x`/`1.50x` slider to hit a Streamlined SBC target score, or adjusting an Xbox Series S bid slider with live 5% EA Tax math)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Visual Identity & Theme**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Aesthetic Direction*: High-Contrast Console Tactical & Financial Terminal (`#090d16` Pitch Obsidian canvas, `#111827` slate panels, `#00ff87` FC 27 Pitch Emerald primary action accent, `#fbbf24` Holographic Gold highlight)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Typography & Hierarchy*: `Outfit` for headers, `Plus Jakarta Sans` for dense tactical copy, and `JetBrains Mono` (`tabular-nums`) for all Xbox Series S prices, 5% EA tax figures, `\342\200\224` blank placeholders, and $T=0$ countdowns."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Dual-Viewport & Hardware Layout*: 3-zone sticky top bar, desktop left sidebar + optional **ZenBook UX482 ScreenPad Plus** bottom ticker, and a thumb-friendly mobile bottom navigation bar ($\\le 15\\%$ viewport height, $\\ge 44\\text{px}$ hitboxes)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 1: Nullable (`number | null` / `string | null`) Personal Club State Schema**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Represent all personal Ultimate Team fields (`clubName`, `coins`, `fifaPoints`, `dailySp`, `galleryLevel`) as nullable (`null` by default) and initialize personal lists (`ownedPlayerIds`, `duplicateStorageIds`, `trackedInvestments`) as empty (`[]`) until populated via the Sync Modal or restored from Firestore/Google Drive."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Directly fulfills *\"dont hallucinate or predict any information concerning my ultimate team. if you dont know it, leave it blank.\"*"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 2: Strict FC 27 + Xbox Series S Verification Filter**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Every market label, solver calculation, and server-side Gemini prompt explicitly specifies **EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team \342\200\224 Xbox Series S (Console Cross-Play Market)** and rejects any data from FC 24, FC 25, FC 26, or PC/Switch markets. Unverified fields remain blank (`null`) until verified."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Prevents pre-training frequency bias from contaminating player clubs (e.g., enforcing Rodri at FC Barcelona in 2026/27) or mixing PC and Xbox Series S prices."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 3: Native Antigravity `v2.25` `generative_ui` Skill Mount**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Store the workspace skill definition at `.agents/skills/generative_ui/SKILL.md` (mirroring `C:\\Users\\Kit\\.gemini\\antigravity\\builtin\\skills\\generative_ui\\SKILL.md`) and add a dedicated `/api/gemini/generative-ui` structured-output route + client-side interactive widget mount."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Allows the user to interact with live sliders, calculators, and Role++ comparators generated on the fly by `gemini-4-argon` at $T=0$."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
