        instruction: "# FC 27 UT App \342\200\224 Xbox Series S Zero-Guessing Club State (35,000 Coins) & Antigravity v2.25 Plan\n\nAn authoritative **EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Xbox Series S Console Market)** tactical, club, and market terminal orchestrated via **Google Antigravity 2.0 Desktop App (`v2.25`)** and anchored dynamically to **British Time (`Europe/London` BST/GMT at $T=0$)**. This revision locks in your exact confirmed **Xbox Series S Coin Balance (`35,000 Coins`)** while enforcing a **Strict Zero-Guessing / Zero-Gap-Filling Rule**: every other personal club metric (**FIFA Points, FUT Gallery Level, Rivals Division, Daily SP, Club Name, Owned Cards, SBC Duplicate Storage, and Tracked Investments**) remains strictly **blank (`null` / `\342\200\224` / empty `[]`)** until you explicitly provide or sync it.\n\n---\n\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Strict Personal Club State Contract (Zero Guesses, Zero Gap-Filling)**:\n> - **Confirmed Xbox Series S Coin Balance**: Initialized to **`35,000` Coins** (`35k`), which also serves as the active budget filter across SBC solutions, 5G Bid-Flipping targets, and Gallery \"Rent-and-Flip\" candidates.\n> - **Strictly Blank (`null` / `\342\200\224` / `[]`) Personal Club Attributes**: The app will **never** guess, infer, or pre-populate any other detail about your Ultimate Team:\n>   - **Cards You Own / Starting XI**: `[]` (**Blank / 0 cards** \342\200\224 no pre-populated Rodri, Yamal, Balde, or fodder cards assumed in your club).\n>   - **SBC Duplicate Storage**: `[]` (**Blank / 0 cards**).\n>   - **FIFA / FC Points**: `null` (Displayed as **`\342\200\224`**).\n>   - **FUT Gallery Level & Registered Sets**: `null` / `[]` (Displayed as **`\342\200\224`**).\n>   - **Division Rivals Rank / Division**: `null` (Displayed as **`\342\200\224`**).\n>   - **Daily Season Points (SP)**: `null` (Displayed as **`\342\200\224 / 850 SP`**).\n>   - **Club Name**: `null` (Displayed as **`\342\200\224`**).\n>   - **Tracked Investments**: `[]` (**Blank / 0 active flips**).\n> - **Confirmed Onboarding & Sync Modal on Launch**: Opens on startup with your `35,000` Coins pre-set and all other fields blank, allowing you to populate only what you choose via **Antigravity `v2.25` `/browser` MCP**, **Companion Web App / Paletools JSON**, **Voice Dictation (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`) / Manual Entry**, or **Firestore / Google Drive Restore**\342\200\224or close the modal immediately and use the app with `35,000` Coins and blank unknown fields.\n> - **Strict Separation of \"Xbox Series S Market Catalog\" vs. \"My Club\"**: Reference players (for checking Xbox Series S prices or testing Gameplay Synthesis) live strictly in the **FC 27 Xbox Series S Market Catalog** and are never treated as owned by your club unless you click **\"Mark as Owned in My Club\"**.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Overview & Core Concept\n\n- **What It Does**: Provides a dual-domain (**`1. MENUS`** & **`2. GAMEPLAY`**) EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team assistant exclusively for the **Xbox Series S Console Market**, calibrated to your real **`35,000` Coin budget** and enforcing zero hallucination across both personal club data and FC 27 player/SBC verification.\n- **Target Audience / Persona**: Competitive **Xbox Series S** EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team player operating across an **Asus ZenBook UX482** (primary screen + `1920x515` ScreenPad Plus secondary touch strip) and mobile (`375px\342\200\223430px`) over a 5G connection.\n- **Key Value**: Guarantees 100% data integrity\342\200\224never assuming you own cards you haven\'t synced, never inventing your Division, FIFA Points, or Gallery Level, and never polluting FC 27 Xbox Series S market calculations with PC prices or legacy FC 24/25/26 data.\n\n---\n\n## 2. User Experience & Visual Design\n\n- **Key User Flows**:\n  1. **Zero-Guessing Launch & Partial Club Sync**:\n     - On launch, the header and Club KPI bar display **Xbox Series S Coins: `35,000`**, while **FC Points (`\342\200\224`)**, **Division (`\342\200\224`)**, **Gallery Level (`\342\200\224`)**, **Daily SP (`\342\200\224`)**, and **Owned Cards (`0 Synced`)** render cleanly as blank (`\342\200\224`).\n     - The **Xbox Series S Club Sync Modal** opens on launch so you can optionally fill in any blank field (via manual input, voice mic, Web App JSON, Antigravity `/browser` MCP, or Cloud Restore) or click **\"Continue with 35,000 Coins (Keep Others Blank)\"**.\n  2. **Budget-Aware (`35,000` Coins) SBC, Gallery & 5G Market Workflows**:\n     - **Dual-Mode SBC Solver**: Because your Owned Cards and Duplicate Storage start blank (`[]`), the solver defaults to calculating the **100% Xbox Series S Market Cost** (highlighting whether an SBC fits within your **`35,000` Coin budget**). If you add or sync owned/duplicate cards later, it deducts them automatically.\n     - **FUT Gallery \"Rent-and-Flip\" & 5G Market**: Filters discard-floor Holographic (`1.25x`/`1.50x`) flips that cost **$\\le 35,000$ Coins** on the Xbox Series S market and calculates exact net profit after the **5% EA Transfer Tax**.\n  3. **Strict FC 27 Xbox Series S Verification Gate**:\n     - Any player stat, price, or SBC field not verified for **EA Sports FC 27 on Xbox Series S** remains blank (`\342\200\224`) with a 1-click **\"Verify Live (FC 27 Xbox Series S @ T=0)\"** trigger.\n  4. **Antigravity `v2.25` Built-In `generative_ui` Skill (`SKILL.md`)**:\n     - Renders interactive micro-tools (Streamlined SBC Score Sliders, Role++ Synthesis Comparators, Xbox Series S 5% Tax Calculators, and FC IQ Pitch Boards) anchored to your `35,000` Coin budget and blank-safe club context.\n- **Visual Identity & Theme**:\n  - *Aesthetic Direction*: High-Contrast Console Tactical & Financial Terminal (`#090d16` Pitch Obsidian canvas, `#111827` slate cards, `#00ff87` FC 27 Pitch Emerald primary accent, `#fbbf24` Holographic Gold accent).\n  - *Typography & Hierarchy*: `Outfit` for headers, `Plus Jakarta Sans` for dense UI labels, and `JetBrains Mono` (`tabular-nums`) for all Xbox Series S coin figures and `\342\200\224` blank indicators.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\n\n- **Decision 1: Strict Nullable Schema (`coins = 35000`, All Other Club Fields `null` / `[]`)**\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Hard-enforce `coins: 35000` as the only populated default, with `clubName: null`, `fifaPoints: null`, `rivalsDivision: null`, `galleryLevel: null`, `dailySp: null`, `ownedPlayerIds: []`, `duplicateStorageIds: []`, and `trackedInvestments: []`. Remove any \"sample club dump\" that invents fake club stats.\n  - *Why*: Directly honors *\"i have 35k coins currently. also dont make guesses or fill in the gaps for anything about my club e.g. gallery level, cards i own, fifa points, division im in.\"*\n- **Decision 2: Strict Separation Between Xbox Series S Market Catalog and Personal Club Inventory**\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Keep the FC 27 Xbox Series S reference catalog strictly for market price charts and Gameplay Synthesis testing. Your personal **My Club Inventory** table starts empty (`0 cards`) until you explicitly sync or add cards you actually own.\n  - *Why*: Prevents the SBC solver, Match Stacker, or Gemini 4 Argon advisor from hallucinating that you own high-rated cards when solving challenges.\n- **Decision 3: Firestore Schema Update for Nullable Club Fields & `rivalsDivision`**\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Update `firebase-blueprint.json`, `firestore.rules`, and `firebaseAndDriveService.ts` so `users/{userId}` accepts `null` for unknown club fields (`clubName`, `fifaPoints`, `rivalsDivision`, `galleryLevel`, `dailySp`) rather than forcing dummy integers.\n  - *Why*: Ensures cloud persistence never coerces blank (`null`) fields into fake `0` or `1` values.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy *(Technical Reference)*\n\n```\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202            UNIVERSAL DYNAMIC TEMPORAL ANCHOR (T = 0 \302\267 Europe/London BST/GMT)           \342\224\202\n\342\224\202   \342\200\242 Football Season: 2026-27 (1st Half Aug\342\200\223Dec) \302\267 18:00 UK Content Drop Countdown      \342\224\202\n\342\224\202   \342\200\242 Platform Lock: Xbox Series S (Console Cross-Play Market Only \342\200\224 Zero PC/Legacy)     \342\224\202\n\342\224\202   \342\200\242 Orchestrator: Antigravity v2.25 + Built-In generative_ui Skill (SKILL.md)          \342\224\202\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n                                \342\224\202\n         \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\264\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n         \342\226\274                                               \342\226\274\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220   \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n\342\224\202  PERSONAL XBOX SERIES S CLUB PROFILE    \342\224\202   \342\224\202  FC 27 XBOX SERIES S MARKET CATALOG      \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 coins: 35,000 (Confirmed)            \342\224\202   \342\224\202  \342\200\242 Separate from Owned Club Inventory!   \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 fifaPoints: null (\'\342\200\224\')               \342\224\202   \342\224\202  \342\200\242 Edition Lock: \'FC 27\' (2026-27 Only)  \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 galleryLevel: null (\'\342\200\224\')             \342\224\202   \342\224\202  \342\200\242 Market Lock: \'XBOX_SERIES_S_CONSOLE\'  \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 rivalsDivision: null (\'\342\200\224\')           \342\224\202   \342\224\202  \342\200\242 Unverified fields -> null (\'\342\200\224 Blank\') \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 dailySp: null (\'\342\200\224\')                  \342\224\202   \342\224\202  \342\200\242 1-Click Live T=0 Search Verification  \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 clubName: null (\'\342\200\224\')                 \342\224\202   \342\224\202    via /api/gemini/verify-fc27-xbox      \342\224\202\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 ownedCards: [] (0 cards assumed)     \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200