              text: "  - *Typography & Hierarchy*: `Outfit` for headers, `Plus Jakarta Sans` for dense UI labels, and `JetBrains Mono` (`tabular-nums`) for all Xbox Series S coin figures and `\342\200\224` blank indicators."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 1: Nullable (`number | null` / `string | null`) Personal Club State Schema**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Represent all personal Ultimate Team fields (`clubName`, `coins`, `fifaPoints`, `dailySp`, `galleryLevel`) as nullable (`null` by default) and initialize personal lists (`ownedPlayerIds`, `duplicateStorageIds`, `trackedInvestments`) as empty (`[]`) until populated via the Sync Modal or restored from Firestore/Google Drive."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Directly fulfills *\"dont hallucinate or predict any information concerning my ultimate team. if you dont know it, leave it blank.\"*"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 2: Strict FC 27 + Xbox Series S Verification Filter**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Every market label, solver calculation, and server-side Gemini prompt explicitly specifies **EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team \342\200\224 Xbox Series S (Console Cross-Play Market)** and rejects any data from FC 24, FC 25, FC 26, or PC/Switch markets. Unverified fields remain blank (`null`) until verified."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Prevents pre-training frequency bias from contaminating player clubs (e.g., enforcing Rodri at FC Barcelona in 2026/27) or mixing PC and Xbox Series S prices."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 3: Native Antigravity `v2.25` `generative_ui` Skill Mount**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Store the workspace skill definition at `.agents/skills/generative_ui/SKILL.md` (mirroring `C:\\Users\\Kit\\.gemini\\antigravity\\builtin\\skills\\generative_ui\\SKILL.md`) and add a dedicated `/api/gemini/generative-ui` structured-output route + client-side interactive widget mount."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Allows the user to interact with live sliders, calculators, and Role++ comparators generated on the fly by `gemini-4-argon` at $T=0$."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 1: Strict Nullable Schema (`coins = 35000`, All Other Club Fields `null` / `[]`)**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Hard-enforce `coins: 35000` as the only populated default, with `clubName: null`, `fifaPoints: null`, `rivalsDivision: null`, `galleryLevel: null`, `dailySp: null`, `ownedPlayerIds: []`, `duplicateStorageIds: []`, and `trackedInvestments: []`. Remove any \"sample club dump\" that invents fake club stats."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Directly honors *\"i have 35k coins currently. also dont make guesses or fill in the gaps for anything about my club e.g. gallery level, cards i own, fifa points, division im in.\"*"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 2: Strict Separation Between Xbox Series S Market Catalog and Personal Club Inventory**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Keep the FC 27 Xbox Series S reference catalog strictly for market price charts and Gameplay Synthesis testing. Your personal **My Club Inventory** table starts empty (`0 cards`) until you explicitly sync or add cards you actually own."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Prevents the SBC solver, Match Stacker, or Gemini 4 Argon advisor from hallucinating that you own high-rated cards when solving challenges."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 3: Firestore Schema Update for Nullable Club Fields & `rivalsDivision`**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Update `firebase-blueprint.json`, `firestore.rules`, and `firebaseAndDriveService.ts` so `users/{userId}` accepts `null` for unknown club fields (`clubName`, `fifaPoints`, `rivalsDivision`, `galleryLevel`, `dailySp`) rather than forcing dummy integers."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Ensures cloud persistence never coerces blank (`null`) fields into fake `0` or `1` values."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
