    user_response: "<clarifying-answers>\nQ: How should the app route requests between deterministic TypeScript math, Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite, Gemini 3.8 Flash, and Gemini 4 Argon?\nA: Auto-route by task complexity with manual override\nQ: What cost, latency, and benchmark telemetry would you like displayed when the router selects a model for a task?\nA: Show model tier, latency in ms, and reason\n</clarifying-answers>"
