        instruction: "# FC 27 UT App \342\200\224 Xbox Series S Zero-Guessing Club State (35k Coins), Smart Model Router & Antigravity v2.25 Plan\n\nAn authoritative **EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Xbox Series S Console Market)** tactical, club, and market terminal orchestrated via **Google Antigravity 2.0 Desktop App (`v2.25`)** and anchored dynamically to **British Time (`Europe/London` BST/GMT at $T=0$)**. This revision locks in your confirmed **`35,000` Xbox Series S Coin balance**, keeps every other personal club attribute strictly **blank (`null` / `\342\200\224` / `[]`)** with zero guessing, enforces a **Strict FC 27 Xbox Series S Verification Gate**, integrates the **Antigravity `v2.25` Built-In `generative_ui` Skill** (`C:\\Users\\Kit\\.gemini\\antigravity\\builtin\\skills\\generative_ui\\SKILL.md`), and introduces a **5-Tier Smart Model Router** that automatically routes tasks by complexity, latency, benchmark strength, and token cost (with manual override and live `ms` telemetry).\n\n---\n\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Confirmed User Decisions Enforced Across All Systems**:\n> 1. **Confirmed Xbox Series S Coin Balance (`35,000` Coins) & Strict Zero-Guessing Club Policy**:\n>    - **Xbox Series S Coins**: Initialized to **`35,000` Coins** (`35k`), acting as the active budget filter across SBCs, 5G Bid-Flipping, and FUT Gallery \"Rent-and-Flip\" candidates.\n>    - **All Other Personal Club Fields Start Strictly Blank (`null` / `\342\200\224` / `[]`)**: The app never guesses or fills in gaps for **FIFA Points (`\342\200\224`)**, **FUT Gallery Level (`\342\200\224`)**, **Rivals Division (`\342\200\224`)**, **Daily SP (`\342\200\224`)**, **Club Name (`\342\200\224`)**, **Cards You Own (`[]` / 0 cards)**, **SBC Duplicate Storage (`[]` / 0 cards)**, or **Tracked Investments (`[]` / 0 flips)**.\n>    - **Immediate Launch Club Sync Modal**: Opens on launch so you can optionally populate any blank field via **Antigravity `v2.25` `/browser` MCP**, **Companion Web App / Paletools JSON**, **Voice Dictation (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`) / Manual Entry**, or **Firestore / Google Drive Restore**\342\200\224or click **\"Continue with 35,000 Coins (Keep Others Blank)\"**.\n> 2. **Strict FC 27 Xbox Series S Verification Gate**:\n>    - Only the **Xbox Series S (Console Cross-Play) Market** matters. Any player stat, Xbox price, or SBC detail not 100% verified for **EA Sports FC 27 (2026/27 Season)** is left **blank (`\342\200\224`)** with a 1-click **\"Verify Live (FC 27 Xbox Series S @ T=0)\"** trigger. Zero FC 24/25/26 or PC market contamination.\n> 3. **Confirmed Smart Model Router (`AUTO` by Complexity + Manual Override + Tier/Latency/Reason Display)**:\n>    - Automatically routes every calculation and prompt across **Tier 0 (`<2ms` Local TypeScript Math)**, **Tier 1 (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`)**, **Tier 2 (`gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch`)**, **Tier 3 (`gemini-4-argon` `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`)**, and **Audio Tier (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`)** while displaying the **Model Tier, Execution Latency (`ms`), and Routing Reason** on every response.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Overview & Core Concept\n\n- **What It Does**: Delivers a two-domain (**`1. MENUS`** & **`2. GAMEPLAY`**) EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team strategic companion exclusively for the **Xbox Series S Console Market**, calibrated to your **`35,000` Coin budget**, with zero hallucinated club state and intelligent multi-model cost/latency routing.\n- **Target Audience / Persona**: Competitive **Xbox Series S** EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team player operating across an **Asus ZenBook UX482** (14\" primary display + `1920x515` ScreenPad Plus secondary touch strip) and mobile (`375px\342\200\223430px`) over a 5G connection.\n- **Key Value**: Combines 100% data honesty (never assuming you own cards or inventing your Division/Gallery Level) with optimal speed and API economics\342\200\224executing deterministic math in `<2ms` for `$0.00`, routing quick lookups to sub-350ms `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, live FC 27 Xbox Series S market verification to `gemini-3.8-flash`, and reserving `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) strictly for deep multi-constraint strategy and Generative UI synthesis.\n\n---\n\n## 2. 5-Tier Smart Model Routing Matrix (Latency, Benchmarks & Cost)\n\n| Tier | Engine / Model | Target Latency | Relative Cost | Benchmark Strength & Primary Use Cases in FC 27 UT App |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Tier 0** | **Local Deterministic TypeScript Engine** | **`0.2ms \342\200\223 2.0ms`** | **`$0.00` (Zero Tokens)** | **100% Exact Arithmetic**: 5% EA Transfer Tax & break-even, Streamlined SBC Item Score summation (`1.25x` Regular / `1.50x` Pristine Holographic multipliers), 33/33 Chemistry links, AcceleRATE 2.0 thresholds, and Isolated vs. Synthesized Stat math. |\n| **Tier 1** | **`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`** | **`~180ms \342\200\223 350ms`** | **Ultra-Low (~1x Baseline)** | **High-Throughput / Low-Latency Parsing & Fast Q&A**: Normalizing pasted Web App / Paletools JSON, extracting partial manual club updates, and answering single-step FC 27 mechanics questions (e.g., 3 PlayStyles+ cap, Gallery rules) without search overhead. |\n| **Tier 2** | **`gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch`** | **`~450ms \342\200\223 950ms`** | **Low-Moderate (~3x Baseline)** | **Live Web Grounding & $T=0$ Fact Verification**: Verifying live **FUTBIN FC 27 Xbox Series S** Buy-Now prices, confirming **2026/27 FotMob** club transfers (e.g., Rodri at FC Barcelona), checking the 18:00 UK Daily Content Drop, and probing Antigravity `v2.25` / Title Update `#3.1` notes. |\n| **Tier 3** | **`gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`)** | **`~2,200ms \342\200\223 5,500ms`** | **Premium Paid (~15x Baseline)** | **Frontier Multi-Constraint Reasoning & `generative_ui` Synthesis**: Comparing Branching Evolution pathways (`Branch A` vs. `Branch B` + Role++ Meta Score), solving multi-constraint SBC/squad puzzles under your **`35,000` Coin budget**, forecasting 24H/7D Xbox Series S price curves, and generating interactive GenUI widgets. |\n| **Audio** | **`gemini-3.5-transcribe`** | **`~300ms \342\200\223 600ms`** | **Audio-Specific** | **Hands-Free Controller Voice Dictation**: Transcribing spoken Xbox Series S pack pulls, coin updates, or tactical queries while holding your Xbox controller. |\n\n### Auto-Router Heuristic & Telemetry Badge\n- **Automatic Classifier (`server.ts` & Client Router)**:\n  - When the user selects **`AUTO (Smart Cost/Latency Router)`** (default), the classifier inspects the request intent:\n    - *Pure Math / Tax / Score Filter* $\\rightarrow$ Handled locally in **Tier 0 (`<2ms`, `$0.00`)**.\n    - *Live Price / Transfer / Patch / 18:00 Drop Verification* $\\rightarrow$ Routed to **Tier 2 (`gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch`)**.\n    - *Multi-Branch Evolution / 35k Budget Squad Optimization / Chart Forecast / Generative UI Widget* $\\rightarrow$ Routed to **Tier 3 (`gemini-4-argon` `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`)**.\n    - *Quick Mechanics Q&A / JSON Parsing* $\\rightarrow$ Routed to **Tier 1 (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`)**.\n- **Manual Override Bar**: Users can switch from **`AUTO (Smart Router)`** to force **`Tier 1 (3.1 Flash Lite)`**, **`Tier 2 (3.8 Flash + Search)`**, or **`Tier 3 (4 Argon HIGH)`** at any time.\n- **Visible Routing Receipt**: Every AI output displays a crisp inline telemetry header:\n  `Tier [0/1/2/3] \302\267 [Model Name] \302\267 [Latency in ms] \302\267 Reason: [Why this tier was chosen for cost/latency/benchmark fit]`.\n\n---\n\n## 3. User Experience & Visual Design\n\n- **Key User Flows**:\n  1. **Zero-Guessing Launch & Partial Club Sync (`35,000` Coins Confirmed)**:\n     - Header and Club KPI cards display **Xbox Series S Coins: `35,000`**, while **FC Points (`\342\200\224`)**, **Rivals Division (`\342\200\224`)**, **Gallery Level (`\342\200\224`)**, **Daily SP (`\342\200\224 / 850`)**, **Club Name (`\342\200\224`)**, and **Owned Cards (`0 Synced`)** render as clean blank indicators (`\342\200\224`).\n     - The **Xbox Series S Club Sync Modal** opens immediately on launch so you can optionally fill in any blank attribute (or click **\"Continue with 35,000 Coins \342\200\224 Keep Unknowns Blank\"**).\n  2. **Strict Separation of \"FC 27 Xbox Series S Market Catalog\" vs. \"My Club\"**:\n     - The **My Club Inventory & SBC Duplicate Storage** table starts completely empty (`0 Owned Cards`) with an action button to add or sync only the cards you actually own.\n     - The **FC 27 Xbox Series S Market Catalog** provides verified 2026/27 reference cards (with a **\"Mark as Owned in My Club\"** toggle and a **\"Verify Live Xbox Series S Price @ T=0\"** trigger for any unverified field).\n  3. **Interactive Generative UI (`generative_ui` Skill) & Smart Router**:\n     - Toggling **Generative UI Mode (`SKILL.md`)** in the AI & MCP view renders interactive sliders and comparators calibrated to your **`35,000` Coin budget**, accompanied by the **Smart Router Telemetry Receipt** (`Tier`, `Latency ms`, and `Reason`).\n- **Visual Identity & Theme**:\n  - *Aesthetic Direction*: High-Contrast Console Tactical & Financial Terminal (`#090d16` Pitch Obsidian canvas, `#111827` slate panels, `#00ff87` FC 27 Pitch Emerald primary accent, `#fbbf24` Holographic Gold accent).\n  - *Typography & Hierarchy*: `Outfit` for headers, `Plus Jakarta Sans` for dense UI copy, and `JetBrains Mono` (`tabular-nums`) for all Xbox Series S coin figures, `ms` latency counters, and `\342\200\224` blank indicators.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy *(Technical Reference)*\n\n```\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200