            lines {
              text: "## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 1: Strict Nullable Schema (`coins = 35000`, All Other Club Fields `null` / `[]`)**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Hard-enforce `coins: 35000` as the only populated default, with `clubName: null`, `fifaPoints: null`, `rivalsDivision: null`, `galleryLevel: null`, `dailySp: null`, `ownedPlayerIds: []`, `duplicateStorageIds: []`, and `trackedInvestments: []`. Remove any \"sample club dump\" that invents fake club stats."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Directly honors *\"i have 35k coins currently. also dont make guesses or fill in the gaps for anything about my club e.g. gallery level, cards i own, fifa points, division im in.\"*"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 2: Strict Separation Between Xbox Series S Market Catalog and Personal Club Inventory**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Keep the FC 27 Xbox Series S reference catalog strictly for market price charts and Gameplay Synthesis testing. Your personal **My Club Inventory** table starts empty (`0 cards`) until you explicitly sync or add cards you actually own."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Prevents the SBC solver, Match Stacker, or Gemini 4 Argon advisor from hallucinating that you own high-rated cards when solving challenges."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 3: Firestore Schema Update for Nullable Club Fields & `rivalsDivision`**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Update `firebase-blueprint.json`, `firestore.rules`, and `firebaseAndDriveService.ts` so `users/{userId}` accepts `null` for unknown club fields (`clubName`, `fifaPoints`, `rivalsDivision`, `galleryLevel`, `dailySp`) rather than forcing dummy integers."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Ensures cloud persistence never coerces blank (`null`) fields into fake `0` or `1` values."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Aesthetic Direction*: High-Contrast Console Tactical & Financial Terminal (`#090d16` Pitch Obsidian canvas, `#111827` slate panels, `#00ff87` FC 27 Pitch Emerald primary accent, `#fbbf24` Holographic Gold accent)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
