            lines {
              text: "  - `{ coins: number | null; fifaPoints: number | null; galleryLevel: number | null; rivalsDivision: string | null; dailySp: number | null; clubName: string | null; ownedPlayerIds: string[]; duplicateStorageIds: string[] }` initialized to `{ coins: 35000, fifaPoints: null, galleryLevel: null, rivalsDivision: null, dailySp: null, clubName: null, ownedPlayerIds: [], duplicateStorageIds: [] }`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Every UI display helper (`formatNullableMetric`) renders `\'\342\200\224\'` whenever a value is `null`, and the AI system instructions in `server.ts` explicitly forbid guessing or filling in any `null` or empty club field."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Launch Sync & Partial Update Modal**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Opens on initial mount so you can enter or dictate any additional fields you wish (or click **\"Continue with 35,000 Coins\"** to close immediately). Any input box left empty remains `null` (`\342\200\224`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **35k Budget Filter & Xbox Series S Market Verification**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Highlights affordable Xbox Series S flips, Holographic arbitrage cards (`86 Regular Holographic @ 10,900 Coins`, `88 Pristine Holographic @ 27,500 Coins`), and Streamlined SBCs that fit within your **`35,000` Coin balance**."
