              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Accepts `{ query, requestedMode: \'AUTO\' | \'TIER_1_LITE\' | \'TIER_2_FLASH_SEARCH\' | \'TIER_3_ARGON_HIGH\', useSearchGrounding, clubContext, clientT0 }`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Measures exact server execution time (`latencyMs`), selects the optimal model when `requestedMode === \'AUTO\'`, enforces the **Zero-Guessing Personal Club & Xbox Series S Only Contract**, and returns `{ text, modelUsed, tierLabel, latencyMs, routingReason, estimatedCostTier, genUiWidget }`."
