  planner_response {
    response: "### Executive Summary\nThe **FC 27 UT App (Xbox Series S Console Edition)** is compiled and running with your confirmed **`35,000` Xbox Series S Coin balance**, strict **Zero-Guessing Blank Club Defaults (`\342\200\224`)** for every other personal club metric, the **5-Tier Smart Model Router**, and the **Antigravity `v2.25` `generative_ui` Skill** (`C:\\Users\\Kit\\.gemini\\antigravity\\builtin\\skills\\generative_ui\\SKILL.md`).\n\n---\n\n### Key Architectural Updates\n\n1. **Zero-Guessing Xbox Series S Club State (`35,000` Coins Confirmed, All Else Blank `\342\200\224`)**\n   - **Confirmed Balance**: Initialized to **`35,000` Xbox Series S Coins**, automatically filtering SBCs, 5G Bid-Flipping targets, and FUT Gallery \"Rent-and-Flip\" candidates to your `35k` budget.\n   - **Strict Blank Defaults (`null` / `[]`)**: **FIFA Points (`\342\200\224`)**, **Rivals Division (`\342\200\224`)**, **FUT Gallery Level (`\342\200\224`)**, **Daily SP (`\342\200\224 / 850`)**, **Club Name (`\342\200\224`)**, **Owned Cards (`0 Synced`)**, **SBC Duplicate Storage (`0 Synced`)**, and **Tracked Investments (`0 Logged`)** remain strictly blank until you explicitly enter or sync them.\n   - **Immediate Launch Club Sync Modal**: Opens on startup with 4 onboarding paths (**Manual / Voice Dictation via `gemini-3.5-transcribe`**, **Companion Web App / Paletools JSON Paste**, **Antigravity `v2.25` `/browser` MCP**, and **Firestore / Google Drive Restore**)\342\200\224or 1-click **\"Continue with 35,000 Coins (Keep Others Blank \342\200\224)\"**.\n\n2. **5-Tier Smart Model Router (Auto-Route by Complexity + Manual Override + Telemetry)**\n   - **Tier 0 (`0.2ms\342\200\2232.0ms` \302\267 `$0.00` Cost)**: Local deterministic TypeScript engine for 5% EA Tax, Streamlined SBC Item Score (`1.25x` Regular Holo / `1.50x` Pristine Holo multipliers), 33/33 Chemistry, AcceleRATE 2.0, and Isolated vs. Synthesized Stat math.\n   - **Tier 1 (`~180ms\342\200\223350ms` \302\267 `1x` Cost \302\267 `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`)**: High-speed, ultra-cheap single-step FC 27 mechanics lookups and JSON normalization.\n   - **Tier 2 (`~450ms\342\200\223950ms` \302\267 `~3x` Cost \302\267 `gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch`)**: Live $T=0$ **EA Sports FC 27 Xbox Series S** price verification, **2026/27 FotMob** transfer checks (e.g., Rodri at FC Barcelona), and 18:00 UK drop checks.\n   - **Tier 3 (`~2.2s\342\200\2235.5s` \302\267 `~15x` Cost \302\267 `gemini-4-argon` `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`)**: Reserved for multi-branch Evolution trade-offs, `35,000` Coin Xbox Series S squad/SBC optimization, and **Antigravity `v2.25` `generative_ui`** interactive widget synthesis.\n   - **Live Telemetry Receipts**: Every AI response displays the **Selected Tier & Model**, **Measured Latency (`ms`)**, and **Routing Reason**.\n\n3. **Strict FC 27 Xbox Series S Verification Gate**\n   - Separates the **FC 27 Xbox Series S Market Catalog** from **My Owned Club Cards**. Any custom card or unverified FC 27 attribute remains **blank (`\342\200\224`)** until verified via the 1-click **\"Verify FC 27 Xbox\"** live search trigger."
