  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Title Search**\n\nI\'m now integrating the `gemini-api` skill, specifically `gemini-3.8-flash`, along with the `googleSearch` tool, to improve the grounding for the title update patch search. This will facilitate a more precise and accurate approach. I will maintain a server-side proxy route for this component.\n\n\n**Developing Endpoint Functionality**\n\nI\'m focusing on creating the `/api/gemini/fetch-patch-notes` endpoint in `server.ts`. This involves integrating `gemini-3.8-flash` and the `googleSearch` tool to retrieve and parse the latest EA Sports FC 27 title updates, paying close attention to gameplay mechanics changes like passing accuracy, sprint speed, goalie behavior, AcceleRATE 2.0, and Roles++. I need to make sure this is robust.\n\n\n**Implementing Patch Tracker**\n\nI\'m now building the `/src/components/GameMechanicsPatchTracker.tsx` component. It\'ll feature a dynamic \"Fetch Latest FC 27 Patch Notes\" button to kick off searches with `gemini-3.8-flash` and `googleSearch`, returning structured data. I\'m focusing on categorized mechanic filters and patch history cards displaying update versions, release dates, impact tags, and mechanic breakdowns, including meta takeaways. I\'ll display the grounding URLs extracted from the google search results.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_326522"
