  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing the Gemini API**\n\nI\'m currently integrating the `/api/gemini/fetch-patch-notes` route into `/server.ts`. I\'m focused on defining its search parameters and return structure. I\'m planning to use `gemini-3.8-flash` for this.\n\n\n**Analyzing Game Mechanics**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the specific gameplay mechanics for analysis, particularly passing accuracy, sprint speed, and goalie behavior within the context of EA Sports FC 27. I\'m building a prompt for the Google Search tool that specifies \"Title Updates and Live Tuning notes\" as the source and instructs a focus on the mechanics of the game. I\'m also planning to extract grounding metadata links per skill rules.\n\n\n**Reviewing Game Updates**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the recent title updates for EA Sports FC 27. I\'m focusing on AcceleRATE 2.0 changes (breakaway acceleration, sprint sustain, and the Controlled Lengthy curve), goalie behavior (1v1 reaction time, near-post shot stopping, Sweeper Keeper++), defensive recovery, and player roles (Inside Forward++, Deep-Lying Playmaker++, Shadow Striker++). I am organizing the details by effective date and creating a competitive console (Xbox Series S) analysis.\n\n\n"
