    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Goal**: Build and maintain the **FC 27 UT App (Pro Console Edition)**, an elite strategic director, club analyst, and market intelligence engine for EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Xbox Series S Console Market) anchored to British Time (`Europe/London` BST/GMT at $T=0$) and orchestrated via **Google Antigravity 2.0 Desktop App (`v2.25`)**.\n   - **Latest User Request**: Create a **\"Game Mechanics & Patch Tracker\"** component in the **Gameplay Synthesis View** that fetches and displays the latest EA Sports FC 27 title update notes via Google Search (`gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch`), highlighting changes to gameplay mechanics like **passing accuracy**, **sprint speed / AcceleRATE 2.0**, and **goalie behavior / 1v1 reactions**.\n   - **Core Invariants & Strict User Constraints**:\n     - **Confirmed 35,000 Coin Balance**: The user confirmed they currently have **`35,000` Coins** (`35k`).\n     - **Zero Hallucination / Zero Gap-Filling Policy**: NEVER guess, invent, or fill in gaps for any personal club attribute (**Cards Owned / Starting XI = `[]`**, **SBC Duplicate Storage = `[]`**, **FIFA Points = `null` (`\342\200\224`)**, **FUT Gallery Level = `null` (`\342\200\224`)**, **Rivals Division = `null` (`\342\200\224`)**, **Daily SP = `null` (`\342\200\224 / 850 SP`)**, **Club Name = `null` (`\342\200\224`)**, and **Tracked Investments = `[]`**). All start strictly blank until the user explicitly inputs or syncs them.\n     - **Xbox Series S Console Market Only**: All market calculations, price charts, and solver filters must reflect Xbox Series S (Console Cross-Play market). Zero PC or Switch market prices.\n     - **FC 27 Season & Edition Lock (Anti-Autoregressive Transfer Law)**: All data must be verified 2026/27 season (FotMob/FUTBIN FC 27 Console ground truth; e.g., Rodri at FC Barcelona). Zero FC 24/25/26 legacy contamination; unverified fields remain blank (`\342\200\224`).\n     - **5-Tier Smart Model Router**: Auto-routes by task complexity across Tier 0 (`<2ms` Local TypeScript Math), Tier 1 (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`), Tier 2 (`gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch`), Tier 3 (`gemini-4-argon` `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`), and Audio Tier (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`), displaying `Tier \302\267 Latency (ms) \302\267 Reason` telemetry on responses.\n     - **Antigravity v2.25 Built-In `generative_ui` Skill**: Integrates `C:\\Users\\Kit\\.gemini\\antigravity\\builtin\\skills\\generative_ui\\SKILL.md` (mirrored at `/.agents/skills/generative_ui/SKILL.md`).\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Backend Route Added**: Updated `/server.ts` with `/api/gemini/fetch-patch-notes` using `gemini-3.8-flash` with `{ tools: [{ googleSearch: {} }] }` and Europe/London $T=0$ context, searching specifically for EA FC 27 Title Updates / Live Tuning Pitch Notes with detailed sections for Passing Accuracy, Sprint Speed & AcceleRATE 2.0, Goalie Behavior & Reactions, and Defending / Roles++ changes, returning extracted grounding URLs (`groundingChunks`).\n   - **Firestore Rules & Blueprint Deployed**: Updated `/firebase-blueprint.json` and `/firestore.rules` (deploying rules via `rpc_action` `DeployRules`) supporting nullable blank club fields and `consolePlatform: \'Xbox Series S\'`.\n   - **Data Grounding Cleaned**: Updated `/src/data/fc27ConsoleData.ts` so `FC27_CONSOLE_PLAYERS` start with `inClubInventory: false`, `inDuplicateStorage: false`, and `isUntradeable: false` (zero assumed owned cards), and `FC27_GALLERY_SETS` start with `registeredCount: 0` / `Unranked`.\n   - **In Progress / Immediate Next File**: Creating the dedicated UI component `/src/components/GameMechanicsPatchTracker.tsx` and mounting it inside `/src/components/GameplaySynthesisView.tsx`.\n\n3. **Key Findings & Technical Decisions**\n   - **Search Grounding Requirement**: When using `gemini-3.8-flash` with `googleSearch`, grounding chunk URLs (`groundingChunks.web.uri` & `title`) must be extracted and rendered as clickable external links.\n   - **Zero-Guessing Enforcement**: In `GameplaySynthesisView.tsx` and `App.tsx`, squad chemistry and player profiles must cleanly handle the user having 0 synced cards (displaying blank or catalog reference) without assuming they own 91 Rodri or 89 Yamal.\n   - **Mechanics Focus for FC 27 TU #3.1**:\n     - *Passing*: Vision curves, pinged pass receiver lock-on, first-touch error under pressure.\n     - *Sprint / AcceleRATE 2.0*: Controlled Lengthy vs Explosive breakaway sprint sustain, second-half stamina decay impact.\n     - *Goalie*: Near-post shot stopping buff, 1v1 reflex animations, Sweeper Keeper++ rush-out speed.\n     - *Roles++*: Inside Forward++ diagonal runs, Deep-Lying Playmaker++ first-time pass angles.\n\n4. **Active Context**\n   - Server runs on Express + Vite (`server.ts`) on port 3000.\n   - User Firestore DB: `ai-studio-fc27utapp-2a7c5f08-d758-4a0e-bf87-d352fd259607`.\n   - Paid API key is configured and active.\n   - User confirmed 35k coins (`coins: 35000`); all other club fields are `null` (`\342\200\224`).\n\n5. **Next Steps (Priority Order)**\n   1. **Create `/src/components/GameMechanicsPatchTracker.tsx`**:\n      - Fetch trigger calling `/api/gemini/fetch-patch-notes` with live $T=0$ search grounding.\n      - Mechanics filter tabs (`All Mechanics`, `Passing & Vision`, `Sprint Speed & AcceleRATE 2.0`, `Goalie Behavior & 1v1s`, `Roles++ & Defending`).\n      - Impact cards highlighting Buffs, Nerfs, and Tuned mechanics.\n      - Displays live Title Update version (e.g. TU #3.1 / Live Tuning #4), effective date, and extracted Google Search source links.\n      - Competitive Pro Console (Xbox Series S) tactical takeaways.\n   2. **Integrate into `/src/components/GameplaySynthesisView.tsx`**:\n      - Add the `GameMechanicsPatchTracker` component at the top/prominent section of Domain 2 (`GAMEPLAY`), allowing users to toggle between viewing the live Patch Tracker and testing the Additive Gameplay Synthesis Lab.\n   3. **Compile & Verify**:\n      - Run `compile_applet` to ensure zero TypeScript/bundle errors.\n      - Restart dev server if needed.\n\n6. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Never populate, guess, or pre-fill personal club data (owned cards, duplicate storage, FIFA points, gallery level, division) \342\200\224 keep strictly `null` / `\342\200\224` unless entered by the user.\n   - Lock all market references to Xbox Series S console market.\n   - Strictly ground all players and mechanics in FC 27 (2026/27 season) \342\200\224 zero FC 24/25/26 data.\n</summary>"
