            lines {
              text: "An authoritative **EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team (Xbox Series S Console Market)** tactical, club, and market terminal orchestrated via **Google Antigravity 2.0 Desktop App (`v2.25`)** and anchored dynamically to **British Time (`Europe/London` BST/GMT at $T=0$)**. This revision locks in your confirmed **`35,000` Xbox Series S Coin balance**, keeps every other personal club attribute strictly **blank (`null` / `\342\200\224` / `[]`)** with zero guessing, enforces a **Strict FC 27 Xbox Series S Verification Gate**, integrates the **Antigravity `v2.25` Built-In `generative_ui` Skill** (`C:\\Users\\Kit\\.gemini\\antigravity\\builtin\\skills\\generative_ui\\SKILL.md`), and introduces a **5-Tier Smart Model Router** that automatically routes tasks by complexity, latency, benchmark strength, and token cost (with manual override and live `ms` telemetry)."
