            }
            lines {
              text: ">    - **All Other Personal Club Fields Start Strictly Blank (`null` / `\342\200\224` / `[]`)**: The app never guesses or fills in gaps for **FIFA Points (`\342\200\224`)**, **FUT Gallery Level (`\342\200\224`)**, **Rivals Division (`\342\200\224`)**, **Daily SP (`\342\200\224`)**, **Club Name (`\342\200\224`)**, **Cards You Own (`[]` / 0 cards)**, **SBC Duplicate Storage (`[]` / 0 cards)**, or **Tracked Investments (`[]` / 0 flips)**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: ">    - **Immediate Launch Club Sync Modal**: Opens on launch so you can optionally populate any blank field via **Antigravity `v2.25` `/browser` MCP**, **Companion Web App / Paletools JSON**, **Voice Dictation (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`) / Manual Entry**, or **Firestore / Google Drive Restore**\342\200\224or click **\"Continue with 35,000 Coins (Keep Others Blank)\"**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "> 2. **Strict FC 27 Xbox Series S Verification Gate**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: ">    - Only the **Xbox Series S (Console Cross-Play) Market** matters. Any player stat, Xbox price, or SBC detail not 100% verified for **EA Sports FC 27 (2026/27 Season)** is left **blank (`\342\200\224`)** with a 1-click **\"Verify Live (FC 27 Xbox Series S @ T=0)\"** trigger. Zero FC 24/25/26 or PC market contamination."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "> 3. **Confirmed Smart Model Router (`AUTO` by Complexity + Manual Override + Tier/Latency/Reason Display)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: ">    - Automatically routes every calculation and prompt across **Tier 0 (`<2ms` Local TypeScript Math)**, **Tier 1 (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`)**, **Tier 2 (`gemini-3.8-flash` + `googleSearch`)**, **Tier 3 (`gemini-4-argon` `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`)**, and **Audio Tier (`gemini-3.5-transcribe`)** while displaying the **Model Tier, Execution Latency (`ms`), and Routing Reason** on every response."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
