            lines {
              text: "## 1. Overview & Core Concept"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **What It Does**: Delivers a two-domain (**`1. MENUS`** & **`2. GAMEPLAY`**) EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team strategic companion exclusively for the **Xbox Series S Console Market**, calibrated to your **`35,000` Coin budget**, with zero hallucinated club state and intelligent multi-model cost/latency routing."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Target Audience / Persona**: Competitive **Xbox Series S** EA Sports FC 27 Ultimate Team player operating across an **Asus ZenBook UX482** (14\" primary display + `1920x515` ScreenPad Plus secondary touch strip) and mobile (`375px\342\200\223430px`) over a 5G connection."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Key Value**: Combines 100% data honesty (never assuming you own cards or inventing your Division/Gallery Level) with optimal speed and API economics\342\200\224executing deterministic math in `<2ms` for `$0.00`, routing quick lookups to sub-350ms `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, live FC 27 Xbox Series S market verification to `gemini-3.8-flash`, and reserving `gemini-4-argon` (`ThinkingLevel.HIGH`) strictly for deep multi-constraint strategy and Generative UI synthesis."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
