  planner_response {
    response: "### Game Mechanics & Patch Tracker Deployed (Gameplay Synthesis View)\n\nThe **Game Mechanics & Patch Tracker** is now active in **Domain 2: GAMEPLAY**, providing live, Google Search-grounded tracking of EA Sports FC 27 Title Updates and Live Tuning notes for the **Xbox Series S Console engine** anchored to British Time (`Europe/London` $T=0$).\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities Built\n\n1. **Live Grounded Search Trigger (`/api/gemini/fetch-patch-notes`)**:\n   - Queries Google Search via `gemini-3.8-flash` for the latest FC 27 Title Updates and Live Tuning pitch notes.\n   - Extracts clickable source links (`groundingChunks`) directly to official EA Pitch Notes and updates.\n   - Displays real-time model routing telemetry: **Model Tier (`Tier 2 \302\267 gemini-3.8-flash + Google Search Grounding`)**, execution latency in **ms**, and routing rationale.\n\n2. **Core Mechanics Tracked with Numerical Indicators**:\n   - **Passing Accuracy & Vision**: Ground through ball receiver lock accuracy (`+12%`), pinged pass trajectory consistency, and reception deflection under physical pressure (`+18% error penalty` without First Touch+ / Press Proven+).\n   - **Sprint Speed & AcceleRATE 2.0**: Top-end sprint speed retention over 35+ yard runs for Controlled Lengthy archetypes (`+14% sustain`), contrasted with Explosive 0\342\200\2235 yard initial burst adjustments.\n   - **Goalie Behavior & 1v1s**: Near-post shot stopping save probability (`+22%`), reduced acute angle power shot exploits, and Sweeper Keeper++ rush-out acceleration (`+15%`).\n   - **Defending & Tackling**: Standing tackle recovery stun time (`-30% lag` on clean manual tackles with Anticipate+), rewarding controller timing on Xbox Series S.\n   - **31 Roles++ AI**: Inside Forward++ diagonal inverted runs into center-back blind spots and Deep-Lying Playmaker++ first-time pass angles out of high press.\n\n3. **Console-Specific & Tactical Counterplay Insights**:\n   - **\360\237\216\256 Xbox Series S Engine Impact**: Details how analog stick responsiveness, 60/120 FPS refresh, and controller triggers interact with the patch.\n   - **Tactical Counterplay / Squad Adjustment**: Specific instructions on chemistry styles (e.g., Shadow on fullbacks to track Controlled Lengthy wingers) and player instructions.\n\n4. **Dual View Modes & Filtering**:\n   - **Mechanics Grid**: Interactive card grid with category pills (`Passing`, `Sprint`, `Goalie`, `Defending`, `Roles++`), live keyword search, and delta badges (`BUFF`, `NERF`, `TUNED`).\n   - **Live Pitch Notes Report**: Structured markdown report directly from the live web query with extracted source link cards."
    modified_response: "### Game Mechanics & Patch Tracker Deployed (Gameplay Synthesis View)\n\nThe **Game Mechanics & Patch Tracker** is now active in **Domain 2: GAMEPLAY**, providing live, Google Search-grounded tracking of EA Sports FC 27 Title Updates and Live Tuning notes for the **Xbox Series S Console engine** anchored to British Time (`Europe/London` $T=0$).\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities Built\n\n1. **Live Grounded Search Trigger (`/api/gemini/fetch-patch-notes`)**:\n   - Queries Google Search via `gemini-3.8-flash` for the latest FC 27 Title Updates and Live Tuning pitch notes.\n   - Extracts clickable source links (`groundingChunks`) directly to official EA Pitch Notes and updates.\n   - Displays real-time model routing telemetry: **Model Tier (`Tier 2 \302\267 gemini-3.8-flash + Google Search Grounding`)**, execution latency in **ms**, and routing rationale.\n\n2. **Core Mechanics Tracked with Numerical Indicators**:\n   - **Passing Accuracy & Vision**: Ground through ball receiver lock accuracy (`+12%`), pinged pass trajectory consistency, and reception deflection under physical pressure (`+18% error penalty` without First Touch+ / Press Proven+).\n   - **Sprint Speed & AcceleRATE 2.0**: Top-end sprint speed retention over 35+ yard runs for Controlled Lengthy archetypes (`+14% sustain`), contrasted with Explosive 0\342\200\2235 yard initial burst adjustments.\n   - **Goalie Behavior & 1v1s**: Near-post shot stopping save probability (`+22%`), reduced acute angle power shot exploits, and Sweeper Keeper++ rush-out acceleration (`+15%`).\n   - **Defending & Tackling**: Standing tackle recovery stun time (`-30% lag` on clean manual tackles with Anticipate+), rewarding controller timing on Xbox Series S.\n   - **31 Roles++ AI**: Inside Forward++ diagonal inverted runs into center-back blind spots and Deep-Lying Playmaker++ first-time pass angles out of high press.\n\n3. **Console-Specific & Tactical Counterplay Insights**:\n   - **\360\237\216\256 Xbox Series S Engine Impact**: Details how analog stick responsiveness, 60/120 FPS refresh, and controller triggers interact with the patch.\n   - **Tactical Counterplay / Squad Adjustment**: Specific instructions on chemistry styles (e.g., Shadow on fullbacks to track Controlled Lengthy wingers) and player instructions.\n\n4. **Dual View Modes & Filtering**:\n   - **Mechanics Grid**: Interactive card grid with category pills (`Passing`, `Sprint`, `Goalie`, `Defending`, `Roles++`), live keyword search, and delta badges (`BUFF`, `NERF`, `TUNED`).\n   - **Live Pitch Notes Report**: Structured markdown report directly from the live web query with extracted source link cards."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\373\001\n\370\001\001i\024}\023$\231wp\246T\033\314\320\262\203\252\353\016\222\255\313\242\336B\227\t\275N\3736\272\037\341\233@\237\3631<\377\nZ\000}\252z\377@\312\325y\327\033qn\361a\207\375C\264\362(z\263\021\240J\031\264\316\366\303\201@~#\236\253\215\342\037z\020\255\304\370\232\365\203\355w\212>\305`\364\311\205\3251\321/\t\330\345\254Y\370\f\271mesa\363\317\017\221\260\020\217`\r\315|\242\031\304s\"\241\177\321F\000/\231\325SI\274&\032M9/\240\354zA.X/\231\027\234@\202\347M\f\023}\333\255\374\374\331\035\017A\245\353n\371i+\v\025\343\217UZ&\000\331\000\246V\260<)\261\355\036\240\272\201\362Dr\200V\005\370\215\367W&\3527\027\240\003\022\372\270?\360\246fQ\320ee\261\356;qA\245N\365\217m\205^\352\343%\337\3167d\363-"
